            "text": "[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9f-third-age-on-stage-acting-workshops-for-the-over-50s\\/\",\"id\":\"922\",\"name\":\"Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s\",\"title\":\"Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1784242800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/186207\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784293200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1784242800],\"times\":[1784293200],\"start_date\":\"1784293200\",\"end_date\":\"1784293200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"d3dFcGhUL0xWVkFtZU9FVkdBcnd4UT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 17 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"Learn new acting and performance skills. Veterans and beginners are welcome!Run by Dive In Associate, Cats Whiskers Community Arts, these weekly drama&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"63.4\",\"40.4\"],\"search_text\":\"Learn new acting and performance skills. Veterans and beginners are welcome!Run by Dive In Associate, Cats Whiskers Community Arts, these weekly drama workshops include voice and speech training, movement, improvisation, character creation and work with texts. They aim to improve self-confidence and memory in a relaxed and fun environment.\\u00a0\\u00a0Drama teacher and director Carol Allen from Cats Whiskers Community Arts has been teaching adult drama classes for over fifteen years, in which time her students have taken part in live performances at venues including Kensington Palace, the Drayton Arms Theatre and the Bush theatre. Students have also appeared in short films.\\u00a0 The Riverside group started in the midst of Covid in 2020 and members have written and performed short plays with Riverscribes, plus a full length revue, \\u201cThe Seven Ages of Us\\u201d and most recently an informal programme of sketches, poetry and song.\\u00a0\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/186207\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s Workshops & Classes  <h3>Learn new acting and performance skills. Veterans and beginners are welcome!<\\/h3><p>Run by Dive In Associate, <strong>Cats Whiskers Community Arts<\\/strong>, these weekly drama workshops include voice and speech training, movement, improvisation, character creation and work with texts. They aim to improve self-confidence and memory in a relaxed and fun environment.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Drama teacher and director<strong> Carol Allen<\\/strong> from Cats Whiskers Community Arts has been teaching adult drama classes for over fifteen years, in which time her students have taken part in live performances at venues including Kensington Palace, the Drayton Arms Theatre and the Bush theatre. Students have also appeared in short films.&nbsp; The Riverside group started in the midst of Covid in 2020 and members have written and performed short plays with Riverscribes, plus a full length revue, \\u201cThe Seven Ages of Us\\u201d and most recently an informal programme of sketches, poetry and song.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p> Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s  Learn new acting and performance skills. Veterans and beginners are welcome!Run by Dive In Associate, Cats Whiskers Community Arts, these weekly drama workshops include voice and speech training, movement, improvisation, character creation and work with texts. They aim to improve self-confidence and memory in a relaxed and fun environment.\\u00a0\\u00a0Drama teacher and director Carol Allen from Cats Whiskers Community Arts has been teaching adult drama classes for over fifteen years, in which time her students have taken part in live performances at venues including Kensington Palace, the Drayton Arms Theatre and the Bush theatre. Students have also appeared in short films.\\u00a0 The Riverside group started in the midst of Covid in 2020 and members have written and performed short plays with Riverscribes, plus a full length revue, \\u201cThe Seven Ages of Us\\u201d and most recently an informal programme of sketches, poetry and song.\\u00a0\\u00a0 Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/LL-rehearsal-room\\/\",\"id\":\"504\",\"name\":\