oming production, organising a table read, or want to invite guests to a sharing, our Rehearsal Room offers the ideal&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/46\\/b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3\\/w1200\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx230\\/cy8\\/cw793\\/ch792\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"60.5\",\"87.1\"],\"search_text\":\"Whether you're rehearsing an upcoming production, organising a table read, or want to invite guests to a sharing, our Rehearsal Room offers the ideal setup. Designed with flexibility in mind, this 100m\\u00b2 space is equipped with everything you need to bring your creative vision to life.\\u00a0Seamless, Stress-Free BookingOur new booking system is as simple as it gets \\u2013 no deposits, no back-and-forth emails, just a quick online payment with your credit card. Choose your slot, confirm your booking, and you\\u2019re all set!Daily Time Slots Available, 7 days a week:- 9 am - 1 pm- 2 pm - 6 pm- 7 pm - 11 pmFrom only \\u00a315\\/hr (\\u00a360 per slot), you get access to a versatile rehearsal room with everything you need for a productive session.\\u00a0Pricing\\u00a315\\/hr (\\u00a360 per slot)*\\u00a0*Please note, this system is for leftover slots for the current month, and does not apply to securing the room in advance. These rates are for private rehearsal space bookings and not for ticketed or private events. If you would like to enquire about hiring the space beyond a simple rehearsal please do so here: Rehearsal Room | Riverside Studios\\u00a0Room Highlights- Capacity: Comfortably accommodates up to 20 people.- Specifications: 102 m\\u00b2, frosted windows for privacy, but lots of natural light during the day.- Speaker available on request, subject to availability.- Furniture: Includes two trestle tables and eight stackable chairs, giving you the freedom to arrange the space as you need. You can bring additional pieces as required.- Access: An access code will be provided upon arrival.- Setup & Reset: Please ensure the room is left as you found it for the next guests. It is fully cleaned and serviced daily.- Vinyl floor (not carpet).- Suitable for music.- Ample power outlets.- Fully wheelchair accessible.- Pet-friendly.- Bathrooms down a very short corridor nearby.- Our delightful Bakery to keep you caffeinated\\/snacked during the day, and our Bar & Kitchen to keep you fed and watered after your full creative day.\\u00a0Why Choose Riverside Studios?Riverside Studios offers more than just space \\u2013 it\\u2019s a creative hub with an atmosphere designed to inspire and support your work. Our rehearsal room is versatile, easy to book, and affordable to help you focus on what matters most: your craft.For any questions or if you are interested in exclusive hire, long-term booking, or booking our spaces for corporate\\/other events, please get in touch with us at\\u00a0events@riversidestudios.co.uk\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Rehearsal Room Rehearsal Room   <p>Whether you're rehearsing an upcoming production, organising a table read, or want to invite guests to a sharing, our Rehearsal Room offers the ideal setup. Designed with flexibility in mind, this 100m\\u00b2 space is equipped with everything you need to bring your creative vision to life.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Seamless, Stress-Free Booking<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Our new booking system is as simple as it gets \\u2013 no deposits, no back-and-forth emails, just a quick online payment with your credit card. Choose your slot, confirm your booking, and you\\u2019re all set!<\\/p><p><i>Daily Time Slots Available, 7 days a week:<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>- 9 am - 1 pm<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>- 2 pm - 6 pm<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>- 7 pm - 11 pm<\\/i><\\/p><p>From only \\u00a315\\/hr (\\u00a360 per slot), you get access to a versatile rehearsal room with everything you need for a productive session.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Pricing<\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u00a315\\/hr (\\u00a360 per slot)*<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>*Please note, this system is for leftover slots for the current month, and does not apply to securing the room in advance. These rates are for private rehearsal space bookings and not for ticketed or private events. If you would like to enquire about hiring the space beyond a simple rehearsal please do so here: <\\/strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/hire-us-work-with-us\\/private-events-and-office-hire\\/rehearsal-room\\/\\\">Rehearsal Room | Riverside Studios<\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Room Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p><p>- Capacity: Comfortably accommodates up to 20 people.<\\/p><p>- Specifications: 102 m\\u00b2, frosted windows for privacy, but lots of natural light during the day.<\\/p><p>- Speaker available on request, subject to availability.<\\/p><p>- Furniture: Includes two trestle tables and eight stackable chairs, giving you the freedom to arrange the space as you need. You can bring additional pieces as required.<\\/p><p>- Access: An access code will be provided upon arrival.<\\/p><p>- Setup &amp; Reset: Please ensure the room is left as you found it for the next guests. It is fully cleaned and serviced daily.<\\/p><p>- Vinyl floor (not carpet).<\\/p><p>- Suitable for music.<\\/p><p>- Ample power outlets.<\\/p><p>- Fully wheelchair accessible.<\\/p><p>- Pet-friendly.<\\/p><p>- Bathrooms down a very short corridor nearby.<\\/p><p>- Our delightful Bakery to keep you caffeinated\\/snacked during the day, and our Bar &amp; Kitchen to keep you fed and watered after your full creative day.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Why Choose Riverside Studios?<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Riverside Studios offers more than just space \\u2013 it\\u2019s a creative hub with an atmosphere designed to inspire and support your work. Our rehearsal room is versatile, easy to book, and affordable to help you focus on what matters most: your craft.<\\/p><p>For any questions or if you are interested in exclusive hire, long-term booking, or booking our spaces for corporate\\/other events, please get in touch with us at&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:events@riversidestudios.co.uk\\\">events@riversidestudios.co.uk<\\/a><\\/p> Rehearsal Room  Whether you're rehearsing an upcoming production, organising a table read, or want to invite guests to a sharing, our Rehearsal Room offers the ideal setup. Designed with flexibility in mind, this 100m\\u00b2 space is equipped with everything you need to bring your creative vision to life.\\u00a0Seamless, Stress-Free BookingOur new booking system is as simple as it gets \\u2013 no deposits, no back-and-forth emails, just a quick online payment with your credit card. Choose your slot, confirm your booking, and you\\u2019re all set!Daily Time Slots Available, 7 days a week:- 9 am - 1 pm- 2 pm - 6 pm- 7 pm - 11 pmFrom only \\u00a315\\/hr (\\u00a360 per slot), you get access to a versatile rehearsal room with everything you need for a productive session.\\u00a0Pricing\\u00a315\\/hr (\\u00a360 per slot)*\\u00a0*Please note, this system is for leftover slots for the current month, and does not apply to securing the room in advance. These rates are for private rehearsal space bookings and not for ticketed or private events. If you would like to enquire about hiring the space beyond a simple rehearsal please do so here: Rehearsal Room | Riverside Studios\\u00a0Room Highlights- Capacity: Comfortably accommodates up to 20 people.- Specifications: 102 m\\u00b2, frosted windows for privacy, but lots of natural light during the day.- Speaker available on request, subject to availability.- Furniture: Includes two trestle tables and eight stackable chairs, giving you the freedom to arrange the space as you need. You can bring additional pieces as required.- Access: An access code will be provided upon arrival.- Setup & Reset: Please ensure the room is left as you found it for the next guests. It is fully cleaned and serviced daily.- Vinyl floor (not carpet).- Suitable for music.- Ample power outlets.- Fully wheelchair accessible.- Pet-friendly.- Bathrooms down a very short corridor nearby.- Our delightful Bakery to keep you caffeinated\\/snacked during the day, and our Bar & Kitchen to keep you fed and watered after your full creative day.\\u00a0Why Choose Riverside Studios?Riverside Studios offers more than just space \\u2013 it\\u2019s a creative hub with an atmosphere designed to inspire and support your work. Our rehearsal room is versatile, easy to book, and affordable to help you focus on what matters most: your craft.For any questions or if you are interested in exclusive hire, long-term booking, or booking our spaces for corporate\\/other events, please get in touch with us at\\u00a0events@riversidestudios.co.uk\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gv-bossa-nova-night-a-tribute-to-joao-gilberto-by-mario-bakuna\\/\",\"id\":\"965\",\"name\":\"Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna\",\"title\":\"Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Music\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1783724400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/218201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783793700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1783724400],\"times\":[1783793700],\"start_date\":\"1783793700\",\"end_date\":\"1783793700\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"cUduTEFRRnRaNzFXbGs0Rzg1eGxydz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 11 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"Featuring Mario Bakuna on Acoustic Guitar and VocalsFollowing sold-out performances across the UK, Portugal, France, Spain, and the Netherlands, Mario&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"54.1\",\"27.4\"],\"search_text\":\"Featuring Mario Bakuna on Acoustic Guitar and VocalsFollowing sold-out performances across the UK, Portugal, France, Spain, and the Netherlands, Mario Bakuna is delighted to bring this special concert to the Riverside Studios.Join him in celebrating the legacy of Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto, the legendary Brazilian musician and pioneering father of Bossa Nova in the late 1950s. In this heartfelt tribute, Mario Bakuna presents reinterpretations of Gilberto\\u2019s work alongside his own original compositions. Audiences can expect a rich blend of traditional samba elements, syncopated rhythms of plucked chords, and the breezy sophistication that defines Bossa Nova.\\u00a0Mario Bakuna is a Brazilian composer, arranger, vocalist, and guitarist with over 20 years of professional experience, currently based in London, UK. Well known for his deep exploration of traditional Brazilian rhythms, samba, jazz, and bossa nova, Mario focuses on both original compositions and fresh arrangements of works by iconic artists like Tom Jobim, Dorival Caymmi, Paulo Moura, and Jo\\u00e3o Donato. In recent years, he has also dedicated his research and performance to reinterpreting Samba Jazz, a genre that emerged in 1950s Rio de Janeiro through the work of artists like Luiz E\\u00e7a, Tamba Trio, and Edson Machado. This style blends Brazilian standards with sophisticated harmonies influenced by the post\\u2013bossa nova movement.Driven by a passion for musical exploration, Mario moved to Europe to deepen his research and expand his artistic horizons. Since settling in London, he has collaborated with artists such as Jean Toussaint, Liam Noble, Ricardo dos Santos, Edmundo Carneiro, Cacau Queiroz, Alain Jean-Marie, Dudu Penz, and Fil\\u00f3 Machado. He has since become a prominent figure and key reference in the UK\\u2019s Brazilian jazz scene, performing extensively across Europe and beyond at renowned venues and international festivals.His albums Where Rio de Janeiro Meets Bahia and Brazilian Landscapes highlight his ability to fuse traditional roots with a contemporary musical sensibility. With sold-out concerts and critical acclaim, these projects have toured across 20 European countries, as well as Brazil, Canada, Madagascar, Egypt, Kazakhstan, and Azerbaijan\\u2014captivating audiences around the world.\\u00a0\\u201cMario Bakuna, a sparkling guitarist, plays with palpable feeling - his virtuosic fluency on the fretboard is controlled and flourishes are perfectly placed. His voice has a texture like heavy cloth\\u201d. (Songlines Magazine)\\u201cMario Bakuna, a man who exudes music. (\\u2026) \\u2018vocals\\u2019 doesn\\u2019t begin to do him justice: his expressive range and the precision with which he was able to deploy it was truly the band\\u2019s fifth instrument. \\u00a0(\\u2026) And he did this while playing guitar with precision and finesse. (\\u2026) his solos were a further source of amazement, his technique somewhere between finger-picking style and classical. His solo introduction to a Baden Powell number made a hash of any attempt at a definition.\\u201d (The Whitman Review, Wakefield Jazz)\\u00a0Website: https:\\/\\/www.mariobakuna.comFacebook: https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/MarioBakunaMusicianInstagram: https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/mariobakunaYouTube: https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/c\\/mariobakunaListen:\\u00a0https:\\/\\/mariobakuna.bandcamp.com\\u00a0Video sample:\\u00a0https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=i8f5jxuzASE\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/218201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"113\"],\"search\":\"Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna Music  <p><i>Featuring Mario Bakuna on Acoustic Guitar and Vocals<\\/i><\\/p><p>Following sold-out performances across the UK, Portugal, France, Spain, and the Netherlands, Mario Bakuna is delighted to bring this special concert to the Riverside Studios.<\\/p><p>Join him in celebrating the legacy of Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto, the legendary Brazilian musician and pioneering father of Bossa Nova in the late 1950s. In this heartfelt tribute, Mario Bakuna presents reinterpretations of Gilberto\\u2019s work alongside his own original compositions. Audiences can expect a rich blend of traditional samba elements, syncopated rhythms of plucked chords, and the breezy sophistication that defines Bossa Nova.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Mario Bakuna<\\/strong> is a Brazilian composer, arranger, vocalist, and guitarist with over 20 years of professional experience, currently based in London, UK. Well known for his deep exploration of traditional Brazilian rhythms, samba, jazz, and bossa nova, Mario focuses on both original compositions and fresh arrangements of works by iconic artists like Tom Jobim, Dorival Caymmi, Paulo Moura, and Jo\\u00e3o Donato. In recent years, he has also dedicated his research and performance to reinterpreting Samba Jazz, a genre that emerged in 1950s Rio de Janeiro through the work of artists like Luiz E\\u00e7a, Tamba Trio, and Edson Machado. This style blends Brazilian standards with sophisticated harmonies influenced by the post\\u2013bossa nova movement.<\\/p><p>Driven by a passion for musical exploration, Mario moved to Europe to deepen his research and expand his artistic horizons. Since settling in London, he has collaborated with artists such as Jean Toussaint, Liam Noble, Ricardo dos Santos, Edmundo Carneiro, Cacau Queiroz, Alain Jean-Marie, Dudu Penz, and Fil\\u00f3 Machado. He has since become a prominent figure and key reference in the UK\\u2019s Brazilian jazz scene, performing extensively across Europe and beyond at renowned venues and international festivals.<\\/p><p>His albums <i>Where Rio de Janeiro Meets Bahia<\\/i> and <i>Brazilian Landscapes<\\/i> highlight his ability to fuse traditional roots with a contemporary musical sensibility. With sold-out concerts and critical acclaim, these projects have toured across 20 European countries, as well as Brazil, Canada, Madagascar, Egypt, Kazakhstan, and Azerbaijan\\u2014captivating audiences around the world.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201c<i>Mario Bakuna, a sparkling guitarist, plays with palpable feeling - his virtuosic fluency on the fretboard is controlled and flourishes are perfectly placed. His voice has a texture like heavy cloth\\u201d. (Songlines Magazine)<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>\\u201cMario Bakuna, a man who exudes music. (\\u2026) \\u2018vocals\\u2019 doesn\\u2019t begin to do him justice: his expressive range and the precision with which he was able to deploy it was truly the band\\u2019s fifth instrument. &nbsp;(\\u2026) And he did this while playing guitar with precision and finesse. (\\u2026) his solos were a further source of amazement, his technique somewhere between finger-picking style and classical. His solo introduction to a Baden Powell number made a hash of any attempt at a definition.\\u201d (The Whitman Review, Wakefield Jazz)<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Website: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mariobakuna.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.mariobakuna.com<\\/a><\\/p><p>Facebook: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/MarioBakunaMusician\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/MarioBakunaMusician<\\/a><\\/p><p>Instagram: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/mariobakuna\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/mariobakuna<\\/a><\\/p><p>YouTube: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/c\\/mariobakuna\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/c\\/mariobakuna<\\/a><\\/p><p>Listen:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/mariobakuna.bandcamp.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/mariobakuna.bandcamp.com<\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Video sample:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=i8f5jxuzASE\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=i8f5jxuzASE<\\/a><\\/p> Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna  Featuring Mario Bakuna on Acoustic Guitar and VocalsFollowing sold-out performances across the UK, Portugal, France, Spain, and the Netherlands, Mario Bakuna is delighted to bring this special concert to the Riverside Studios.Join him in celebrating the legacy of Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto, the legendary Brazilian musician and pioneering father of Bossa Nova in the late 1950s. In this heartfelt tribute, Mario Bakuna presents reinterpretations of Gilberto\\u2019s work alongside his own original compositions. Audiences can expect a rich blend of traditional samba elements, syncopated rhythms of plucked chords, and the breezy sophistication that defines Bossa Nova.\\u00a0Mario Bakuna is a Brazilian composer, arranger, vocalist, and guitarist with over 20 years of professional experience, currently based in London, UK. Well known for his deep exploration of traditional Brazilian rhythms, samba, jazz, and bossa nova, Mario focuses on both original compositions and fresh arrangements of works by iconic artists like Tom Jobim, Dorival Caymmi, Paulo Moura, and Jo\\u00e3o Donato. In recent years, he has also dedicated his research and performance to reinterpreting Samba Jazz, a genre that emerged in 1950s Rio de Janeiro through the work of artists like Luiz E\\u00e7a, Tamba Trio, and Edson Machado. This style blends Brazilian standards with sophisticated harmonies influenced by the post\\u2013bossa nova movement.Driven by a passion for musical exploration, Mario moved to Europe to deepen his research and expand his artistic horizons. Since settling in London, he has collaborated with artists such as Jean Toussaint, Liam Noble, Ricardo dos Santos, Edmundo Carneiro, Cacau Queiroz, Alain Jean-Marie, Dudu Penz, and Fil\\u00f3 Machado. He has since become a prominent figure and key reference in the UK\\u2019s Brazilian jazz scene, performing extensively across Europe and beyond at renowned venues and international festivals.His albums Where Rio de Janeiro Meets Bahia and Brazilian Landscapes highlight his ability to fuse traditional roots with a contemporary musical sensibility. With sold-out concerts and critical acclaim, these projects have toured across 20 European countries, as well as Brazil, Canada, Madagascar, Egypt, Kazakhstan, and Azerbaijan\\u2014captivating audiences around the world.\\u00a0\\u201cMario Bakuna, a sparkling guitarist, plays with palpable feeling - his virtuosic fluency on the fretboard is controlled and flourishes are perfectly placed. His voice has a texture like heavy cloth\\u201d. (Songlines Magazine)\\u201cMario Bakuna, a man who exudes music. (\\u2026) \\u2018vocals\\u2019 doesn\\u2019t begin to do him justice: his expressive range and the precision with which he was able to deploy it was truly the band\\u2019s fifth instrument. \\u00a0(\\u2026) And he did this while playing guitar with precision and finesse. (\\u2026) his solos were a further source of amazement, his technique somewhere between finger-picking style and classical. His solo introduction to a Baden Powell number made a hash of any attempt at a definition.\\u201d (The Whitman Review, Wakefield Jazz)\\u00a0Website: https:\\/\\/www.mariobakuna.comFacebook: https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/MarioBakunaMusicianInstagram: https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/mariobakunaYouTube: https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/c\\/mariobakunaListen:\\u00a0https:\\/\\/mariobakuna.bandcamp.com\\u00a0Video sample:\\u00a0https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=i8f5jxuzASE Music\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/NZ-sound-bath-total-relaxation\\/\",\"id\":\"699\",\"name\":\"Sound Bath: Total Relaxation\",\"title\":\"Sound Bath: Total Relaxation\",\"duration\":\"70 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1783810800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/178403\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783864800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/197201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">16:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783870200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1789254000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/259411\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1789308000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/259412\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">16:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1789313400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1792278000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/262202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">1