97179400],\"start_date\":\"1783864800\",\"end_date\":\"1797179400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"M0pRRWhHM3MzWU5zdlhITnhXa2lCQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 12 Jul - Sun 13 Dec 2026\",\"text\":\"Indulge in the ultimate relaxation experience at our upcoming 70min Sound Bath!Immerse yourself in a peaceful atmosphere where the soothing sounds of&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"49.5\",\"45.3\"],\"search_text\":\"Indulge in the ultimate relaxation experience at our upcoming 70min Sound Bath!Immerse yourself in a peaceful atmosphere where the soothing sounds of singing bowls, drums, and chimes will wash over you.\\u00a0As the harmonic vibrations resonate through your body, stress and tension will melt away, leaving you with a profound sense of calm and inner balance.\\u00a0\\u00a0No prior experience is required.\\u00a0This event is capped at 20 people and we have 12 yoga mats available on site to borrow. Therefore, participants should ideally:bring their own yoga matwear comfortable and warm clothesbring a blanket\\u00a0Please note: this event is NOT suitable if you're pregnant (first trimester), experience epilepsy, severe heart conditions or severe mental disorder (i.e.\\u00a0schizophrenia).\\u00a0BioConsuelo Cogrossi is a Somatic Coach and founder of House of Somatics. Through yoga, breathwork, meditation, and sound healing, she creates nurturing spaces where you can slow down, reconnect with yourself, and find greater ease in body and mind.Her work is rooted in the understanding that lasting change happens through the body. She helps you regulate your nervous system, release stress and tension, and cultivate greater wellbeing from the inside out.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Sound Bath: Total Relaxation Sound Bath: Total Relaxation Wellness  <h2>Indulge in the ultimate relaxation experience at our upcoming 70min Sound Bath!<\\/h2><p>Immerse yourself in a peaceful atmosphere where the soothing sounds of singing bowls, drums, and chimes will wash over you.&nbsp;As the harmonic vibrations resonate through your body, stress and tension will melt away, leaving you with a profound sense of calm and inner balance.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>No prior experience is required.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>This event is capped at 20 people and we have <strong>12 yoga mats<\\/strong> available on site to borrow. Therefore, participants should ideally:<\\/p><ul><li>bring their own yoga mat<\\/li><li>wear comfortable and warm clothes<\\/li><li>bring a blanket<\\/li><\\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Please note: this event is NOT suitable if you're pregnant (first trimester), experience epilepsy, severe heart conditions or severe mental disorder (i.e.&nbsp;schizophrenia).<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Bio<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Consuelo Cogrossi is a Somatic Coach and founder of <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.houseofsomatics.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">House of Somatics<\\/a>. Through yoga, breathwork, meditation, and sound healing, she creates nurturing spaces where you can slow down, reconnect with yourself, and find greater ease in body and mind.<\\/p><p>Her work is rooted in the understanding that lasting change happens through the body. She helps you regulate your nervous system, release stress and tension, and cultivate greater wellbeing from the inside out.<\\/p> Sound Bath: Total Relaxation  Indulge in the ultimate relaxation experience at our upcoming 70min Sound Bath!Immerse yourself in a peaceful atmosphere where the soothing sounds of singing bowls, drums, and chimes will wash over you.\\u00a0As the harmonic vibrations resonate through your body, stress and tension will melt away, leaving you with a profound sense of calm and inner balance.\\u00a0\\u00a0No prior experience is required.\\u00a0This event is capped at 20 people and we have 12 yoga mats available on site to borrow. Therefore, participants should ideally:bring their own yoga matwear comfortable and warm clothesbring a blanket\\u00a0Please note: this event is NOT suitable if you're pregnant (first trimester), experience epilepsy, severe heart conditions or severe mental disorder (i.e.\\u00a0schizophrenia).\\u00a0BioConsuelo Cogrossi is a Somatic Coach and founder of House of Somatics. Through yoga, breathwork, meditation, and sound healing, she creates nurturing spaces where you can slow down, reconnect with yourself, and find greater ease in body and mind.Her work is rooted in the understanding that lasting change happens through the body. She helps you regulate your nervous system, release stress and tension, and cultivate greater wellbeing from the inside out. Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/cB-live-next-to-the-apollo\\/\",\"id\":\"463\",\"name\":\"Live Next To The Apollo\",\"title\":\"Live Next To The Apollo\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Comedy\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1788476400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"313\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/130202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788544800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1789081200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"313\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/130204\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1789149600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1789686000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"313\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/130206\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1789754400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1790290800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"313\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/130208\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1790359200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1790895600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"313\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/130210\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\