1eb764c51b94\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w2160\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94\\/w2160\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx507\\/cy14\\/cw1058\\/ch1058\\/images\\/uploads\\/94f7f361220a28c1e6981eb764c51b94.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"47.8\",\"41.1\"],\"search_text\":\"Back by popular demand\\u2026A beginners guide to acting for screen. Join Georgia Kirkland, actress and short-film director for these one-off acting for screen workshops. Whether you\\u2019re new to the world of screen acting or you are looking for a confident boost for your next audition, this class is for you! In this friendly and insightful session, you will:\\u25cf Be given a chance to perform a scene on camera\\u25cf Receive a copy of your scenes\\u25cf Be given industry feedback to help build your confidence\\u25cf Get to know the group with a few warm up gamesAll scripts will be sent out prior to the class for you to be familiar with. This is a low pressure class, with the aim being on building confidence within a supportive community. Georgia believes acting is a craft that should be enjoyed and is committed to cultivating a safe and fun culture in class. Classes will be capped at 15 people, to ensure everyone has enough time in front of the camera. Whatever level you may find yourself, you are so welcome in this session.\\u00a0AboutGeorgia is an actress, writer and short-film director with a great passion for the film industry. Having originally trained at Kingston School of Art in Filmmaking and then later going to Identity School of Acting and The Stella Adler Art of Acting Studio in Los Angeles.Her experience both behind and in front of the camera, provides her with a great insight and understanding about on screen performances. Georgia directed and produced GERASCO, a short fantastical film about childhood and imagination that went on to win best production design at Screentest Festival. Both GERASCO and her documentary NONNA & GORDON went on to screen both nationally and internationally at various film festivals. In addition to directing, Georgia has experience working on high production sets in featured roles such as the new Disney Plus series SAY NOTHING, and HOUSE OF THE DRAGON. As well as working in the world of commercials and voiceover.Georgia is thrilled to have recently become a member of Directors UK and is excited to begin development of various upcoming short film projects. Being someone that thrives working with actors and in creating a comfortable environment on set that benefits the performers, Georgia can\\u2019t wait to welcome you into the world of acting for screen\\u2026\\u201cGeorgia is incredible at making you feel comfortable and empowered in the space as well as delivering insightful and detailed direction\\u201d - Previous workshop attendee\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Acting for Screen Workshop Acting for Screen Workshop Workshops & Classes  <p><strong>Back by popular demand\\u2026<\\/strong><\\/p><p>A beginners guide to acting for screen. Join Georgia Kirkland, actress and short-film director for these one-off acting for screen workshops. Whether you\\u2019re new to the world of screen acting or you are looking for a confident boost for your next audition, this class is for you! In this friendly and insightful session, you will:<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Be given a chance to perform a scene on camera<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Receive a copy of your scenes<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Be given industry feedback to help build your confidence<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Get to know the group with a few warm up games<\\/p><p>All scripts will be sent out prior to the class for you to be familiar with. This is a low pressure class, with the aim being on building confidence within a supportive community. Georgia believes acting is a craft that should be enjoyed and is committed to cultivating a safe and fun culture in class. Classes will be capped at 15 people, to ensure everyone has enough time in front of the camera. Whatever level you may find yourself, you are so welcome in this session.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Georgia is an actress, writer and short-film director with a great passion for the film industry. Having originally trained at Kingston School of Art in Filmmaking and then later going to Identity School of Acting and The Stella Adler Art of Acting Studio in Los Angeles.<\\/p><p>Her experience both behind and in front of the camera, provides her with a great insight and understanding about on screen performances. Georgia directed and produced <i>GERASCO<\\/i>, a short fantastical film about childhood and imagination that went on to win best production design at Screentest Festival. Both <i>GERASCO<\\/i> and her documentary <i>NONNA &amp; GORDON<\\/i> went on to screen both nationally and internationally at various film festivals. In addition to directing, Georgia has experience working on high production sets in featured roles such as the new Disney Plus series<i> SAY NOTHING<\\/i>, and <i>HOUSE OF THE DRAGON<\\/i>. As well as working in the world of commercials and voiceover.<\\/p><p>Georgia is thrilled to have recently become a member of Directors UK and is excited to begin development of various upcoming short film projects. Being someone that thrives working with actors and in creating a comfortable environment on set that benefits the performers, Georgia can\\u2019t wait to welcome you into the world of acting for screen\\u2026<\\/p><blockquote><p>\\u201cGeorgia is incredible at making you feel comfortable and empowered in the space as well as delivering insightful and detailed direction\\u201d - Previous workshop attendee<\\/p><\\/blockquote> Acting for Screen Workshop  Back by popular demand\\u2026A beginners guide to acting for screen. Join Georgia Kirkland, actress and short-film director for these one-off acting for screen workshops. Whether you\\u2019re new to the world of screen acting or you are looking for a confident boost for your next audition, this class is for you! In this friendly and insightful session, you will:\\u25cf Be given a chance to perform a scene on camera\\u25cf Receive a copy of your scenes\\u25cf Be given industry feedback to help build your confidence\\u25cf Get to know the group with a few warm up gamesAll scripts will be sent out prior to the class for you to be familiar with. This is a low pressure class, with the aim being on building confidence within a supportive community. Georgia believes acting is a craft that should be enjoyed and is committed to cultivating a safe and fun culture in class. Classes will be capped at 15 people, to ensure everyone has enough time in front of the camera. Whatever level you may find yourself, you are so welcome in this session.\\u00a0AboutGeorgia is an actress, writer and short-film director with a great passion for the film industry. Having originally trained at Kingston School of Art in Filmmaking and then later going to Identity School of Acting and The Stella Adler Art of Acting Studio in Los Angeles.Her experience both behind and in front of the camera, provides her with a great insight and understanding about on screen performances. Georgia directed and produced GERASCO, a short fantastical film about childhood and imagination that went on to win best production design at Screentest Festival. Both GERASCO and her documentary NONNA & GORDON went on to screen both nationally and internationally at various film festivals. In addition to directing, Georgia has experience working on high production sets in featured roles such as the new Disney Plus series SAY NOTHING, and HOUSE OF THE DRAGON. As well as working in the world of commercials and voiceover.Georgia is thrilled to have recently become a member of Directors UK and is excited to begin development of various upcoming short film projects. Being someone that thrives working with actors and in creating a comfortable environment on set that benefits the performers, Georgia can\\u2019t wait to welcome you into the world of acting for screen\\u2026\\u201cGeorgia is incredible at making you feel comfortable and empowered in the space as well as delivering insightful and detailed direction\\u201d - Previous workshop attendee Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/zX-hands-on-creative-workshops\\/\",\"id\":\"2593\",\"name\":\"Hands-On Creative Workshops\",\"title\":\"Hands-On Creative Workshops\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1790377200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/258805\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1790431200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1791586800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/262003\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1791640800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1792191600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/262004\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1792245600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1794009600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance butto