x515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1536\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1536\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1536\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1536\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1536\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1536\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1536\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c9\\/75ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d\\/w1536\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx515\\/cy5\\/cw1021\\/ch1019\\/images\\/uploads\\/c975ad70bb69a3d726b6abd73771169d.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"A relaxed creative space to slow down, explore new techniques and make something by hand.Step away from the pace of everyday life and reconnect with your creativity in these relaxed, hands-on workshops. Through gentle guidance and time to explore, participants are invited to experiment with materials, discover new techniques and create something unique to take home.Each session explores a different artistic practice, combining mindful making with playful discovery in a welcoming and supportive environment. No prior experience is needed \\u2014 just curiosity and a willingness to create.Workshops scheduleSATURDAY 18 APRIL & 9 MAYMacram\\u00e9 Photo Frame WorkshopCreate your own decorative macram\\u00e9 photo frame using cotton yarn and natural materials. Personalise your frame with colours and embellishments such as feathers, fabric, shells and beads. Participants are welcome to bring a photo or postcard to incorporate into their design and create a frame that reflects their own style.SATURDAY 30 MAY & 6 JUNEAir-Dry Clay WorkshopExplore the tactile and grounding process of working with clay in this hands-on session. Participants will learn simple techniques such as shaping, carving and texturing while creating a small sculptural piece to take home. Those with previous experience are welcome to explore their own ideas and use the session as a space for free creative expression. Working with clay encourages focus and presence, offering a calming and mindful creative experience.SATURDAY 20 JUNE & 11 JULYMandala Art WorkshopSlow down with a mindful drawing session inspired by mandala patterns. Participants will learn simple techniques for building circular compositions using line, symmetry and colour, creating layered designs that encourage focus and relaxation. This workshop offers a calm and meditative space to explore pattern, creativity and personal expression.BioJessi is a London-based multidisciplinary artist, arts therapist and ecstatic dance facilitator whose work explores the connection between creativity, movement and wellbeing. At the heart of her practice is a deep appreciation for making by hand \\u2014 working with simple materials, patterns and tactile processes that invite presence, curiosity and experimentation. Through accessible and welcoming workshops, she creates spaces where people can slow down, reconnect with their creativity and rediscover the grounding and joyful experience of creating something with their own hands.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Hands-On Creative Workshops Hands-On Creative Workshops Workshops & Classes  <p><i><strong>A relaxed creative space to slow down, explore new techniques and make something by hand.<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Step away from the pace of everyday life and reconnect with your creativity in these relaxed, hands-on workshops. Through gentle guidance and time to explore, participants are invited to experiment with materials, discover new techniques and create something unique to take home.<\\/p><p>Each session explores a different artistic practice, combining mindful making with playful discovery in a welcoming and supportive environment. No prior experience is needed \\u2014 just curiosity and a willingness to create.<\\/p><h2><strong>Workshops schedule<\\/strong><\\/h2><h3><strong>SATURDAY 18 APRIL &amp; 9 MAY<\\/strong><\\/h3><p><strong>Macram\\u00e9 Photo Frame Workshop<\\/strong><br>Create your own decorative macram\\u00e9 photo frame using cotton yarn and natural materials. Personalise your frame with colours and embellishments such as feathers, fabric, shells and beads. Participants are welcome to bring a photo or postcard to incorporate into their design and create a frame that reflects their own style.<\\/p><h3><strong>SATURDAY 30 MAY &amp; 6 JUNE<\\/strong><\\/h3><p><strong>Air-Dry Clay Workshop<\\/strong><br>Explore the tactile and grounding process of working with clay in this hands-on session. Participants will learn simple techniques such as shaping, carving and texturing while creating a small sculptural piece to take home. Those with previous experience are welcome to explore their own ideas and use the session as a space for free creative expression. Working with clay encourages focus and presence, offering a calming and mindful creative experience.<\\/p><h3><strong>SATURDAY 20 JUNE &amp; 11 JULY<\\/strong><\\/h3><p><strong>Mandala Art Workshop<\\/strong><br>Slow down with a mindful drawing session inspired by mandala patterns. Participants will learn simple techniques for building circular compositions using line, symmetry and colour, creating layered designs that encourage focus and relaxation. This workshop offers a calm and meditative space to explore pattern, creativity and personal expression.<\\/p><h3><strong>Bio<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Jessi is a London-based multidisciplinary artist, arts therapist and ecstatic dance facilitator whose work explores the connection between creativity, movement and wellbeing. At the heart of her practice is a deep appreciation for making by hand \\u2014 working with simple materials, patterns and tactile processes that invite presence, curiosity and experimentation. Through accessible and welcoming workshops, she creates spaces where people can slow down, reconnect with their creativity and rediscover the grounding and joyful experience of creating something with their own hands.<\\/p> Hands-On Creative Workshops  A relaxed creative space to slow down, explore new techniques and make something by hand.Step away from the pace of everyday life and reconnect with your creativity in these relaxed, hands-on workshops. Through gentle guidance and time to explore, participants are invited to experiment with materials, discover new techniques and create something unique to take home.Each session explores a different artistic practice, combining mindful making with playful discovery in a welcoming and supportive environment. No prior experience is needed \\u2014 just curiosity and a willingness to create.Workshops scheduleSATURDAY 18 APRIL & 9 MAYMacram\\u00e9 Photo Frame WorkshopCreate your own decorative macram\\u00e9 photo frame using cotton yarn and natural materials. Personalise your frame with colours and embellishments such as feathers, fabric, shells and beads. Participants are welcome to bring a photo or postcard to incorporate into their design and create a frame that reflects their own style.SATURDAY 30 MAY & 6 JUNEAir-Dry Clay WorkshopExplore the tactile and grounding process of working with clay in this hands-on session. Participants will learn simple techniques such as shaping, carving and texturing while creating a small sculptural piece to take home. Those with previous experience are welcome to explore their own ideas and use the session as a space for free creative expression. Working with clay encourages focus and presence, offering a calming and mindful creative experience.SATURDAY 20 JUNE & 11 JULYMandala Art WorkshopSlow down with a mindful drawing session inspired by mandala patterns. Participants will learn simple techniques for building circular compositions using line, symmetry and colour, creating layered designs that encourage focus and relaxation. This workshop offers a calm and meditative space to explore pattern, creativity and personal expression.BioJessi is a London-based multidisciplinary artist, arts therapist and ecstatic dance facilitator whose work explores the connection between creativity, movement and wellbeing. At the heart of her practice is a deep appreciation for making by hand \\u2014 working with simple materials, patterns and tactile processes that invite presence, curiosity and experimentation. Through accessible and welcoming workshops, she creates spaces where people can slow down, reconnect with their creativity and rediscover the grounding and joyful experience of creating something with their own hands. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/S0-creative-reset\\/\",\"id\":\"2400\",\"name\":\"Creative Reset\",\"title\":\"Creative Reset\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1783810800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/145203\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783863000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1783810800],\"times\":[1783863000],\"start_date\":\"1783863000\",\"end_date\":\"1783863000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"Yk9DaFRkVG4vYWxOQTlqdzdla1cvZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 12 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"Ever feel like your brain\\u2019s full, too many tabs are open, and you just need a moment to\\u2026 reset? This is that space.Creative Reset is a guided, in-person&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w2160\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/09\\/247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188\\/w2160\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx434\\/cw1064\\/ch1063\\/images\\/uploads\\/09247c3a72e79f0eded3773ee4781188.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Ever feel like your brain\\u2019s full, too many tabs are open, and you just need a moment to\\u2026 reset? This is that space.Creative Reset is a guided, in-person workshop where you get to slow things down, step out of your usual routine, and reconnect with yourself, with others, and with your creative side.No pressure. No expectations. No \\u201cyou should be better at this\\u201d.You just need to show up. No experience needed.We\\u2019ll ease in gently, then move into a mix of reflection, simple, creative exercises, and open space to explore whatever feels right for you. You can share, or not. Talk, or not. Go deep or keep it light.Think of it as a reset for your mind, your energy, and your perspective, but in a way that feels human, relaxed, and actually enjoyable.\\u00a0You might leave with:a new idea or insighta shift in perspectivesomething you\\u2019ve createdor just a sense of \\u201cah\\u2026 I needed that\\u201d\\u00a0What to expecta relaxed, welcoming spacegentle guidance to help you land and switch offcreative prompts and materials to explore withspace to connect with others or stay in your own flow, whatever feels right for you on the day\\u00a0Who this is forThis space is for anyone who:feels like life\\u2019s been a bit \\u201cgo go go\\u201d latelywants to reconnect with themselves, others, and creativity, without pressureis curious about trying something new\\u00a0Come as you are.Leave a little lighter.\\u00a0About the facilitatorJo Girul is a wellbeing coach working with alternative approaches to wellbeing. Through Human Connection Hub, she creates spaces for connection, creativity, fun, and more human ways of being together.Instagram: @humanconnection.hub\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/145203\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Creative Reset Creative Reset Wellness  <h3>Ever feel like your brain\\u2019s full, too many tabs are open, and you just need a moment to\\u2026 reset? This is that space.<\\/h3><p><strong>Creative Reset<\\/strong> is a guided, in-person workshop where you get to slow things down, step out of your usual routine, and reconnect with yourself, with others, and with your creative side.<\\/p><p>No pressure. No expectations. No \\u201cyou should be better at this\\u201d.<\\/p><p>You just need to show up. No experience needed.<\\/p><p>We\\u2019ll ease in gently, then move into a mix of reflection, simple, creative exercises, and open space to explore whatever feels right for you. You can share, or not. Talk, or not. Go deep or keep it light.<\\/p><p>Think of it as a reset for your mind, your energy, and your perspective, but in a way that feels human, relaxed, and actually enjoyable.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>You might leave with<\\/strong>:<\\/p><ul><li>a new idea or insight<\\/li><li>a shift in perspective<\\/li><li>something you\\u2019ve created<\\/li><li>or just a sense of \\u201cah\\u2026 I needed that\\u201d<\\/li><\\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>What to expect<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>a relaxed, welcoming space<\\/li><li>gentle guidance to help you land and switch off<\\/li><li>creative prompts and materials to explore with<\\/li><li>space to connect with others or stay in your own flow, whatever feels right for you on the day<\\/li><\\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Who this is for<\\/strong><\\/p><p><i>This space is for anyone who:<\\/i><\\/p><ul><li>feels like life\\u2019s been a bit \\u201cgo go go\\u201d lately<\\/li><li>wants to reconnect with themselves, others, and creativity, without pressure<\\/li><li>is curious about trying something new<\\/li><\\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Come as you are.<\\/p><p>Leave a little lighter.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About the facilitator<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Jo Girul is a wellbeing coach working with alternative approaches to wellbeing. Through <strong>Human Connection Hub<\\/strong>, she creates spaces for connection, creativity, fun, and more human ways of being together.<\\/p><p>Instagram: @humanconnection.hub<\\/p> Creative Reset  Ever feel like your brain\\u2019s full, too many tabs are open, and you just need a moment to\\u2026 reset? This is that space.Creative Reset is a guided, in-person workshop where you get to slow things down, step out of your usual routine, and reconnect with yourself, with others, and with your creative side.No pressure. No expectations. No \\u201cyou should be better at this\\u201d.You just need to show up. No experience needed.We\\u2019ll ease in gently, then move into a mix of reflection, simple, creative exercises, and open space to explore whatever feels right for you. You can share, or not. Talk, or not. Go deep or keep it light.Think of it as a reset for your mind, your energy, and your perspective, but in a way that feels human, relaxed, and actually enjoyable.\\u00a0You might leave with:a new idea or insighta shift in perspectivesomething you\\u2019ve createdor just a sense of \\u201cah\\u2026 I needed that\\u201d\\u00a0What to expecta relaxed, welcoming spacegentle guidance to help you land and switch offcreative prompts and materials to explore withspace to connect with others or stay in your own flow, whatever feels right for you on the day\\u00a0Who this is forThis space is for anyone who:feels like life\\u2019s been a bit \\u201cgo go go\\u201d latelywants to reconnect with themselves, others, and creativity, without pressureis curious about trying something new\\u00a0Come as you are.Leave a little lighter.\\u00a0About the facilitatorJo Girul is a wellbeing coach working with alternative approaches to wellbeing. Through Human Connection Hub, she creates spaces for connection, creativity, fun, and more human ways of being together.Instagram: @humanconnection.hub Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/bk-pilates-with-athena\\/\",\"id\":\"659\",\"name\":\"Pilates with Athena\",\"title\":\"Pilates with Athena\",\"duration\":\"45 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1783983600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/159007\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">09:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784017800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1784588400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\