797931800],\"start_date\":\"1784017800\",\"end_date\":\"1797931800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"SmRCaHRPbk5DVDNZbnFRNjY1VWJmUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 14 Jul - Tue 22 Dec 2026\",\"text\":\"Pilates is a method of exercise that can help to improve flexibility, build strength, endurance, postural alignment, it helps to develop a strong core&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx419\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1360\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"49.9\",\"76.0\"],\"search_text\":\"Pilates is a method of exercise that can help to improve flexibility, build strength, endurance, postural alignment, it helps to develop a strong core and improve posture, coordination and balance. Emphasis is on correct breathing, working muscles of the abdomen, lower back and hips which are essential for stability and strength of the spine.\\u00a0The Pilates with Athena system allows for exercises to be adapted to suit all levels, whether a complete beginner to more advanced.\\u00a0Pilates is also an excellent method of exercise during all stages of pregnancy, and very good post partum to regain the strength of the core.\\u00a0\\u00a0Pilates is a fantastic mind and body discipline, creating a full body workout using bodyweight and some equipment to enhance some exercises.\\u00a0Instagram: @pilateswithathenaWebsite: Home | My Site\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Pilates with Athena Pilates with Athena Wellness  <p>Pilates is a method of exercise that can help to improve flexibility, build strength, endurance, postural alignment, it helps to develop a strong core and improve posture, coordination and balance. Emphasis is on correct breathing, working muscles of the abdomen, lower back and hips which are essential for stability and strength of the spine.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>The <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/pilateswithathena\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><strong>Pilates with Athena<\\/strong><\\/a><strong> <\\/strong>system allows for exercises to be adapted to suit all levels, whether a complete beginner to more advanced.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Pilates is also an excellent method of exercise during all stages of pregnancy, and very good post partum to regain the strength of the core.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Pilates is a fantastic mind and body discipline, creating a full body workout using bodyweight and some equipment to enhance some exercises.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Instagram: @pilateswithathena<\\/p><p>Website: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.atozfitness.co.uk\\/\\\">Home | My Site<\\/a><\\/p> Pilates with Athena  Pilates is a method of exercise that can help to improve flexibility, build strength, endurance, postural alignment, it helps to develop a strong core and improve posture, coordination and balance. Emphasis is on correct breathing, working muscles of the abdomen, lower back and hips which are essential for stability and strength of the spine.\\u00a0The Pilates with Athena system allows for exercises to be adapted to suit all levels, whether a complete beginner to more advanced.\\u00a0Pilates is also an excellent method of exercise during all stages of pregnancy, and very good post partum to regain the strength of the core.\\u00a0\\u00a0Pilates is a fantastic mind and body discipline, creating a full body workout using bodyweight and some equipment to enhance some exercises.\\u00a0Instagram: @pilateswithathenaWebsite: Home | My Site Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/w8-dancercise-with-anna-wicks\\/\",\"id\":\"404\",\"name\":\"Dancercise with Anna Wicks\",\"title\":\"Dancercise with Anna Wicks\",\"duration\":\"50 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1784674800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\",\"80901\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/258201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784741400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785279600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\",\"80901\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/258202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785346200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1788303600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\",\"80901\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/263601\\/\\\">\\n   \