custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"Anna Wickes NEW\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"48.6\",\"54.5\"],\"search_text\":\"After a tough three years of intense professional training and work in the dance and musical theatre industry, Anna Wicks rediscovered the joy of moving simply to feel good. No competing for that job, no professional pressure, just dancing because it\\u2019s good for the soul!Anna\\u2019s classes are a safe space where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose your inhibitions and strip exercise back to that freeing feeling of dancing when no one is watching. These classes involve plenty of Anna making a fool out of herself with air guitars, shimmying, sweating and sensational playlists (if she does say so herself) and so much heart.Let\\u2019s recognise the importance of enjoying judgement free exercise and dance together - please come along for an hour of boogying. Absolutely no previous dance experience is required!\\u00a0\\u00a0For more info, follow\\u00a0@dancercisewithanna\\u00a0on Instagram!This class is open to all ages.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"80901\",\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Dancercise with Anna Wicks Dancercise with Anna Wicks Wellness  <p>After a tough three years of intense professional training and work in the dance and musical theatre industry, Anna Wicks rediscovered the joy of moving simply to feel good. No competing for that job, no professional pressure, just dancing because it\\u2019s good for the soul!<\\/p><p>Anna\\u2019s classes are a safe space where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose your inhibitions and strip exercise back to that freeing feeling of dancing when no one is watching. These classes involve plenty of Anna making a fool out of herself with air guitars, shimmying, sweating and sensational playlists (if she does say so herself) and so much heart.<\\/p><p>Let\\u2019s recognise the importance of enjoying judgement free exercise and dance together - please come along for an hour of boogying. Absolutely no previous dance experience is required!&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>For more info, follow&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/dancercisewithanna\\/?igshid=MzRlODBiNWFlZA%3D%3D\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">@dancercisewithanna<\\/a>&nbsp;on Instagram!<\\/p><p>This class is open to all ages.<\\/p> Dancercise with Anna Wicks  After a tough three years of intense professional training and work in the dance and musical theatre industry, Anna Wicks rediscovered the joy of moving simply to feel good. No competing for that job, no professional pressure, just dancing because it\\u2019s good for the soul!Anna\\u2019s classes are a safe space where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose your inhibitions and strip exercise back to that freeing feeling of dancing when no one is watching. These classes involve plenty of Anna making a fool out of herself with air guitars, shimmying, sweating and sensational playlists (if she does say so herself) and so much heart.Let\\u2019s recognise the importance of enjoying judgement free exercise and dance together - please come along for an hour of boogying. Absolutely no previous dance experience is required!\\u00a0\\u00a0For more info, follow\\u00a0@dancercisewithanna\\u00a0on Instagram!This class is open to all ages. Dance Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/16-line-dancing\\/\",\"id\":\"605\",\"name\":\"Line Dancing\",\"title\":\"Line Dancing\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1784242800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\",\"80901\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/161802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784309400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785452400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\",\"80901\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/162801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785519000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1784242800,1785452400],\"times\":[1784309400,1785519000],\"start_date\":\"1784309400\",\"end_date\":\"1785519000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"dER2YUFWVXhhSUgyZnpXbnBrRWkwUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 17 - Fri 31 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"Have you ever wanted to learn to Line dance?&nbsp;Lisa Willner will be teaching short Line dance routines that everyone can do.&nbsp;For safety and style,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w2681\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6b\\/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de\\/w2681\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx360\\/cy324\\/cw1952\\/ch1953\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"49.3\",\"18.1\"],\"search_text\":\"Have you ever wanted to learn to Line dance?\\u00a0Lisa Willner will be teaching short Line dance routines that everyone can do.\\u00a0For safety and style, we recommend wearing boots or dance heels to class \\u2013 sneakers and slippers aren\\u2019t ideal for toe-heel steps. Feel free to bring your cowboy, party, or sun hats too \\u2013 they\\u2019re great for adding flair to the choreography.Lisa is an ex professional dancer. She trained at Bush Davies Ballet School. She joined Second Generation dance company for Dougie Squires and toured the UK, France and Germany; performing in theatres and television. Lisa danced in the opening sequence of Indiana Jones and The Temple of Doom, for Danny Daniels.\\u00a0She has worked for many choreographers including: Carole Todd, Jack Gunn, Irving Davies, Tommy Tucker, Luke Batchelor, Jane Darling and Libby Roberts. Her other dance and acting credits include:\\u00a0\\u201cThe Benny Hill show\\u201d for Thames TV; Hills Angel.\\u00a0\\u201cA Night On The Town\\u201dwith Elaine Paige, Lewis Collins, Anne Reinking and Eartha Kitt.\\u00a0\\u201cNoises Off\\u201d\\u00a0 at The Savoy Theatre for two years, playing Brooke Ashton.\\u00a0\\u201cWhose Baby\\u201d\\u00a0 Hostess for Thames TV.\\u00a0\\u201cKing and Castle\\u201d with Nigel Planner for Thames TV.\\u00a0\\u201cA Bit on the Side\\u201d playing a wife, with Lionel Blair and Jeremy Bulloch.\\u00a0\\u201cAladdin\\u201d pantomime playing Princess Jasmin at Middleton Civic Theatre.\\u00a0\\u201cMother Goose\\u201d playing Jill, with Danny La Rue,\\u00a0 Churchill Theatre, Bromely.\\u00a0\\u201cChristine Keeler\\u201d playing Christine in a silent film for channel 4.\\u00a0\\u201cDame Vera Lynn 100\\u201d at The Palladium, 2017, dancing in LalaLand.\\u00a0\\u00a0Lisa lived in the Far East for nine years; where she taught Aerobics, Hour Of Power and choreographed \\u201cStepping Out\\u201d for ACT in Hong Kong. She played the Dark Witch in \\u201cThe Dark Of The Moon\\u201d in Tokyo for TIP.\\u00a0 Lisa also had her own dance group called\\u00a0 \\u201cShades of Dance\\u201d, doing private shows at venues like The Hurlingham club. She danced forBEIJA FLOR, the Brazilian dance company in shows, conferences and carnivals. She recently choreographed and danced in \\u201cThe Working Girls of Soho,\\u201d at The Phoenix Arts club and The Kings Head Theatre in Islington.\\u00a0Currently, Lisa teaches Wedding couples first dances and\\u00a0 corporate and Hen party dance classes.\\u00a0So: Dust off your Stetsons, polish your Cowboy boots, jump into your jeans and checked shirts and come down to Riverside Studios to join in the fun of Line dancing!\\u00a0\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"80901\",\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Line Dancing Line Dancing Wellness  <p><strong>Have you ever wanted to learn to Line dance?&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Lisa Willner will be teaching short Line dance routines that everyone can do.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>For safety and style, we recommend wearing boots or dance heels to class \\u2013 sneakers and slippers aren\\u2019t ideal for toe-heel steps. Feel free to bring your cowboy, party, or sun hats too \\u2013 they\\u2019re great for adding flair to the choreography.<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Lisa is an ex professional dancer. She trained at Bush Davies Ballet School. She joined Second Generation dance company for Dougie Squires and toured the UK, France and Germany; performing in theatres and television. Lisa danced in the opening sequence of Indiana Jones and The Temple of Doom, for Danny Daniels.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>She has worked for many choreographers including: Carole Todd, Jack Gunn, Irving Davies, Tommy Tucker, Luke Batchelor, Jane Darling and Libby Roberts. Her other dance and acting credits include:&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cThe Benny Hill show\\u201d for Thames TV; Hills Angel.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cA Night On The Town\\u201dwith Elaine Paige, Lewis Collins, Anne Reinking and Eartha Kitt.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cNoises Off\\u201d&nbsp; at The Savoy Theatre for two years, playing Brooke Ashton.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cWhose Baby\\u201d&nbsp; Hostess for Thames TV.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cKing and Castle\\u201d with Nigel Planner for Thames TV.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cA Bit on the Side\\u201d playing a wife, with Lionel Blair and Jeremy Bulloch.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cAladdin\\u201d pantomime playing Princess Jasmin at Middleton Civic Theatre.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cMother Goose\\u201d playing Jill, with Danny La Rue,&nbsp; Churchill Theatre, Bromely.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cChristine Keeler\\u201d playing Christine in a silent film for channel 4.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201cDame Vera Lynn 100\\u201d at The Palladium, 2017, dancing in LalaLand.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Lisa lived in the Far East for nine years; where she taught Aerobics, Hour Of Power and choreographed \\u201cStepping Out\\u201d for ACT in Hong Kong. She played the Dark Witch in \\u201cThe Dark Of The Moon\\u201d in Tokyo for TIP.&nbsp; Lisa also had her own dance group called&nbsp; \\u201cShades of Dance\\u201d, doing private shows at venues like The Hurlingham club. She danced forBEIJA FLOR, the Brazilian dance company in shows, conferences and carnivals. She recently choreographed and danced in \\u201cThe Working Girls of Soho,\\u201d at The Phoenix Arts club and The Kings Head Theatre in Islington.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Currently, Lisa teaches Wedding couples first dances and&nbsp; corporate and Hen party dance classes.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>So: Dust off your Stetsons, polish your Cowboy boots, jump into your jeans and checked shirts and come down to Riverside Studios to join in the fun of Line dancing!&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p> Line Dancing  Have you ever wanted to learn to Line dance?\\u00a0Lisa Willner will be teaching short Line dance routines that everyone can do.\\u00a0For safety and style, we recommend wearing boots or dance heels to class \\u2013 sneakers and slippers aren\\u2019t ideal for toe-heel steps. Feel free to bring your cowboy, party, or sun hats too \\u2013 they\\u2019re great for adding flair to the choreography.Lisa is an ex professional dancer. She trained at Bush Davies Ballet School. She joined Second Generation dance company for Dougie Squires and toured the UK, France and Germany; performing in theatres and television. Lisa danced in the opening sequence of Indiana Jones and The Temple of Doom, for Danny Daniels.\\u00a0She has worked for many choreographers including: Carole Todd, Jack Gunn, Irving Davies, Tommy Tucker, Luke Batchelor, Jane Darling and Libby Roberts. Her other dance and acting credits include:\\u00a0\\u201cThe Benny Hill show\\u201d for Thames TV; Hills Angel.\\u00a0\\u201cA Night On The Town\\u201dwith Elaine Paige, Lewis Collins, Anne Reinking and Eartha Kitt.\\u00a0\\u201cNoises Off\\u201d\\u00a0 at The Savoy Theatre for two years, playing Brooke Ashton.\\u00a0\\u201cWhose Baby\\u201d\\u00a0 Hostess for Thames TV.\\u00a0\\u201cKing and Castle\\u201d with Nigel Planner for Thames TV.\\u00a0\\u201cA Bit on the Side\\u201d playing a wife, with Lionel Blair and Jeremy Bulloch.\\u00a0\\u201cAladdin\\u201d pantomime playing Princess Jasmin at Middleton Civic Theatre.\\u00a0\\u201cMother Goose\\u201d playing Jill, with Danny La Rue,\\u00a0 Churchill Theatre, Bromely.\\u00a0\\u201cChristine Keeler\\u201d playing Christine in a silent film for channel 4.\\u00a0\\u201cDame Vera Lynn 100\\u201d at The Palladium, 2017, dancing in LalaLand.\\u00a0\\u00a0Lisa lived in the Far East for nine years; where she taught Aerobics, Hour Of Power and choreographed \\u201cStepping Out\\u201d for ACT in Hong Kong. She played the Dark Witch in \\u201cThe Dark Of The Moon\\u201d in Tokyo for TIP.\\u00a0 Lisa also had her own dance group called\\u00a0 \\u201cShades of Dance\\u201d, doing private shows at venues like The Hurlingham club. She danced forBEIJA FLOR, the Brazilian dance company in shows, conferences and carnivals. She recently choreographed and danced in \\u201cThe Working Girls of Soho,\\u201d at The Phoenix Arts club and The Kings Head Theatre in Islington.\\u00a0Currently, Lisa teaches Wedding couples first dances and\\u00a0 corporate and Hen party dance classes.\\u00a0So: Dust off your Stetsons, polish your Cowboy boots, jump into your jeans and checked shirts and come down to Riverside Studios to join in the fun of Line dancing!\\u00a0\\u00a0 Dance Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/pN-riverscribes-monthly-playwriting-drop-in-sessions\\/\",\"id\":\"2615\",\"name\":\"Riverscribes: Monthly Playwriting Drop In Sessions\",\"title\":\"Riverscribes: Monthly Playwriting Drop In Sessions\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1784674800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/161801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784743200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787698800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/162001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787767200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1784674800,1787698800],\"times\":[1784743200,1787767200],\"start_date\":\"1784743200\",\"end_date\":\"1787767200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"bXloMm9Ha1R5dnhlYThmSjVlUExodz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Wed 22 Jul - Wed 26 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Riverscribes is a relaxed, fun, and inspiring monthly playwriting sessions for anyone aged 18 and over. Whether you\\u2019re working on a script, curious about&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w2000\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w2000\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w2000\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d\\/w2000\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx154\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e4359f351454fecbe736be37bedce4d.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"59.7\",\"27.7\"],\"search_text\":\"Riverscribes is a relaxed, fun, and inspiring monthly playwriting sessions for anyone aged 18 and over. Whether you\\u2019re working on a script, curious about writing a play, or just looking for a creative outlet, these drop in sessions are your space to explore, experiment, and develop your writing.Each month, we dive into a new theme or creative challenge, giving you fresh ideas and inspiration every time. Led by actor, writer, and award winning facilitator\\u00a0Nadine Gray, you\\u2019ll work on exercises, share ideas, and gain practical tools to develop your plays, musicals, poetry, or other creative writing projects.Drop in whenever you like, these sessions are designed for flexibility, so you can come and go as your schedule allows. Whether you come every month or just for a couple, you\\u2019ll leave with new skills, insights, and inspiration to put into your own work. Come along, get creative, and take your writing to the next level!\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Riverscribes: Monthly Playwriting Drop In Sessions Riverscribes: Monthly Playwriting Drop In Sessions Workshops & Classes  <p><strong>Riverscribes <\\/strong>is a relaxed, fun, and inspiring monthly playwriting sessions for anyone aged 18 and over. Whether you\\u2019re working on a script, curious about writing a play, or just looking for a creative outlet, these drop in sessions are your space to explore, experiment, and develop your writing.<\\/p><p>Each month, we dive into a new theme or creative challenge, giving you fresh ideas and inspiration every time. Led by actor, writer, and award winning facilitator&nbsp;<strong>Nadine Gray<\\/strong>, you\\u2019ll work on exercises, share ideas, and gain practical tools to develop your plays, musicals, poetry, or other creative writing projects.<\\/p><p>Drop in whenever you like, these sessions are designed for flexibility, so you can come and go as your schedule allows. Whether you come every month or just for a couple, you\\u2019ll leave with new skills, insights, and inspiration to put into your own work. Come along, get creative, and take your writing to the next level!<\\/p><p><br>&nbsp;<\\/p> Riverscribes: Monthly Playwriting Drop In Sessions  Riverscribes is a relaxed, fun, and inspiring monthly playwriting sessions for anyone aged 18 and over. Whether you\\u2019re working on a script, curious about writing a play, or just looking for a creative outlet, these drop in sessions are your space to explore, experiment, and develop your writing.Each month, we dive into a new theme or creative challenge, giving you fresh ideas and inspiration every time. Led by actor, writer, and award winning facilitator\\u00a0Nadine Gray, you\\u2019ll work on exercises, share ideas, and gain practical tools to develop your plays, musicals, poetry, or other creative writing projects.Drop in whenever you like, these sessions are designed for flexibility, so you can come and go as your schedule allows. Whether you come every month or just for a couple, you\\u2019ll leave with new skills, insights, and inspiration to put into your own work. Come along, get creative, and take your writing to the next level!\\u00a0 Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Sf-platform\\/\",\"id\":\"2410\",\"name\":\"Platform\",\"title\":\"Platform\",\"duration\":\"150 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1784502000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/146604\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784572200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1784502000],\"times\":[1784572200],\"start_date\":\"1784572200\",\"end_date\":\"1784572200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"WUJpem5mL3dJc0FpQldUV1k0dzBBQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Mon 20 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"Hideout Theatre presents Platform - three celebratory evenings dedicated to new writing from some of London\\u2019s most exciting up-and-coming playwrights.&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/05\\/9a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/059a48faafa58cb6981569364b23c942.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Hideout Theatre presents Platform - three celebratory evenings dedicated to new writing from some of London\\u2019s most exciting up-and-coming playwrights. Each Platform event focuses on two newly-written plays.These evenings include live rehearsed readings from both plays, the sharing of conceptual artwork and sketches, and the opportunity to hear about the processes and development behind the work from the writers themselves.Join us as we get to know the next generation of London playwrights, and become part of the growing theatre-making community.20 JulyRILEY by Brandon Grace:Ray and Jason are old friends revisiting the same memories, relationships and regrets, each searching for a version of the truth about Teri that will let them move on.But as Ray\\u2019s obsession on Teri spirals out of control, Ray and Jason begin to discover that the distance between them may be much smaller than either man wants to admit.RILEY is a darkly comic drama about loneliness, masculinity and the stories we tell ourselves about love.Brandon Grace is an actor and writer based in London. This is his first piece of work being shared to an audience.\\u00a0\\u00a0AFTER THE COLD by Georgie Murphey:Lea\\u2019s father is dead. In three days\\u2019 time, there will be a tribute \\u2013 and Lea needs to create something. Counselled by a dramatherapist, she rebuilds her father as a puppet, navigating her grief through memories and storytelling. But as the tribute approaches, Lea\\u2019s world of imagination becomes a dangerous obsession. \\u00a0AFTER THE COLD explores what it is to remember someone, and what it takes to say goodbye.\\u00a0\\u00a0Georgie Murphy is a playwright and AFTER THE COLD is her debut play. It was longlisted for the 2021 Women\\u2019s Prize for Playwriting and reached the top 35 in the 2023 Papatango Playwriting Prize. Her writing has received developmental support from Paines Plough and the Lyric Theatre Belfast, and dramaturgy from No Such Thing (King\\u2019s Head Theatre).\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/146604\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"search\":\"Platform Platform Theatre  <p>Hideout Theatre presents <i><strong>Platform <\\/strong><\\/i>- three celebratory evenings dedicated to new writing from some of London\\u2019s most exciting up-and-coming playwrights. Each <i>Platform <\\/i>event focuses on two newly-written plays.<\\/p><p>These evenings include live rehearsed readings from both plays, the sharing of conceptual artwork and sketches, and the opportunity to hear about the processes and development behind the work from the writers themselves.<\\/p><p>Join us as we get to know the next generation of London playwrights, and become part of the growing theatre-making community.<\\/p><h2><strong>20 July<\\/strong><\\/h2><p><br><i><strong>RILEY<\\/strong><\\/i><strong> by Brandon Grace:<\\/strong><br><br>Ray and Jason are old friends revisiting the same memories, relationships and regrets, each searching for a version of the truth about Teri that will let them move on.<br><br>But as Ray\\u2019s obsession on Teri spirals out of control, Ray and Jason begin to discover that the distance between them may be much smaller than either man wants to admit.<\\/p><p>RILEY is a darkly comic drama about loneliness, masculinity and the stories we tell ourselves about love.<\\/p><p>Brandon Grace is an actor and writer based in London. This is his first piece of work being shared to an audience.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>AFTER THE COLD<\\/strong><\\/i><strong> by Georgie Murphey:<\\/strong><br><br>Lea\\u2019s father is dead. In three days\\u2019 time, there will be a tribute \\u2013 and Lea needs to create something. Counselled by a dramatherapist, she rebuilds her father as a puppet, navigating her grief through memories and storytelling. But as the tribute approaches, Lea\\u2019s world of imagination becomes a dangerous obsession. &nbsp;<br><br>AFTER THE COLD explores what it is to remember someone, and what it takes to say goodbye.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>Georgie Murphy is a playwright and AFTER THE COLD is her debut play. It was longlisted for the 2021 Women\\u2019s Prize for Playwriting and reached the top 35 in the 2023 Papatango Playwriting Prize. Her writing has received developmental support from Paines Plough and the Lyric Theatre Belfast, and dramaturgy from No Such Thing (King\\u2019s Head Theatre).<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p> Platform  Hideout Theatre presents Platform - three celebratory evenings dedicated to new writing from some of London\\u2019s most exciting up-and-coming playwrights. Each Platform event focuses on two newly-written plays.These evenings include live rehearsed readings from both plays, the sharing of conceptual artwork and sketches, and the opportunity to hear about the processes and development behind the work from the writers themselves.Join us as we get to know the next generation of London playwrights, and become part of the growing theatre-making community.20 JulyRILEY by Brandon Grace:Ray and Jason are old friends revisiting the same memories, relationships and regrets, each searching for a version of the truth about Teri that will let them move on.But as Ray\\u2019s obsession on Teri spirals out of control, Ray and Jason begin to discover that the distance between them may be much smaller than either man wants to admit.RILEY is a darkly comic drama about loneliness, masculinity and the stories we tell ourselves about love.Brandon Grace is an actor and writer based in London. This is his first piece of work being shared to an audience.\\u00a0\\u00a0AFTER THE COLD by Georgie Murphey:Lea\\u2019s father is dead. In three days\\u2019 time, there will be a tribute \\u2013 and Lea needs to create something. Counselled by a dramatherapist, she rebuilds her father as a puppet, navigating her grief through memories and storytelling. But as the tribute approaches, Lea\\u2019s world of imagination becomes a dangerous obsession. \\u00a0AFTER THE COLD explores what it is to remember someone, and what it takes to say goodbye.\\u00a0\\u00a0Georgie Murphy is a playwright and AFTER THE COLD is her debut play. It was longlisted for the 2021 Women\\u2019s Prize for Playwriting and reached the top 35 in the 2023 Papatango Playwriting Prize. Her writing has received developmental support from Paines Plough and the Lyric Theatre Belfast, and dramaturgy from No Such Thing (King\\u2019s Head Theatre).\\u00a0 Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/aD-still-life-objects-workshop\\/\",\"id\":\"3096\",\"name\":\"Still Life Objects Workshop\",\"title\":\"Still Life Objects Workshop\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1784156400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/194201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784223000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1784156400],\"times\":[1784223000],\"start_date\":\"1784223000\",\"end_date\":\"1784223000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"dXpHMVFVRGtGQkFjUW1wTnRIRXlzUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 16 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"Create and explore - objects, composition, technique whilst being immersed in the process!Discover new objects and techniques in this spontaneous art&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/13cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f\\/w1000\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/8213cf5e2e3018605ac2980c2aa9ef5f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Create and explore - objects, composition, technique whilst being immersed in the process!Discover new objects and techniques in this spontaneous art workshop - curated in part by you!\\u00a0 Draw, paint and use mixed media in this intriguing art session!\\u00a0 All you need to do is bring your chosen object on the day to add to the composition arrangement - then watch the session unfold!\\u00a0 As part collaborator in the workshop you will create artwork with individual and personal objects.\\u00a0 Alternatively, you can make the experience your own by drawing or painting your personal still life display with objects available in the session - the choice is yours!\\u00a0This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to explore, experiment and create with plenty of inspiration and conversation along the way!\\u00a0 You\\u2019re welcome to bring your own materials too.\\u00a0 No experience necessary just creative curiosity and an openness to experiment and explore!\\u00a0 Book your place to join us on this exciting creative journey and be inspired through a shared experience!\\u00a0About CURATE & MORE\\u00a0Curate & More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.\\u00a0 Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!To find out more about CURATE & MORE events and services visit our website here.\\u00a0Rating Information:16+ only\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/194201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Still Life Objects Workshop Still Life Objects Workshop Workshops & Classes  <p>Create and explore - objects, composition, technique whilst being immersed in the process!<\\/p><p>Discover new objects and techniques in this spontaneous art workshop - curated in part by you!&nbsp; Draw, paint and use mixed media in this intriguing art session!&nbsp; All you need to do is bring your chosen object on the day to add to the composition arrangement - then watch the session unfold!&nbsp; As part collaborator in the workshop you will create artwork with individual and personal objects.&nbsp; Alternatively, you can make the experience your own by drawing or painting your personal still life display with objects available in the session - the choice is yours!&nbsp;<\\/p><p>This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to explore, experiment and create with plenty of inspiration and conversation along the way!&nbsp; You\\u2019re welcome to bring your own materials too.&nbsp; No experience necessary just creative curiosity and an openness to experiment and explore!&nbsp; Book your place to join us on this exciting creative journey and be inspired through a shared experience!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About CURATE &amp; MORE&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Curate &amp; More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.&nbsp; Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!<\\/p><p>To find out more about CURATE &amp; MORE events and services visit our website <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.curateandmore.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><strong>here.<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Rating Information:<\\/strong><\\/p><p>16+ only<\\/p> Still Life Object Workshops,Still Life Objects Workshop  Create and explore - objects, composition, technique whilst being immersed in the process!Discover new objects and techniques in this spontaneous art workshop - curated in part by you!\\u00a0 Draw, paint and use mixed media in this intriguing art session!\\u00a0 All you need to do is bring your chosen object on the day to add to the composition arrangement - then watch the session unfold!\\u00a0 As part collaborator in the workshop you will create artwork with individual and personal objects.\\u00a0 Alternatively, you can make the experience your own by drawing or painting your personal still life display with objects available in the session - the choice is yours!\\u00a0This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to explore, experiment and create with plenty of inspiration and conversation along the way!\\u00a0 You\\u2019re welcome to bring your own materials too.\\u00a0 No experience necessary just creative curiosity and an openness to experiment and explore!\\u00a0 Book your place to join us on this exciting creative journey and be inspired through a shared experience!\\u00a0About CURATE & MORE\\u00a0Curate & More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.\\u00a0 Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!To find out more about CURATE & MORE events and services visit our website here.\\u00a0Rating Information:16+ only Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/LE-amore-jazz-world-music-night\\/\",\"id\":\"551\",\"name\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night\",\"title\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night\",\"duration\":\"150 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Music\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1789167600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/258804\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1789236900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1792796400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/262002\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1792865700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1795824000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/262201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1795893300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1789167600,1792796400,1795824000],\"times\":[1789236900,1792865700,1795893300],\"start_date\":\"1789236900\",\"end_date\":\"1795893300\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"YjlIN2pvSHdvNHNoOFR4VEthT0IxQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 12 Sep - Sat 28 Nov 2026\",\"text\":\"An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists. Music line-ups for September-December 2026&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/11\\/299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9\\/w504\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/11299d6d8825c5c14d91875c73ec63e9.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"48.5\",\"36.9\"],\"search_text\":\"An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists. Music line-ups for September-December 2026 will be announced in due course.Thursday 9th JulyHeadline Act: Hanna and MagdalenaSussex-based musicians Hanna Burchell and Magdalena Reising bring together distinctive voices, sensitive musicianship and a shared passion for expressive performance.Their collaboration blends rich vocal harmonies with an intimate and engaging musical style.Together, they create performances filled with warmth, creativity and a strong connection with their audience.Their musical partnership offers a refreshing and memorable live experience, celebrating the power of two voices working in harmony.https:\\/\\/music.apple.com\\/us\\/album\\/invisible-threads\\/273487091\\u00a0Support Act: Annabelle BoissonnetAnnabelle Boissonnet is a London-based Franco-Malagasy singer-songwriter with a warm, velvet-soft and expressive voice.Beginning her musical journey in Marseille, she draws inspiration from jazz, soul and world music.Her performances blend elegant vocals, emotional storytelling and influences from her diverse cultural heritage.She performs original material and collaborates with musicians across London\\u2019s vibrant live-music scene.https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/kqftP-Er4-g?si=fvFgSODhoXD6HS95\\u00a0Support Act: Balkan Village BandLed by Gundula Stojanova GruenThe London-based Balkan Village Band, led by Gundula Stojanova Gruen, delivers an uplifting celebration of Balkan folk music and culture. Their spirited performances combine powerful vocals, dynamic rhythms and richly textured instrumental arrangements.Gundula\\u2019s energetic leadership creates a warm connection between the musicians and their audience. The band offers a colourful and joyful live experience that inspires both dancing and a deeper appreciation of Balkan musical traditions.INSTAGRAM: https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/thebalkanvillageband\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"113\"],\"search\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night Amore: Jazz & World Music Night Music  <p><strong>An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists. Music line-ups for September-December 2026 will be announced in due course.<\\/strong><\\/p><h2><strong>Thursday 9th July<\\/strong><\\/h2><p><strong>Headline Act: Hanna and Magdalena<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Sussex-based musicians Hanna Burchell and Magdalena Reising bring together distinctive voices, sensitive musicianship and a shared passion for expressive performance.<\\/p><p>Their collaboration blends rich vocal harmonies with an intimate and engaging musical style.<\\/p><p>Together, they create performances filled with warmth, creativity and a strong connection with their audience.<\\/p><p>Their musical partnership offers a refreshing and memorable live experience, celebrating the power of two voices working in harmony.<\\/p><p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/music.apple.com\\/us\\/album\\/invisible-threads\\/273487091\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/music.apple.com\\/us\\/album\\/invisible-threads\\/273487091<\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Support Act: Annabelle Boissonnet<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Annabelle Boissonnet is a London-based Franco-Malagasy singer-songwriter with a warm, velvet-soft and expressive voice.<\\/p><p>Beginning her musical journey in Marseille, she draws inspiration from jazz, soul and world music.<\\/p><p>Her performances blend elegant vocals, emotional storytelling and influences from her diverse cultural heritage.<\\/p><p>She performs original material and collaborates with musicians across London\\u2019s vibrant live-music scene.<\\/p><p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/kqftP-Er4-g?si=fvFgSODhoXD6HS95\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/kqftP-Er4-g?si=fvFgSODhoXD6HS95<\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Support Act: Balkan Village Band<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Led by Gundula Stojanova Gruen<\\/p><p>The London-based Balkan Village Band, led by Gundula Stojanova Gruen, delivers an uplifting celebration of Balkan folk music and culture. Their spirited performances combine powerful vocals, dynamic rhythms and richly textured instrumental arrangements.<\\/p><p>Gundula\\u2019s energetic leadership creates a warm connection between the musicians and their audience. The band offers a colourful and joyful live experience that inspires both dancing and a deeper appreciation of Balkan musical traditions.<\\/p><p>INSTAGRAM: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/thebalkanvillageband\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/thebalkanvillageband<\\/a><\\/p> Amore: Jazz & World Music Night  An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists. Music line-ups for September-December 2026 will be announced in due course.Thursday 9th JulyHeadline Act: Hanna and MagdalenaSussex-based musicians Hanna Burchell and Magdalena Reising bring together distinctive voices, sensitive musicianship and a shared passion for expressive performance.Their collaboration blends rich vocal harmonies with an intimate and engaging musical style.Together, they create performances filled with warmth, creativity and a strong connection with their audience.Their musical partnership offers a refreshing and memorable live experience, celebrating the power of two voices working in harmony.https:\\/\\/music.apple.com\\/us\\/album\\/invisible-threads\\/273487091\\u00a0Support Act: Annabelle BoissonnetAnnabelle Boissonnet is a London-based Franco-Malagasy singer-songwriter with a warm, velvet-soft and expressive voice.Beginning her musical journey in Marseille, she draws inspiration from jazz, soul and world music.Her performances blend elegant vocals, emotional storytelling and influences from her diverse cultural heritage.She performs original material and collaborates with musicians across London\\u2019s vibrant live-music scene.https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/kqftP-Er4-g?si=fvFgSODhoXD6HS95\\u00a0Support Act: Balkan Village BandLed by Gundula Stojanova GruenThe London-based Balkan Village Band, led by Gundula Stojanova Gruen, delivers an uplifting celebration of Balkan folk music and culture. Their spirited performances combine powerful vocals, dynamic rhythms and richly textured instrumental arrangements.Gundula\\u2019s energetic leadership creates a warm connection between the musicians and their audience. The band offers a colourful and joyful live experience that inspires both dancing and a deeper appreciation of Balkan musical traditions.INSTAGRAM: https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/thebalkanvillageband Music\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/hr-the-invite\\/\",\"id\":\"3800\",\"name\":\"The Invite\",\"title\":\"The Invite\",\"duration\":\"107 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1783724400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\",\"80879\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/267002\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783791000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1783810800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\",\"80879\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/267003\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783861200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_id