101\"],\"search\":\"Rosebush Pruning Rosebush Pruning Cinema  <p>Underneath the Catalonian sun, a rich white American family lives in hedonistic isolation, seeking love and validation through one another, their designer wardrobes and pop music. When an outsider infiltrates the family, buried tensions surface and blood ties are severed. &nbsp;<\\/p><p>An outrageous, biting satire on the absurdity of patriarchal family, from award-winning director Karim A\\u00efnouz and written by Oscar-nominated Efthimis Filippou,<i><strong> ROSEBUSH PRUNING <\\/strong><\\/i>is absurd, funny and in equal measure.<\\/p><figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Age Rating:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>18<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Language:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>English<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Content Warnings:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>sexual violence, strong sex, nudity<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Director:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Karim A\\u00efnouz<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Cast:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Elle Fanning, Jamie Bell, Callum Turner, Riley Keough, Pamela Anderson, Lukas Gage, Tracy Letts, Elena Anaya, Sheila Quevedo, Carlos Conde<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Company:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>MUBI<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Trailers:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>20 mins<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Year of Release:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>2026<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Audio Described:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Yes<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure> Rosebush Pruning  Underneath the Catalonian sun, a rich white American family lives in hedonistic isolation, seeking love and validation through one another, their designer wardrobes and pop music. When an outsider infiltrates the family, buried tensions surface and blood ties are severed. \\u00a0An outrageous, biting satire on the absurdity of patriarchal family, from award-winning director Karim A\\u00efnouz and written by Oscar-nominated Efthimis Filippou, ROSEBUSH PRUNING is absurd, funny and in equal measure.Age Rating:18