\/div>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783936800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1783983600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81002\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/266603\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">12:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784028600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1784070000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81002\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/265602\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">12:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1784113200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1783810800,1783897200,1783983600,1784070000],\"times\":[1783861200,1783936800,1784028600,1784113200],\"start_date\":\"1783861200\",\"end_date\":\"1784113200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"pg\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"MHRDMVcrdU0xdWJvS1VLOEpTZkgzUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 12 - Wed 15 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"Riverside Studios' \\\"Marilyn in the Movies\\\" season celebrates the one and only Marilyn Monroe on the centenary of the birth of cinema\\u2019s most enduring film&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/60\\/6f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx231\\/cw2420\\/ch2417\\/images\\/uploads\\/606f9078486b7876b37099abd38ffe23.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"49.7\",\"53.6\"],\"search_text\":\"Riverside Studios' \\\"Marilyn in the Movies\\\" season celebrates the one and only Marilyn Monroe on the centenary of the birth of cinema\\u2019s most enduring film star! The season includes the centrepiece of the British Film Institute's celebration of Monroe: the BFI rerelease of THE MISFITS (1961), John Huston\\u2019s elegiac anti-Western and Monroe\\u2019s poignant final film.Enjoy a 15% discount if you buy two or more tickets to the season in the same order.Marilyn in the Movies films:GENTLEMEN PREFER BLONDES (1953)SOME LIKE IT HOT (1959)THE MISFITS (1961)\\u00a0THE MISFITS:Central to the BFI\\u2019s centenary celebration of Marilyn Monroe is BFI Distribution\\u2019s re-release of The Misfits (1961), Monroe\\u2019s poignant final film, returning to cinemas in the UK and Ireland in June. John Huston\\u2019s tragic swan song to the western, written by Monroe\\u2019s then-husband Arthur Miller, is a touching and off-beat drama of broken-hearted cowboys and broken-down marriages, co-starring Clark Gable and Montgomery Clift as an aging cowboy and a rodeo-rocked bull rider, both with bittersweet memories of a west that\\u2019s no longer wild. Infused with the promises of what could have been if she had been given more time to explore her skills as a dramatic performer, Monroe delivers one of her very best performances, pouring a devastatingly raw vulnerability and a sincere sentimentality into Roslyn, a delicate divorcee who moves out to the Nevada desert, a gathering ground for misfits, burnouts and empty bottles, and who finds herself falling for a similarly lost cowboy.Language:EnglishContent Warnings:TBCDirector:John HustonCast:Clark Gable, Marilyn Monroe, Montgomery CliftCompany:BFIInterval:NoTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:1961\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81002\"],\"search\":\"The Misfits The Misfits Cinema  <p>Riverside Studios' \\\"<strong>Marilyn in the Movies<\\/strong>\\\" season celebrates the one and only Marilyn Monroe on the centenary of the birth of cinema\\u2019s most enduring film star! The season includes the centrepiece of the British Film Institute's celebration of Monroe: the BFI rerelease of THE MISFITS (1961), John Huston\\u2019s elegiac anti-Western and Monroe\\u2019s poignant final film.<\\/p><p><strong>Enjoy a 15% discount if you buy two or more tickets to the season in the same order.<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Marilyn in the Movies films:<\\/p><ul><li><i>GENTLEMEN PREFER BLONDES (1953)<\\/i><\\/li><li><i>SOME LIKE IT HOT (1959)<\\/i><\\/li><li><i>THE MISFITS (1961)<\\/i><\\/li><\\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>THE MISFITS:<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Central to the BFI\\u2019s centenary celebration of Marilyn Monroe is BFI Distribution\\u2019s re-release of The Misfits (1961), Monroe\\u2019s poignant final film, returning to cinemas in the UK and Ireland in June. John Huston\\u2019s tragic swan song to the western, written by Monroe\\u2019s then-husband Arthur Miller, is a touching and off-beat drama of broken-hearted cowboys and broken-down marriages, co-starring Clark Gable and Montgomery Clift as an aging cowboy and a rodeo-rocked bull rider, both with bittersweet memories of a west that\\u2019s no longer wild. Infused with the promises of what could have been if she had been given more time to explore her skills as a dramatic performer, Monroe delivers one of her very best performances, pouring a devastatingly raw vulnerability and a sincere sentimentality into Roslyn, a delicate divorcee who moves out to the Nevada desert, a gathering ground for misfits, burnouts and empty bottles, and who finds herself falling for a similarly lost cowboy.<\\/p><figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Language:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>English<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Content Warnings:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>TBC<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Director:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>John Huston<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Cast:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Clark Gable, Marilyn Monroe, Montgomery Clift<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Company:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>BFI<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Interval:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>No<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Trailers:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>20 mins<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Year of Release:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>1961<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure> The Misfits  Riverside Studios' \\\"Marilyn in the Movies\\\" season celebrates the one and only Marilyn Monroe on the centenary of the birth of cinema\\u2019s most enduring film star! The season includes the centrepiece of the British Film Institute's celebration of Monroe: the BFI rerelease of THE MISFITS (1961), John Huston\\u2019s elegiac anti-Western and Monroe\\u2019s poignant final film.Enjoy a 15% discount if you buy two or more tickets to the season in the same order.Marilyn in the Movies films:GENTLEMEN PREFER BLONDES (1953)SOME LIKE IT HOT (1959)THE MISFITS (1961)\\u00a0THE MISFITS:Central to the BFI\\u2019s centenary celebration of Marilyn Monroe is BFI Distribution\\u2019s re-release of The Misfits (1961), Monroe\\u2019s poignant final film, returning to cinemas in the UK and Ireland in June. John Huston\\u2019s tragic swan song to the western, written by Monroe\\u2019s then-husband Arthur Miller, is a touching and off-beat drama of broken-hearted cowboys and broken-down marriages, co-starring Clark Gable and Montgomery Clift as an aging cowboy and a rodeo-rocked bull rider, both with bittersweet memories of a west that\\u2019s no longer wild. Infused with the promises of what could have been if she had been given more time to explore her skills as a dramatic performer, Monroe delivers one of her very best performances, pouring a devastatingly raw vulnerability and a sincere sentimentality into Roslyn, a delicate divorcee who moves out to the Nevada desert, a gathering ground for misfits, burnouts and empty bottles, and who finds herself falling for a similarly lost cowboy.Language:EnglishContent Warnings:TBCDirector:John HustonCast:Clark Gable, Marilyn Monroe, Montgomery CliftCompany:BFIInterval:NoTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:1961 Cinema PG\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/hi-live-dj-nights-free-entry\\/\",\"id\":\"3827\",\"name\":\"LIVE DJ NIGHTS\",\"title\":\"LIVE DJ NIGHTS - Free Entry\",\"duration\":\"\",\"slot_tag\":\"Events\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"0\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"80951\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[],\"times\":[],\"start_date\":\"1783785600\",\"end_date\":\"1784404800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"WnhMeDhqVmNGdnZRTHVWZkJGTUs4Zz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 11 - Sat 18 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"Dates: 11 July &amp; 18 JulyTime: 5 pm - 9 pmLocation: Riverside Bar &amp; Restaurant, Riverside StudiosAdmission: Free EntryAs the sun sets over the&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w2295\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/56\\/f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6\\/w2295\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/56f47bd742611218ad22e22af7c713d6.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Dates: 11 July & 18 JulyTime: 5 pm - 9 pmLocation: Riverside Bar & Restaurant, Riverside StudiosAdmission: Free EntryAs the sun sets over the Thames, Riverside Studios turns up the volume with Live DJ Nights on our riverside terrace and bar. Join us for an evening of great music, drinks, and summer vibes with live DJ sets overlooking the iconic Hammersmith Bridge.Whether you're meeting friends,, enjoying a cocktail by the river, or making the most of a summer evening in West London, our DJs will provide the soundtrack with a mix of laid-back grooves, feel-good classics and weekend anthems.Grab a drink, soak up the atmosphere, and enjoy one of London's most scenic riverside settings.No tickets. Just good music, great drinks, and summer by the river.\\u00a0Food and drinks available throughout the evening.\",\"book_link\":\"no-link\",\"event_type\":[\"80951\"],\"search\":\"LIVE DJ NIGHTS LIVE DJ NIGHTS - Free Entry Events  <p><strong>Dates:<\\/strong> 11 July &amp; 18 July<br><strong>Time:<\\/strong> 5 pm - 9 pm<br><strong>Location:<\\/strong> Riverside Bar &amp; Restaurant, Riverside Studios<br><strong>Admission:<\\/strong> Free Entry<\\/p><p>As the sun sets over the Thames, Riverside Studios turns up the volume with <strong>Live DJ Nights<\\/strong> on our riverside terrace and bar. Join us for an evening of great music, drinks, and summer vibes with live DJ sets overlooking the iconic Hammersmith Bridge.<\\/p><p>Whether you're meeting friends,, enjoying a cocktail by the river, or making the most of a summer evening in West London, our DJs will provide the soundtrack with a mix of laid-back grooves, feel-good classics and weekend anthems.<\\/p><p>Grab a drink, soak up the atmosphere, and enjoy one of London's most scenic riverside settings.<\\/p><p><strong>No tickets. Just good music, great drinks, and summer by the river.<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>Food and drinks available throughout the evening.<\\/i><\\/p>   Dates: 11 July & 18 JulyTime: 5 pm - 9 pmLocation: Riverside Bar & Restaurant, Riverside StudiosAdmission: Free EntryAs the sun sets over the Thames, Riverside Studios turns up the volume with Live DJ Nights on our riverside terrace and bar. Join us for an evening of great music, drinks, and summer vibes with live DJ sets overlooking the iconic Hammersmith Bridge.Whether you're meeting friends,, enjoying a cocktail by the river, or making the most of a summer evening in West London, our DJs will provide the soundtrack with a mix of laid-back grooves, feel-good classics and weekend anthems.Grab a drink, soak up the atmosphere, and enjoy one of London's most scenic riverside settings.No tickets. Just good music, great drinks, and summer by the river.\\u00a0Food and drinks available throughout the evening. Events\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uqD-alpha\\/\",\"id\":\"4212\",\"name\":\"Alpha\",\"title\":\"Alpha\",\"duration\":\"141 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1783724400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/265203\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:50<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783795800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1783810800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/266202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div cla