\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/0f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx549\\/cy21\\/cw2032\\/ch2027\\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/0f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx549\\/cy21\\/cw2032\\/ch2027\\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/0f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx549\\/cy21\\/cw2032\\/ch2027\\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/0f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx549\\/cy21\\/cw2032\\/ch2027\\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/0f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx549\\/cy21\\/cw2032\\/ch2027\\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/0f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx549\\/cy21\\/cw2032\\/ch2027\\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/0f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx549\\/cy21\\/cw2032\\/ch2027\\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/0f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx549\\/cy21\\/cw2032\\/ch2027\\/images\\/uploads\\/c00f04f0b936eea8e27afaa7a0b7d37f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"47.8\",\"48.3\"],\"search_text\":\"Wake up homo! You\\u2019re invited to Mad Jacks\\u2019 3rd Birthday Party!In June 2023, a transsexual woman told me to make a theatre company so she could put our production of Overflow on Spotlight. Three years later, we\\u2019re inviting some of our nearest and dearest to celebrate with a lineup spanning poetry, comedy, new writing and music.Oh\\u2026 and did we mention the second outrageous year of the Mad Jacks Theatre Awards!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!Following the raucous sell-out successes of\\u00a0GROWN UPS!\\u00a0and\\u00a0SEX SELLS!, this promises to be the half-mental, half-magic event of the Summer.Mad Jacks are fundraising for their forthcoming run of\\u00a02 BY 2\\u00a0at the Edinburgh Fringe. Tickets available now!Recommended age: 16+\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/159401\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"search\":\"Mad Jacks' 3rd Birthday Party Mad Jacks' 3rd Birthday Party Theatre  <p>Wake up homo! You\\u2019re invited to <strong>Mad Jacks\\u2019 3rd Birthday Party<\\/strong>!<\\/p><p>In June 2023, a transsexual woman told me to make a theatre company so she could put our production of Overflow on Spotlight. Three years later, we\\u2019re inviting some of our nearest and dearest to celebrate with a lineup spanning poetry, comedy, new writing and music.<\\/p><p>Oh\\u2026 and did we mention the second outrageous year of the Mad Jacks Theatre Awards!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<\\/p><p>Following the raucous sell-out successes of&nbsp;<i>GROWN UPS!&nbsp;<\\/i>and&nbsp;<i>SEX SELLS!<\\/i>, this promises to be the half-mental, half-magic event of the Summer.<\\/p><p><strong>Mad Jacks<\\/strong> are fundraising for their forthcoming run of&nbsp;<i>2 BY 2<\\/i>&nbsp;at the Edinburgh Fringe. Tickets available now!<\\/p><p><strong>Recommended age: 16+<\\/strong><\\/p> Mad Jacks' 3rd Birthday Party  Wake up homo! You\\u2019re invited to Mad Jacks\\u2019 3rd Birthday Party!In June 2023, a transsexual woman told me to make a theatre company so she could put our production of Overflow on Spotlight. Three years later, we\\u2019re inviting some of our nearest and dearest to celebrate with a lineup spanning poetry, comedy, new writing and music.Oh\\u2026 and did we mention the second outrageous year of the Mad Jacks Theatre Awards!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!Following the raucous sell-out successes of\\u00a0GROWN UPS!\\u00a0and\\u00a0SEX SELLS!, this promises to be the half-mental, half-magic event of the Summer.Mad Jacks are fundraising for their forthcoming run of\\u00a02 BY 2\\u00a0at the Edinburgh Fringe. Tickets available now!Recommended age: 16+ Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/hX-pitchblack-playback-jay-z-reasonable-doubt-30th-anniversary\\/\",\"id\":\"3833\",\"name\":\"Pitchblack Playback: JAY-Z 'Reasonable Doubt' (30th Anniversary)\",\"title\":\"Pitchblack Playback: JAY-Z 'Reasonable Doubt' (30th Anniversary)\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1783897200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/245201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1783969200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1783897200],\"times\":[1783969200],\"start_date\":\"1783969200\",\"end_date\":\"1783969200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"15\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"bXZhVEozVmJhMnRqSitPK1dFT1RQdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Mon 13 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"*Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted and refunds will not be offered*Immerse yourself in one of the greatest hip hop&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/51\\/ac6085a8f81dcb4f1f1125f9d07fce\\/w880\\/q80\\/cw1000\\/ch1000\\/images\\/uploads\\/51ac6085a8f81dcb4f1f1125f9d07fce.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\