iversary) Cinema  <h3>*Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted and refunds will not be offered*<\\/h3><p>Immerse yourself in one of the greatest hip hop albums of all-time at <strong>Pitchblack Playback'<\\/strong>s listening session in the dark, celebrating its 30th anniversary. Hear this stunning album played loud in uncompressed audio on our powerful Screen One cinema sound system.<\\/p><p>No phones; no talking; no signing; no distractions; just you and the music.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\\"This sounds great\\u201d \\u2014 Rick Rubin<\\/p><p>\\\"A fabulous idea\\\" \\u2014 Jay Kay, Jamiroquai<\\/p><p>\\\"The optimal way to listen to an album\\\" \\u2014 Max Richter<\\/p><p>\\\"This might just be my favourite new thing to do\\\" \\u2014 Nihal, BBC Radio 5 Live<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Ticket includes recycled cotton Pitchblack Playback eye mask for extra darkness.<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>As recommended by The Guardian, GQ, Time Out and BBC 6 Music.<\\/strong><\\/p> Pitchblack Playback: JAY-Z 'Reasonable Doubt' (30th Anniversary)  *Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted and refunds will not be offered*Immerse yourself in one of the greatest hip hop albums of all-time at Pitchblack Playback's listening session in the dark, celebrating its 30th anniversary. Hear this stunning album played loud in uncompressed audio on our powerful Screen One cinema sound system.No phones; no talking; no signing; no distractions; just you and the music.\\u00a0\\\"This sounds great\\u201d \\u2014 Rick Rubin\\\"A fabulous idea\\\" \\u2014 Jay Kay, Jamiroquai\\\"The optimal way to listen to an album\\\" \\u2014 Max Richter\\\"This might just be my favourite new thing to do\\\" \\u2014 Nihal, BBC Radio 5 Live\\u00a0Ticket includes recycled cotton Pitchblack Playback eye mask for extra darkness.As recommended by The Guardian, GQ, Time Out and BBC 6 Music. 15 Cinema\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-o