eab3.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a4\\/d5aa61016f8953212cec3e0870eab3\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a4d5aa61016f8953212cec3e0870eab3.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a4\\/d5aa61016f8953212cec3e0870eab3\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a4d5aa61016f8953212cec3e0870eab3.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"49.6\",\"39.0\"],\"search_text\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie finds Mario and Luigi solving everyday problems in the Mushroom Kingdom with their \\\"let's-a-go\\\" attitude. They meet a new friend in Yoshi, try to reform a miniaturized Bowser, and eagerly look forward to Peach's birthday party. A call for help sends the crew across the galaxy to face new worlds, unexpected threats, and iconic characters like Rosalina and Bowser Jr.Age Rating:PGLanguage:EnglishContent Warnings:mild violence, threatDirector:Aaron Horvath & Michael JelenicCast:Chris Pratt, Anya Taylor-Joy, Brie Larson, Virginia Dare Jelenic, Benny Safdie, Kevin Michael Richardson, Charlie Day, Donald Glover, Keegan-Michael Key, Eric BauzaCompany:UniversalTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:2026Audio Described:Yes\",\"book_link\":false,\"accessibility\":[\"80879\"],\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81002\"],\"cinema\":[\"81005\"],\"search\":\"Kids' Club: The Super Mario Galaxy Movie Kids' Club: The Super Mario Galaxy Movie Cinema  <p><i><strong>The Super Mario Galaxy Movie <\\/strong><\\/i>finds Mario and Luigi solving everyday problems in the Mushroom Kingdom with their \\\"let's-a-go\\\" attitude. They meet a new friend in Yoshi, try to reform a miniaturized Bowser, and eagerly look forward to Peach's birthday party. A call for help sends the crew across the galaxy to face new worlds, unexpected threats, and iconic characters like Rosalina and Bowser Jr.<\\/p><figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Age Rating:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>PG<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Language:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>English<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Content Warnings:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>mild violence, threat<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Director:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Aaron Horvath &amp; Michael Jelenic<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Cast:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Chris Pratt, Anya Taylor-Joy, Brie Larson, Virginia Dare Jelenic, Benny Safdie, Kevin Michael Richardson, Charlie Day, Donald Glover, Keegan-Michael Key, Eric Bauza<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Company:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Universal<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Trailers:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>20 mins<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Year of Release:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>2026<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Audio Described:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Yes<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure> Kids' Club: The Super Mario Galaxy Movie  The Super Mario Galaxy Movie finds Mario and Luigi solving everyday problems in the Mushroom Kingdom with their \\\"let's-a-go\\\" attitude. They meet a new friend in Yoshi, try to reform a miniaturized Bowser, and eagerly look forward to Peach's birthday party. A call for help sends the crew across the galaxy to face new worlds, unexpected threats, and iconic characters like Rosalina and Bowser Jr.Age Rating:PGLanguage:EnglishContent Warnings:mild violence, threatDirector:Aaron Horvath & Michael JelenicCast:Chris Pratt, Anya Taylor-Joy, Brie Larson, Virginia Dare Jelenic, Benny Safdie, Kevin Michael Richardson, Charlie Day, Donald Glover, Keegan-Michael Key, Eric BauzaCompany:UniversalTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:2026Audio Described:Yes Audio Described Cinema PG Kids' Club\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uPz-spartacus\\/\",\"id\":\"4071\",\"name\":\"Spartacus\",\"title\":\"Spartacus\",\"duration\":\"196 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1784934000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81002\",\"81024\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.u