nsory medley of a wild night out.<\\/p><p><strong>Olivier <\\/strong>and <strong>Tony nominated<\\/strong> Carrie-Anne Ingrouille (<i>SIX the Musical<\\/i>) directs this distinctly un-romantic dark comedy and \\u201cfascinating exploration\\u201d (Daniel Finkelstein, The Times) of the greyest areas of consent and sexual politics.<\\/p><p>This strictly limited preview run offers London audiences the chance to see the production ahead of its Edinburgh Fringe premiere.<\\/p> We Had Fun  Where did it all go wrong? Well, it depends who you ask. Close friends Oscar and Ela navigate the fallout of a drunken sexual encounter as their conflicting versions of events are replayed, rewound and re-written against the sensory medley of a wild night out.Olivier and Tony nominated Carrie-Anne Ingrouille (SIX the Musical) directs this distinctly un-romantic dark comedy and \\u201cfascinating exploration\\u201d (Daniel Finkelstein, The Times) of the greyest areas of consent and sexual politics.This strictly limited preview run offers London audiences the chance to see the production ahead of its Edinburgh Fringe premiere. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/h0-gutted\\/\",\"id\":\"3826\",\"name\":\"GUTTED\",\"title\":\"GUTTED\",\"duration\":\"45 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785106800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/244004\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785181500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1785106800],\"times\":[1785181500],\"start_date\":\"1785181500\",\"end_date\":\"1785181500\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"WEo2WndlOGI3Nk5xUXBWN09GbGUrQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"