f901b083d13dd1b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/971f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/97\\/1f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/971f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/97\\/1f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/971f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/97\\/1f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/971f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/97\\/1f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/971f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/97\\/1f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/971f1842ddc7c855ff901b083d13dd1b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"\\u201cYou bitch for making me say Ricotta Salata al Peperoncino!\\u201dGUTTED is an absurd, ridiculous, saucy and sexy two-hander where cooking is courtship and food is foreplay \\u2013 but when a digestive diagnosis kills the thrill of eating, Reuben (Morgan Beale) and Honey (Louise Lacassagne) must reinvent their appetite for love. This sharp, silly and ultimately heart-warming new play will leave you smiling and searching for the nearest restaurant to curb those pangs of hunger.Morgan Beale is a London based actor who has worked across theatre, TV and film, including a role in the 2025 Netflix film Jay Kelly.Louise Lacassagne is an actor and singer from the north-west of England, who graduated from the 3 year BA Acting course at the Royal Academy of Dramatic Art (RADA) in 2025.Amber Charlie Conroy is an Irish writer\\/director\\/ producer and co-founder of Talkers & Doers. She is co-writer and director of the critically acclaimed, multi-award winning solo show Clean Slate. She is the 2026 recipient of the Summerhall Arts x Hugo Burge Foundation New Writing Residency for her play Babyplay. Amber's work blends academically-driven storytelling with character-led humour; exploring love, rage, food and sex with a distinctive rhythm, wit and audience focus.Reya Muller is a writer and director, who founded production company lowdoor productions in 2021. She is interested in work which reinvents perceptions of our literary past, and bold new writing which speaks to the contemporary moment. She also loves food.Assistant Director: Isabelle TynerSound Designer: Tom MullerLighting Designer: Andy Owen CookThis production premiered as part of the One Act Festival at the Union Theatre in May, where it won three awards for Best New Writing, Best Direction and Best Female Performance.\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/244004\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"GUTTED GUTTED Bitesize  <p><strong>\\u201cYou bitch for making me say Ricotta Salata al Peperoncino!\\u201d<\\/strong><\\/p><p><i><strong>GUTTED<\\/strong><\\/i> is an absurd, ridiculous, saucy and sexy two-hander where cooking is courtship and food is foreplay \\u2013 but when a digestive diagnosis kills the thrill of eating, Reuben (Morgan Beale) and Honey (Louise Lacassagne) must reinvent their appetite for love. This sharp, silly and ultimately heart-warming new play will leave you smiling and searching for the nearest restaurant to curb those pangs of hunger.<\\/p><p><strong>Morgan Beale<\\/strong> is a London based actor who has worked across theatre, TV and film, including a role in the 2025 Netflix film Jay Kelly.<\\/p><p><strong>Louise Lacassagne <\\/strong>is an actor and singer from the north-west of England, who graduated from the 3 year BA Acting course at the Royal Academy of Dramatic Art (RADA) in 2025.<\\/p><p><strong>Amber Charlie Conroy<\\/strong> is an Irish writer\\/director\\/ producer and co-founder of Talkers &amp; Doers. She is co-writer and director of the critically acclaimed, multi-award winning solo show Clean Slate. She is the 2026 recipient of the Summerhall Arts x Hugo Burge Foundation New Writing Residency for her play Babyplay. Amber's work blends academically-driven storytelling with character-led humour; exploring love, rage, food and sex with a distinctive rhythm, wit and audience focus.<\\/p><p><strong>Reya Muller<\\/strong> is a writer and director, who founded production company lowdoor productions in 2021. She is interested in work which reinvents perceptions of our literary past, and bold new writing which speaks to the contemporary moment. She also loves food.<\\/p><p><strong>Assistant Director: <\\/strong>Isabelle Tyner<\\/p><p><strong>Sound Designer: <\\/strong>Tom Muller<\\/p><p><strong>Lighting Designer:<\\/strong> Andy Owen Cook<\\/p><p>This production premiered as part of the One Act Festival at the Union Theatre in May, where it won three awards for Best New Writing, Best Direction and Best Female Performance.&nbsp;<\\/p> GUTTED  \\u201cYou bitch for making me say Ricotta Salata al Peperoncino!\\u201dGUTTED is an absurd, ridiculous, saucy and sexy two-hander where cooking is courtship and food is foreplay \\u2013 but when a digestive diagnosis kills the thrill of eating, Reuben (Morgan Beale) and Honey (Louise Lacassagne) must reinvent their appetite for love. This sharp, silly and ultimately heart-warming new play will leave you smiling and searching for the nearest restaurant to curb those pangs of hunger.Morgan Beale is a London based actor who has worked across theatre, TV and film, including a role in the 2025 Netflix film Jay Kelly.Louise Lacassagne is an actor and singer from the north-west of England, who graduated from the 3 year BA Acting course at the Royal Academy of Dramatic Art (RADA) in 2025.Amber Charlie Conroy is an Irish writer\\/director\\/ producer and co-founder of Talkers & Doers. She is co-writer and director of the critically acclaimed, multi-award winning solo show Clean Slate. She is the 2026 recipient of the Summerhall Arts x Hugo Burge Foundation New Writing Residency for her play Babyplay. Amber's work blends academically-driven storytelling with character-led humour; exploring love, rage, food and sex with a distinctive rhythm, wit and audience focus.Reya Muller is a writer and director, who founded production company lowdoor productions in 2021. She is interested in work which reinvents perceptions of our literary past, and bold new writing which speaks to the contemporary moment. She also loves food.Assistant Director: Isabelle TynerSound Designer: Tom MullerLighting Designer: Andy Owen CookThis production premiered as part of the One Act Festival at the Union Theatre in May, where it won three awards for Best New Writing, Best Direction and Best Female Performance.\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uAd-crush\\/\",\"id\":\"3846\",\"name\":\"Crush\",\"title\":\"Crush\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785193200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/246601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785261600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785279600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/245803\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785334500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/245804\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785348000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785366000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/246402\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785440700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1785193200,1785279600,1785279600,1785366000],\"times\":[1785261600,1785334500,1785348000,1785440700],\"start_date\":\"1785261600\",\"end_date\":\"1785440700\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"aVl2Sjc4TVFUbzJNM3E4RDlXenh1dz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 28 - Thu 30 Jul 2026\",\"text\":\"A clinic waiting room. Two Somali teens. One awkward meet-cute.Najma has been in treatment for years. Zakariya\\u2019s just starting out. She sketches. He writes&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e9\\/df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/e9df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e9\\/df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e9df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e9\\/df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e9df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e9\\/df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e9df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e9\\/df0142bc477698b23d971c25765c1c\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e9df0142bc477698b23d971c