e awkward meet-cute.Najma has been in treatment for years. Zakariya\\u2019s just starting out. She sketches. He writes poems. Neither of them is ready to talk. Until they meet each other.As their sessions continue, so do the chats. And the jokes. And the secrets.Crush\\u00a0is a tender, funny and honest story about identity, connection and the messy path to healing.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Crush Crush Bitesize  <p>A clinic waiting room. Two Somali teens. One awkward meet-cute.<\\/p><p>Najma has been in treatment for years. Zakariya\\u2019s just starting out. She sketches. He writes poems. Neither of them is ready to talk. Until they meet each other.<\\/p><p>As their sessions continue, so do the chats. And the jokes. And the secrets.<\\/p><p><i><strong>Crush&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/i>is a tender, funny and honest story about identity, connection and the messy path to healing.<\\/p> Crush  A clinic waiting room. Two Somali teens. One awkward meet-cute.Najma has been in treatment for years. Zakariya\\u2019s just starting out. She sketches. He writes poems. Neither of them is ready to talk. Until they meet each other.As their sessions continue, so do the chats. And the jokes. And the secrets.Crush\\u00a0is a tender, funny and honest story about identity, connection and the messy path to healing. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/udY-pitchblack-mixtapes-logical-progression-disc-1-30th-anniversary\\/\",\"id\":\"4028\",\"name\":\"Pitchblack Mixtapes: Logical Progression (Disc 1) (30th Anniversary)\",\"title\":\"Pitchblack Mixtapes: Logical Progression (Disc 1) (30th Anniversary)\",\"duration\":\"77 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785279600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/251801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\