"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w2480\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e4\\/66ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31\\/w2480\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e466ec3716c406634d35102c7ae90c31.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"In A Fable, three familiar stories unravel and reshape before your eyes.A loyal dog is killed in a moment of misjudgment. A wolf repays kindness with cruelty. A ruler parades in invisible clothes while an entire society pretends not to see. As characters reappear and stories shift, truth becomes unstable, and morality begins to slip.Using suitcase puppetry, object transformation, and striking visual storytelling, A Fable invites audiences into a world where the same figures return in different roles \\u2014 victim, witness, and accomplice.Playful, unsettling, and darkly humorous, the performance asks:If everyone can see the truth, why does no one speak?\\u00a0Writer: Jessica Ji and Yu SongDirector: Jessica JiProducer: Yu SongDramaturge: Xinyu LuSound Designer: Antian BiPuppet Designer\\/maker: Jessica Ji, Melody Bainbridge-Todd, Yunchu Chiu, Yu SongPerformer: Jessica Ji, Melody Bainbridge-Todd, Yu Song\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"A Fable A Fable Bitesize  <p>In <i><strong>A Fable<\\/strong><\\/i>, three familiar stories unravel and reshape before your eyes.<\\/p><p>A loyal dog is killed in a moment of misjudgment. A wolf repays kindness with cruelty. A ruler parades in invisible clothes while an entire society pretends not to see. As characters reappear and stories shift, truth becomes unstable, and morality begins to slip.<\\/p><p>Using suitcase puppetry, object transformation, and striking visual storytelling, <i>A Fable<\\/i> invites audiences into a world where the same figures return in different roles \\u2014 victim, witness, and accomplice.<\\/p><p>Playful, unsettling, and darkly humorous, the performance asks:<\\/p><p>If everyone can see the truth, why does no one speak?<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Writer: Jessica Ji and Yu Song<\\/p><p>Director: Jessica Ji<\\/p><p>Producer: Yu Song<\\/p><p>Dramaturge: Xinyu Lu<\\/p><p>Sound Designer: Antian Bi<\\/p><p>Puppet Designer\\/maker: Jessica Ji, Melody Bainbridge-Todd, Yunchu Chiu, Yu Song<\\/p><p>Performer: Jessica Ji, Melody Bainbridge-Todd, Yu Song<\\/p> A Fables,A Fable  In A Fable, three familiar stories unravel and reshape before your eyes.A loyal dog is killed in a moment of misjudgment. A wolf repays kindness with cruelty. A ruler parades in invisible clothes while an entire society pretends not to see. As characters reappear and stories shift, truth becomes unstable, and morality begins to slip.Using suitcase puppetry, object transformation, and striking visual storytelling, A Fable invites audiences into a world where the same figures return in different roles \\u2014 victim, witness, and accomplice.Playful, unsettling, and darkly humorous, the performance asks:If everyone can see the truth, why does no one speak?\\u00a0Writer: Jessica Ji and Yu SongDirector: Jessica JiProducer: Yu SongDramaturge: Xinyu LuSound Designer: Antian BiPuppet Designer\\/maker: Jessica Ji, Melody Bainbridge-Todd, Yunchu Chiu, Yu SongPerformer: Jessica Ji, Melody Bainbridge-Todd, Yu Song Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/yw-ray\\/\",\"id\":\"3478\",\"name\":\"Ray\",\"title\":\"Ray\",\"duration\":\"45 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785366000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_n