\\/images\\/custom\\/37\\/0f8448cb0c2e38da373f3e5b9f1219\\/w1448\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/370f8448cb0c2e38da373f3e5b9f1219.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/37\\/0f8448cb0c2e38da373f3e5b9f1219\\/w1448\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/370f8448cb0c2e38da373f3e5b9f1219.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/37\\/0f8448cb0c2e38da373f3e5b9f1219\\/w1448\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/370f8448cb0c2e38da373f3e5b9f1219.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/37\\/0f8448cb0c2e38da373f3e5b9f1219\\/w1448\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/370f8448cb0c2e38da373f3e5b9f1219.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Ray is a verbatim play about what it means to remember someone through stories rather than your own memories.After the death of her great uncle, Raymond Watkiss, a young woman revisits his life through recorded conversations with family members, gathering fragments that never quite form a complete picture.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Ray Ray Bitesize  <p><i><strong>Ray <\\/strong><\\/i>is a verbatim play about what it means to remember someone through stories rather than your own memories.<\\/p><p>After the death of her great uncle, Raymond Watkiss, a young woman revisits his life through recorded conversations with family members, gathering fragments that never quite form a complete picture.<\\/p> Ray  Ray is a verbatim play about what it means to remember someone through stories rather than your own memories.After the death of her great uncle, Raymond Watkiss, a young woman revisits his life through recorded conversations with family members, gathering fragments that never quite form a complete picture. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/5f-big-dog\\/\",\"id\":\"3712\",\"name\":\"Big Dog\",\"title\":\"Big Dog\",\"duration\":\"\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_t