8.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9f\\/b65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9fb65b8dfe4a4c82577f5a10c0d15718.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Eve lands a ghostwriting job for a major true crime podcaster. Should be easy, right? She's intelligent and doesn't care about rising through the ranks. Besides, she has her own hidden agenda. But as the boundaries between ethics, ambition and self-preservation blur, Eve finds herself overly invested and increasingly implicated in the very systems she is questioning.Big Dog\\u00a0is a comedy which interrogates the true crime industry, influencer culture and workplace politics. It asks who gets to tell certain stories, who profits from them, and who ultimately bears the emotional consequences.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Big Dog Big Dog Bitesize  <p>Eve lands a ghostwriting job for a major true crime podcaster. Should be easy, right? She's intelligent and doesn't care about rising through the ranks. Besides, she has her own hidden agenda. But as the boundaries between ethics, ambition and self-preservation blur, Eve finds herself overly invested and increasingly implicated in the very systems she is questioning.<\\/p><p><i>Big Dog<\\/i>&nbsp;is a comedy which interrogates the true crime industry, influencer culture and workplace politics. It asks who gets to tell certain stories, who profits from them, and who ultimately bears the emotional consequences.<\\/p> Big Dog  Eve lands a ghostwriting job for a major true crime podcaster. Should be easy, right? She's intelligent and doesn't care about rising through the ranks. Besides, she has her own hidden agenda. But as the boundaries between ethics, ambition and self-preservation blur, Eve finds herself overly invested and increasingly implicated in the very systems she is questioning.Big Dog\\u00a0is a comedy which interrogates the true crime industry, influencer culture and workplace politics. It asks who gets to tell certain stories, who profits from them, and who ultimately bears the emotional consequences. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/YR-am-i-losing-my-mind-or-just-my-figure\\/\",\"id\":\"3757\",\"name\":\"Am I Losing My Mind Or Just My Figure?\",\"title\":\" Am I Losing My Mind Or Just My Figure?\",\"duration\":\"57 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785452400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/238201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785507300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785538800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/238401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785591000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785625200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/238601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785677400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1785452400,1785538800,1785625200],\"times\":[1785507300,1785591000,1785677400],\"start_date\":\"1785507300\",\"end_date\":\"1785677400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"a0F6OHh0d3Z0bDZCdHJPL3BNTUVPZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 31 Jul - Sun 2 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"A bike, a bump and an excessive amount of roast beef blinis. A must-see for anyone navigating the beautiful chaos of womanhood. This strikingly original,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cf\\/81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/cf81b648faa4295d4e18750ecb2c7510.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"A bike, a bump and an excessive amount of roast beef blinis. A must-see for anyone navigating the beautiful chaos of womanhood. This strikingly original, physical and achingly human solo show hilariously tackles life, parenthood and what it means to be a woman.\\u201cWhat is it about becoming thirty that gives everyone universal permission to offer advice on when you\\u2019re going to reproduce?\\u201d This Offie nominated play tells the story of Fin whose world shifts when she unexpectedly falls pregnant, her unconventional career as a zero-hour cycle courier and freelance illustrator suddenly colliding headlong with societal norms and expectations. Untethered + Hinterland bring their uniquely collaborative style to the stage\\/Riverside Studios with a show that captures the millennial female zeitgeist and holds space for the quietly heavy things that shape us all.London Pub Theatres \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0Everything Theatre \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0Theatre To See London \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0London Theatre1 \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Am I Losing My Mind Or Just My Figure?  Am I Losing My Mind Or Just My Figure? Bitesize  <p>A bike, a bump and an excessive amount of roast beef blinis. A must-see for anyone navigating the beautiful chaos of womanhood. This strikingly original, physical and achingly human solo show hilariously tackles life, parenthood and what it means to be a woman.<br><br>\\u201cWhat is it about becoming thirty that gives everyone universal permission to offer advice on when you\\u2019re going to reproduce?\\u201d This Offie nominated play tells the story of Fin whose world shifts when she unexpectedly falls pregnant, her unconventional career as a zero-hour cycle courier and freelance illustrator suddenly colliding headlong with societal norms and expectations. Untethered + Hinterland bring their uniquely collaborative style to the stage\\/Riverside Studios with a show that captures the millennial female zeitgeist and holds space for the quietly heavy things that shape us all.<br><br>London Pub Theatres \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605&nbsp;<br>Everything Theatre \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605&nbsp;<br>Theatre To See London \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605&nbsp;<br>London Theatre1 \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605<\\/p>  Am I Losing My Mind Or Just My Figure?  A bike, a bump and an excessive amount of roast beef blinis. A must-see for anyone navigating the beautiful chaos of womanhood. This strikingly original, physical and achingly human solo show hilariously tackles life, parenthood and what it means to be a woman.\\u201cWhat is it about becoming thirty that gives everyone universal permission to offer advice on when you\\u2019re going to reproduce?\\u201d This Offie nominated play tells the story of Fin whose world shifts when she unexpectedly falls pregnant, her unconventional career as a zero-hour cycle courier and freelance illustrator suddenly colliding headlong with societal norms and expectations. Untethered + Hinterland bring their uniquely collaborative style to the stage\\/Riverside Studios with a show that captures the millennial female zeitgeist and holds space for the quietly heavy things that shape us all.London Pub Theatres \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0Everything Theatre \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0Theatre To See London \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0London Theatre1 \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/hE-age\\/\",\"id\":\"3837\",\"name\":\"Age\",\"title\":\"Age\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785452400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/245801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785527100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785538800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/245802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">12:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785582000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/246001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">21:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785614400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1785452400,1785538800,1785538800],\"times\