_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/00\\/2a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/002a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/00\\/2a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/002a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/00\\/2a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/002a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/00\\/2a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/002a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/00\\/2a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/002a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/00\\/2a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/002a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/00\\/2a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/002a6adb206a4b6fd14327247846283b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Why am I me and not someone else? Why am I me and not you?Age charts the relationship between two boys over 24 years, from the blooming of their friendship as innocent 8-year-olds, through the teenage betrayal that tears them apart, to the \\u00a0chance reunion at a busy airport as grown men where the prospect of forgiveness, reconciliation and healing the wounds of the past feels tantalisingly within reach. Told by a single performer, perspectives and memories blur in this timely and bold story of intimacy, trust and kinship as these men navigate growing up, growing apart and reaching out for connection.\\u00a0CREDITSWritten by Logan JonesDirected by Ella McKeownProduced by Dela Ruth Hini\\u00a0Age\\u00a0is a Ricochet Theatre and Stoke The Embers co-production\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Age Age Bitesize  <p><i>Why am I me and not someone else? Why am I me and not you?<\\/i><\\/p><p><br>Age charts the relationship between two boys over 24 years, from the blooming of their friendship as innocent 8-year-olds, through the teenage betrayal that tears them apart, to the &nbsp;chance reunion at a busy airport as grown men where the prospect of forgiveness, reconciliation and healing the wounds of the past feels tantalisingly within reach. Told by a single performer, perspectives and memories blur in this timely and bold story of intimacy, trust and kinship as these men navigate growing up, growing apart and reaching out for connection.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>CREDITS<\\/strong><\\/p><p><br>Written by Logan Jones<\\/p><p>Directed by Ella McKeown<\\/p><p>Produced by Dela Ruth Hini<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>Age<\\/i>&nbsp;is a Ricochet Theatre and Stoke The Embers co-production<\\/p> Age  Why am I me and not someone else? Why am I me and not you?Age charts the relationship between two boys over 24 years, from the blooming of their friendship as innocent 8-year-olds, through the teenage betrayal that tears them apart, to the \\u00a0chance reunion at a busy airport as grown men where the prospect of forgiveness, reconciliation and healing the wounds of the past feels tantalisingly within reach. Told by a single performer, perspectives and memories blur in this timely and bold story of intimacy, trust and kinship as these men navigate growing up, growing apart and reaching out for connection.\\u00a0CREDITSWritten by Logan JonesDirected by Ella McKeownProduced by Dela Ruth Hini\\u00a0Age\\u00a0is a Ricochet Theatre and Stoke The Embers co-production Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uPi-troy\\/\",\"id\":\"4075\",\"name\":\"Troy\",\"tit