er's epic THE ODYSSEY this July, travel back with us through the ages to&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.PNG\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c0\\/bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20\\/w1386\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/cx312\\/cy37\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/c0bfe91f2ba310697b9ac5b02dab3c20.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"44.1\",\"25.4\"],\"search_text\":\"As master filmmaker Christopher Nolan finally reveals his ambitious take on Homer's epic THE ODYSSEY this July, travel back with us through the ages to explore how other filmmakers have drawn on the ancient myths of yesterday to forge groundbreaking big screen entertainment. Enjoy a multi-buy offer for all films in the MYTHS AND MONSTERS season with 15% off adult and concession prices if more than one ticket is purchased in same order.\\u00a0MYTHS AND MONSTERS classic film season at Riverside Studios:Clash of the Titans (1981): 18th-20th JulySpartacus (1960): 25-28th JulyTroy (2004): 1st-3rd August\\u00a0TROY (2004)From director-producer Wolfgang Petersen (Poseidon, Das Boot) comes Troy, an epic tale of love, war and devastation. Adapted from Homer\\u2019s classic poem The Iliad, Troy demonstrates the undeniable gravitas and inevitability of Homer\\u2019s narrative even after millennia.When Helen of Sparta (Diane Kruger), though married, elopes with the Trojan prince Paris (Orlando Bloom) and flees to Troy, they\\u2019re followed by war of unimaginable proportions. Helen\\u2019s husband Menelaus (Brendan Gleeson) summons a united army of Greece led by the arrogant Agamemnon (Brian Cox) and driven forward by the bold and courageous Achilles (Brad Pitt). As the armies of Greece and Troy clash, so too do their greatest champions \\u2013 Achilles and Hector (Eric Bana) in a conflict that brings devastation to both kingdoms. In this colossal epic, witness huge battlescapes, one-on-one duels worthy of a Colosseum and the fall of a once-great nation.Age Rating:15Language:EnglishContent Warnings:Contains strong battle violenceDirector:Wolfgang PetersenCast:Brad Pitt, Eric Bana, Orlando Bloom, Diane Kruger, Sean Bean, Brian Cox, Peter O'Toole, Brendan Gleeson, Saffron Burrows, Ross Byrne, Julie Christie, James Cosmo, Julian GloverCompany:Park CircusTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:2004\",\"book_link\":false,\"cinema\":[\"81024\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81000\"],\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"search\":\"Troy Troy Cinema  <p>As master filmmaker Christopher Nolan finally reveals his ambitious take on Homer's epic <i>THE ODYSSEY<\\/i> this July, travel back with us through the ages to explore how other filmmakers have drawn on the ancient myths of yesterday to forge groundbreaking big screen entertainment. Enjoy a multi-buy offer for all films in the <strong>MYTHS AND MONSTERS<\\/strong> season with 15% off adult and concession prices if more than one ticket is purchased in same order.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>MYTHS AND MONSTERS <\\/strong>classic film season at Riverside Studios:<\\/p><p><i>Clash of the Titans<\\/i> (1981): 18th-20th July<\\/p><p><i>Spartacus<\\/i> (1960): 25-28th July<\\/p><p><i>Troy <\\/i>(2004): 1st-3rd August<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>TROY <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>(2004)<\\/strong><\\/p><p>From director-producer Wolfgang Petersen (<i>Poseidon<\\/i>, <i>Das Boot<\\/i>) comes <i><strong>Troy<\\/strong><\\/i>, an epic tale of love, war and devastation. Adapted from Homer\\u2019s classic poem The Iliad, Troy demonstrates the undeniable gravitas and inevitability of Homer\\u2019s narrative even after millennia.<\\/p><p>When Helen of Sparta (Diane Kruger), though married, elopes with the Trojan prince Paris (Orlando Bloom) and flees to Troy, they\\u2019re followed by war of unimaginable proportions. Helen\\u2019s husband Menelaus (Brendan Gleeson) summons a united army of Greece led by the arrogant Agamemnon (Brian Cox) and driven forward by the bold and courageous Achilles (Brad Pitt). As the armies of Greece and Troy clash, so too do their greatest champions \\u2013 Achilles and Hector (Eric Bana) in a conflict that brings devastation to both kingdoms. In this colossal epic, witness huge battlescapes, one-on-one duels worthy of a Colosseum and the fall of a once-great nation.<\\/p><figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Age Rating:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>15<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Language:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>English<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Content Warnings:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Contains strong battle violence<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Director:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Wolfgang Petersen<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Cast:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Brad Pitt, Eric Bana, Orlando Bloom, Diane Kruger, Sean Bean, Brian Cox, Peter O'Toole, Brendan Gleeson, Saffron Burrows, Ross Byrne, Julie Christie, James Cosmo, Julian Glover<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Company:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Park Circus<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Trailers:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>20 mins<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Year of Release:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>2004<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure> Troy  As master filmmaker Christopher Nolan finally reveals his ambitious take on Homer's epic THE ODYSSEY this July, travel back with us through the ages to explore how other filmmakers have drawn on the ancient myths of yesterday to forge groundbreaking big screen entertainment. Enjoy a multi-buy offer for all films in the MYTHS AND MONSTERS season with 15% off adult and concession prices if more than one ticket is purchased in same order.\\u00a0MYTHS AND MONSTERS classic film season at Riverside Studios:Clash of the Titans (1981): 18th-20th JulySpartacus (1960): 25-28th JulyTroy (2004): 1st-3rd August\\u00a0TROY (2004)From director-producer Wolfgang Petersen (Poseidon, Das Boot) comes Troy, an epic tale of love, war and devastation. Adapted from Homer\\u2019s classic poem The Iliad, Troy demonstrates the undeniable gravitas and inevitability of Homer\\u2019s narrative even after millennia.When Helen of Sparta (Diane Kruger), though married, elopes with the Trojan prince Paris (Orlando Bloom) and flees to Troy, they\\u2019re followed by war of unimaginable proportions. Helen\\u2019s husband Menelaus (Brendan Gleeson) summons a united army of Greece led by the arrogant Agamemnon (Brian Cox) and driven forward by the bold and courageous Achilles (Brad Pitt). As the armies of Greece and Troy clash, so too do their greatest champions \\u2013 Achilles and Hector (Eric Bana) in a conflict that brings devastation to both kingdoms. In this colossal epic, witness huge battlescapes, one-on-one duels worthy of a Colosseum and the fall of a once-great nation.Age Rating:15Language:EnglishContent Warnings:Contains strong battle violenceDirector:Wolfgang PetersenCast:Brad Pitt, Eric Bana, Orlando Bloom, Diane Kruger, Sean Bean, Brian Cox, Peter O'Toole, Brendan Gleeson, Saffron Burrows, Ross Byrne, Julie Christie, James Cosmo, Julian GloverCompany:Park CircusTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:2004 Myths and Monsters 15 Cinema\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/El-meat-me-in-shoreditch\\/\",\"id\":\"3456\",\"name\":\"Meat Me in Shoreditch\",\"title\":\"Meat Me in Shoreditch\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785538800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/214601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785604500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1785538800],\"times\":[1785604500],\"start_date\":\"1785604500\",\"end_date\":\"1785604500\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"L2VSazdPYVJWWk4veFNic3FnTWZRZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 1 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"\\u201cBridget Jones goes wrong\\u201d \\u2013 Audience feedback.Very female, very London, very raw. A single woman in her early thirties decides it might be time to date&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w2500\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/61e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b\\/w2500\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d961e8af1eac5522c0cd0ae18c47df7b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"\\u201cBridget Jones goes wrong\\u201d \\u2013 Audience feedback.Very female, very London, very raw. A single woman in her early thirties decides it might be time to date again. But first, she must be ready. Staying in her room, ordering Greggs takeaway and watching reality TV, she has quietly misplaced everything: her body, her confidence, herself. So begins a journey towards the \\u201cideal\\u201d version - new weights, new Sweaty Betty, new diet, new image. It starts sensibly enough. It always does. But this is a show about what happens when the hunger to be seen, desired, and validated is pushed too far. A comic, unsettling, absurdist take on female image, dating and loneliness for audiences of bold new writing.Created and performed by Valery Reva, this bold new work dives headfirst into the absurdities of modern dating and female identity. Directed by award-winning, working-class queer director and dramaturg Scott Le Crass, this is a striking new voice in London\\u2019s new writing scene.\\u00a0Praise for previous workAt Least I\\u2019m not Bold\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cBeautifully Written\\u201d North West End\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cDramatic And Powerful\\u201d Derek Awards\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cMoving And Original\\u201d London Pub Theatres\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f \\u201cUtterly Hilarious\\u201d London Theatre\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u201cFunny And Painfully True\\u201d Everything Theatre\\u00a0in|Secure\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cProvides what fringe theatre does best; it educates whilst entertaining\\u201d Everything Theatre\\u201cEngaging, honest and layered performance\\u201d London Pub Theatre\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/214601\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Meat Me in Shoreditch Meat Me in Shoreditch Bitesize  <p><i>\\u201cBridget Jones goes wrong\\u201d \\u2013 Audience feedback.<\\/i><\\/p><p>Very female, very London, very raw. A single woman in her early thirties decides it might be time to date again. But first, she must be ready. Staying in her room, ordering Greggs takeaway and watching reality TV, she has quietly misplaced everything: her body, her confidence, herself. So begins a journey towards the \\u201cideal\\u201d version - new weights, new Sweaty Betty, new diet, new image. It starts sensibly enough. It always does. But this is a show about what happens when the hunger to be seen, desired, and validated is pushed too far. A comic, unsettling, absurdist take on female image, dating and loneliness for audiences of bold new writing.<\\/p><p>Created and performed by Valery Reva, this bold new work dives headfirst into the absurdities of modern dating and female identity. Directed by award-winning, working-class queer director and dramaturg Scott Le Crass, this is a striking new voice in London\\u2019s new writing scene.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Praise for previous work<\\/strong><\\/p><p><i><strong>At Least I\\u2019m not Bold<\\/strong><\\/i><br><br><i><strong>\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cBeautifully Written\\u201d <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>North West End<\\/strong><br><i><strong>\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cDramatic And Powerful\\u201d <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>Derek Awards<\\/strong><br><i><strong>\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cMoving And Original\\u201d <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>London Pub Theatres<\\/strong><br><i><strong>\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f \\u201cUtterly Hilarious\\u201d <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>London Theatre<\\/strong><br><i><strong>\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u201cFunny And Painfully True\\u201d <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>Everything Theatre<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>in|Secure<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p><i><strong>\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cProvides what fringe theatre does best; it educates whilst entertaining\\u201d <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>Everything Theatre<\\/strong><br><i><strong>\\u201cEngaging, honest and layered performance\\u201d <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>London Pub Theatre<\\/strong><\\/p> Meat Me in Shoreditch  \\u201cBridget Jones goes wrong\\u201d \\u2013 Audience feedback.Very female, very London, very raw. A single woman in her early thirties decides it might be time to date again. But first, she must be ready. Staying in her room, ordering Greggs takeaway and watching reality TV, she has quietly misplaced everything: her body, her confidence, herself. So begins a journey towards the \\u201cideal\\u201d version - new weights, new Sweaty Betty, new diet, new image. It starts sensibly enough. It always does. But this is a show about what happens when the hunger to be seen, desired, and validated is pushed too far. A comic, unsettling, absurdist take on female image, dating and loneliness for audiences of bold new writing.Created and performed by Valery Reva, this bold new work dives headfirst into the absurdities of modern dating and female identity. Directed by award-winning, working-class queer director and dramaturg Scott Le Crass, this is a striking new voice in London\\u2019s new writing scene.\\u00a0Praise for previous workAt Least I\\u2019m not Bold\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cBeautifully Written\\u201d North West End\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cDramatic And Powerful\\u201d Derek Awards\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cMoving And Original\\u201d London Pub Theatres\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f \\u201cUtterly Hilarious\\u201d London Theatre\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u201cFunny And Painfully True\\u201d Everything Theatre\\u00a0in|Secure\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u201cProvides what fringe theatre does best; it educates whilst entertaining\\u201d Everything Theatre\\u201cEngaging, honest and layered performance\\u201d London Pub Theatre Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Ek-knots\\/\",\"id\":\"3449\",\"name\":\"KNOTS\",\"title\":\"KNOTS\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785625200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/214801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785695400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1785625200],\"times\":[1785695400],\"start_date\":\"1785695400\",\"end_date\":\"1785695400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"d3dVenBXU1RwV0x6eG9kSmRseVAzZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 2 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Never been to a noise night? KNOTS welcomes activists, organisers, poets, playwrights, movement artists, and more to collaborate with noise and sound&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/db\\/1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx594\\/cw1993\\/ch1990\\/images\\/uploads\\/db1c0225e3593dd67bc178a13e22c271.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Never been to a noise night? KNOTS welcomes activists, organisers, poets, playwrights, movement artists, and more to collaborate with noise and sound artists to share performances that advocate hope, resistance, frustration, and encourages all of us to to learn from lived experiences.Each noise night fundraises for a direct action group, charity, or other groups that actively promote anti-authoritarian equality and fight against injustice locally and globally. Curated by vanchoked and Cuttfruit through an open-board process, artists pair up across disciplines to highlight how the approach of noise can be embedded across practices, and translate into an open exploration of the body, culture, and sound, onto the stage.Join us for our third noise night, and our first production under the Knots Co-operative company!\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/214801\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"KNOTS KNOTS Bitesize  <p>Never been to a noise night? <i><strong>KNOTS <\\/strong><\\/i>welcomes activists, organisers, poets, playwrights, movement artists, and more to collaborate with noise and sound artists to share performances that advocate hope, resistance, frustration, and encourages all of us to to learn from lived experiences.<\\/p><p>Each noise night fundraises for a direct action group, charity, or other groups that actively promote anti-authoritarian equality and fight against injustice locally and globally. Curated by vanchoked and Cuttfruit through an open-board process, artists pair up across disciplines to highlight how the approach of noise can be embedded across practices, and translate into an open exploration of the body, culture, and sound, onto the stage.<\\/p><p>Join us for our third noise night, and our first production under the Knots Co-operative company!<\\/p> KNOTS  Never been to a noise night? KNOTS welcomes activists, organisers, poets, playwrights, movement artists, and more to collaborate with noise and sound artists to share performances that advocate hope, resistance, frustration, and encourages all of us to to learn from lived experiences.Each noise night fundraises for a direct action group, charity, or other groups that actively promote anti-authoritarian equality and fight against injustice locally and globally. Curated by vanchoked and Cuttfruit through an open-board process, artists pair up across disciplines to highlight how the approach of noise can be embedded across practices, and translate into an open exploration of the body, culture, and sound, onto the stage.Join us for our third noise night, and our first production under the Knots Co-operative company! Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/oE-lifeguards-the-musical\\/\",\"id\":\"3589\",\"name\":\"Lifeguards: The Musical\",\"title\":\"Lifeguards: The Musical\",\"duration\":\"50 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785711600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/222801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785780000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785798000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\"