/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d9\\/18b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/d918b8ac8a6b4b499163dec9049b86b3.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"When a kid \\\"pops one\\\" in a holiday resort pool, triggering a 24-hour shutdown, three lifeguards on zero-hour contracts find themselves unpaid and fed up. Inspired by Hollywood strikers, they swap whistles for picket signs, launching a comedic protest that catches the eye of a ruthless reality TV crew filming on-site.The lifeguards crave stardom; the producers crave blood. Ignoring the strikers, the crew manipulates the neurodivergent resort manager into becoming their \\\"dark\\\" viral star. As the poolside audience is pulled into the action, the \\\"incident\\\" becomes a visceral metaphor: we are all swimming in the same polluted pool of corporate greed and environmental neglect.Featuring four original songs and sharp satire, Lifeguards is a high-energy exploration of the delusion of civic power in the age of influencers. It\\u2019s a splashy, subversive comedy about what happens when the people we rely on finally stop treading water.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Lifeguards: The Musical Lifeguards: The Musical Bitesize  <p>When a kid \\\"pops one\\\" in a holiday resort pool, triggering a 24-hour shutdown, three lifeguards on zero-hour contracts find themselves unpaid and fed up. Inspired by Hollywood strikers, they swap whistles for picket signs, launching a comedic protest that catches the eye of a ruthless reality TV crew filming on-site.<\\/p><p>The lifeguards crave stardom; the producers crave blood. Ignoring the strikers, the crew manipulates the neurodivergent resort manager into becoming their \\\"dark\\\" viral star. As the poolside audience is pulled into the action, the \\\"incident\\\" becomes a visceral metaphor: we are all swimming in the same polluted pool of corporate greed and environmental neglect.<\\/p><p>Featuring four original songs and sharp satire, <i><strong>Lifeguards <\\/strong><\\/i>is a high-energy exploration of the delusion of civic power in the age of influencers. It\\u2019s a splashy, subversive comedy about what happens when the people we rely on finally stop treading water.<\\/p> Lifeguards: The Musical  When a kid \\\"pops one\\\" in a holiday resort pool, triggering a 24-hour shutdown, three lifeguards on zero-hour contracts find themselves unpaid and fed up. Inspired by Hollywood strikers, they swap whistles for picket signs, launching a comedic protest that catches the eye of a ruthless reality TV crew filming on-site.The lifeguards crave stardom; the producers crave blood. Ignoring the strikers, the crew manipulates the neurodivergent resort manager into becoming their \\\"dark\\\" viral star. As the poolside audience is pulled into the action, the \\\"incident\\\" becomes a visceral metaphor: we are all swimming in the same polluted pool of corporate greed and environmental neglect.Featuring four original songs and sharp satire, Lifeguards is a high-energy exploration of the delusion of civic power in the age of influencers. It\\u2019s a splashy, subversive comedy about what happens when the people we rely on finally stop treading water. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/EV-harmonise-or-die\\/\",\"id\":\"3414\",\"name\":\"Harmonise or Die\",\"title\":\"Harmonise 