ustom\\/bc\\/ee8de841d274b5e72d2d6c29223408\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/bcee8de841d274b5e72d2d6c29223408.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bc\\/ee8de841d274b5e72d2d6c29223408\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/bcee8de841d274b5e72d2d6c29223408.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bc\\/ee8de841d274b5e72d2d6c29223408\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/bcee8de841d274b5e72d2d6c29223408.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Definitely-Not-A-Cult Productions presents\\u2026\\u201cHarmonise Or Die\\u201d a dark, side-eyed, comedy, sci-fi set in a post-scarcity utopia where citizens must maintain strict emotional regulation in order to retain their citizenship.\\u00a0Trapped in a high-tech correctional facility, Gabriel (Joel Stern) and Lyra (Mila Michael), face the consequences of their \\u201cdeviant outbursts\\u201d. Now, in order to return home, they must co-operate on challenges designed to break them and prove their relationship is \\u201charmonious\\u201d, or face banishment into the hostile wastelands forever.A new play by Joel Stern.Broadway World \\u201cThe script by Joel Stern is a deft blend of biting satire and emotional intelligence\\u201d.Directed by Lyna Dubarry. Produced by Mila Michael. Musical Director: Tom Cagnoni. Costumes by Santiago Liendo.\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Harmonise or Die Harmonise or Die Bitesize  <p>Definitely-Not-A-Cult Productions presents\\u2026<\\/p><p>\\u201cHarmonise Or Die\\u201d a dark, side-eyed, comedy, sci-fi set in a post-scarcity utopia where citizens must maintain strict emotional regulation in order to retain their citizenship.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Trapped in a high-tech correctional facility, Gabriel (Joel Stern) and Lyra (Mila Michael), face the consequences of their \\u201cdeviant outbursts\\u201d. Now, in order to return home, they must co-operate on challenges designed to break them and prove their relationship is \\u201charmonious\\u201d, or face banishment into the hostile wastelands forever.<\\/p><p>A new play by Joel Stern.<\\/p><p>Broadway World \\u201cThe script by Joel Stern is a deft blend of biting satire and emotional intelligence\\u201d.<\\/p><p>Directed by Lyna Dubarry. Produced by Mila Michael. Musical Director: Tom Cagnoni. Costumes by Santiago Liendo.&nbsp;<\\/p> Harmonise or Die  Definitely-Not-A-Cult Productions presents\\u2026\\u201cHarmonise Or Die\\u201d a dark, side-eyed, comedy, sci-fi set in a post-scarcity utopia where citizens must maintain strict emotional regulation in order to retain their citizenship.\\u00a0Trapped in a high-tech correctional facility, Gabriel (Joel Stern) and Lyra (Mila Michael), face the consequences of their \\u201cdeviant outbursts\\u201d. Now, in order to return home, they must co-operate on challenges designed to break them and prove their relationship is \\u201charmonious\\u201d, or face banishment into the hostile wastelands forever.A new play by Joel Stern.Broadway World \\u201cThe script by Joel Stern is a deft blend of biting satire and emotional intelligence\\u201d.Directed by Lyna Dubarry. Produced by Mila Michael. Musical Director: Tom Cagnoni. Costumes by Santiago Liendo.\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Y4-fluxorama\\/\",\"id\":\"3753\",\"name\":\"Fluxorama\",\"title\":\"Fluxorama\",\"duration\":\"50 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785711600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/237201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785786300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785798000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\"