\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/7fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/a37fd802ac4df3ac4c70b654f6e0cb9b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"December 31st. S\\u00e3o Silvestre. In the scorching heat of S\\u00e3o Paulo, a woman pushes her body to the limit, desperate to finish a 15k race.A car crash. A man and his Mustang become one as he fights to hold on to life.Europe. A foreign housewife begins to lose her senses \\u2014 slowly, quietly, irreversibly.Fluxorama is a Brazilian play by award-winning playwright J\\u00f4 Bilac. Told through three powerful monologues, this bold and engaging work brings together three intimate stories of people pushed to their physical and psychological limits.Heartfelt, sharp and unexpectedly funny, the play explores endurance, vulnerability and human resilience at moments of extreme pressure. Fluxorama invites audiences into the inner worlds of its characters \\u2014 and challenges them to reflect on their own limits, choices and contradictions.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Fluxorama Fluxorama Bitesize  <p>December 31st. S\\u00e3o Silvestre. In the scorching heat of S\\u00e3o Paulo, a woman pushes her body to the limit, desperate to finish a 15k race.<\\/p><p>A car crash. A man and his Mustang become one as he fights to hold on to life.<\\/p><p>Europe. A foreign housewife begins to lose her senses \\u2014 slowly, quietly, irreversibly.<\\/p><p>Fluxorama is a Brazilian play by award-winning playwright J\\u00f4 Bilac. Told through three powerful monologues, this bold and engaging work brings together three intimate stories of people pushed to their physical and psychological limits.<\\/p><p>Heartfelt, sharp and unexpectedly funny, the play explores endurance, vulnerability and human resilience at moments of extreme pressure. <i>Fluxorama<\\/i> invites audiences into the inner worlds of its characters \\u2014 and challenges them to reflect on their own limits, choices and contradictions.<\\/p> Fluxorama  December 31st. S\\u00e3o Silvestre. In the scorching heat of S\\u00e3o Paulo, a woman pushes her body to the limit, desperate to finish a 15k race.A car crash. A man and his Mustang become one as he fights to hold on to life.Europe. A foreign housewife begins to lose her senses \\u2014 slowly, quietly, irreversibly.Fluxorama is a Brazilian play by award-winning playwright J\\u00f4 Bilac. Told through three powerful monologues, this bold and engaging work brings together three intimate stories of people pushed to their physical and psychological limits.Heartfelt, sharp and unexpectedly funny, the play explores endurance, vulnerability and human resilience at moments of extreme pressure. Fluxorama invites audiences into the inner worlds of its characters \\u2014 and challenges them to reflect on their own limits, choices and contradictions. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Eb-katzchen\\/\",\"id\":\"3420\",\"name\":\"K\\u00e4tzchen\",\"title\":\"K\\u00e4tzchen\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785798000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/212204\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785866400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785884400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/212205\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785952800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785970800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/212206\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786039200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786057200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[