webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d6c391006a6823c9ccde9d480423597.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"78.8\",\"32.2\"],\"search_text\":\"K\\u00c4TZCHEN is an afro-surrealist one-woman show unravelling the coming-of-age story of the black feminine. Beamed down from the stars and into a world governed by \\\"Nature\\u2019s Law\\\", Daphne is an alien in a dress. She is here to learn what it means to be human, but the humans she encounters - a cynical policeman, a weary lover, a violent butcher - only teach her the languages of possession, race, gender, and power.She is told to smile, but not too much. She is told to act \\\"classy,\\\" even when it hurts. She is told that to be a woman is to exist within a \\\"consciousness of the oppressed.\\\" She is told that she has an \\u201cexotic blackness\\u201d...Whatever that means. As she moves from the neon haze of a nightclub to the dim warmth of a shared apartment, Daphne realises that human communication is less about understanding and more about survival.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"K\\u00e4tzchen K\\u00e4tzchen Bitesize  <p><i><strong>K\\u00c4TZCHEN <\\/strong><\\/i>is an afro-surrealist one-woman show unravelling the coming-of-age story of the black feminine. Beamed down from the stars and into a world governed by \\\"Nature\\u2019s Law\\\", Daphne is an alien in a dress. She is here to learn what it means to be human, but the humans she encounters - a cynical policeman, a weary lover, a violent butcher - only teach her the languages of possession, race, gender, and power.<\\/p><p>She is told to smile, but not too much. She is told to act \\\"classy,\\\" even when it hurts. She is told that to be a woman is to exist within a \\\"consciousness of the oppressed.\\\" She is told that she has an \\u201cexotic blackness\\u201d...Whatever that means. As she moves from the neon haze of a nightclub to the dim warmth of a shared apartment, Daphne realises that human communication is less about understanding and more about survival.<\\/p> K\\u00e4tzchen  K\\u00c4TZCHEN is an afro-surrealist one-woman show unravelling the coming-of-age story of the black feminine. Beamed down from the stars and into a world governed by \\\"Nature\\u2019s Law\\\", Daphne is an alien in a dress. She is here to learn what it means to be human, but the humans she encounters - a cynical policeman, a weary lover, a violent butcher - only teach her the languages of possession, race, gender, and power.She is told to smile, but not too much. She is told to act \\\"classy,\\\" even when it hurts. She is told that to be a woman is to exist within a \\\"consciousness of the oppressed.\\\" She is told that she has an \\u201cexotic blackness\\u201d...Whatever that means. As she moves from the neon haze of a nightclub to the dim warmth of a shared apartment, Daphne realises that human communication is less about understanding and more about survival. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/f2-daniel-moores-definitive-guide-to-failure-free-living\\/\",\"id\":\"3398\",\"name\":\"Daniel Moore\\u2019s Definitive Guide To Failure-Free Living\",\"title\":\"Daniel Moore\\u2019s Definitive Guide To Failure-Free Living\",\"duration\":\"55 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785884400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/212802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1785952800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1785970800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/212803\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786039200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"