736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b7\\/21be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx395\\/cy9\\/cw670\\/ch671\\/images\\/uploads\\/b721be8dae0d901736f0eda3ab50f487.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"48.0\",\"47.3\"],\"search_text\":\"One man. One button. 19,999 hours of failure-free living.Daniel Moore does not fail. For 19\\u2019999 hours, he has succeeded in his mysterious task. Now, on the verge of completing his second 10,000 hours, Daniel Moore prepares to leave his solitude to share his double expertise.The debut play from Off West-End Award nominated actor, Matthew Edgar (Wet Feet, 2024) and directed by up-and-coming director, and LAMDA MA Directing 2025 Graduate Harry Daisley (All is Pink In West Berkshire County), \\u2018Daniel Moore\\u2019s\\u2026\\u2019 is a darkly comic one-man dystopian fable that satirises modern obsessions with success, productivity and self-improvement, asking what achievement really means in an increasingly individualistic worldELIMINATE FAILURE.\\u00a0\\u201cA funny, uncomfortable, intense, sweaty night of brilliant theatre\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00bd - A Young(ish) Perspective\\u201cA perfectly choreographed rollercoaster\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Theatre & Tonic\\u201cSeverance meets Shakespeare\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - EdFringe Review\\u201cLike something by Samuel Beckett on acid\\u201d - The Scotsman\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Daniel Moore\\u2019s Definitive Guide To Failure-Free Living Daniel Moore\\u2019s Definitive Guide To Failure-Free Living Bitesize  <p>One man. One button. 19,999 hours of failure-free living.<\\/p><p>Daniel Moore does not fail. For 19\\u2019999 hours, he has succeeded in his mysterious task. Now, on the verge of completing his <i>second <\\/i>10,000 hours, Daniel Moore prepares to leave his solitude to share his <i>double <\\/i>expertise.<\\/p><p>The debut play from Off West-End Award nominated actor, Matthew Edgar (<i>Wet Feet<\\/i>, 2024) and directed by up-and-coming director, and LAMDA MA Directing 2025 Graduate Harry Daisley (<i>All is Pink In West Berkshire County<\\/i>), \\u2018Daniel Moore\\u2019s\\u2026\\u2019 is a darkly comic one-man dystopian fable that satirises modern obsessions with success, productivity and self-improvement, asking what achievement really means in an increasingly individualistic world<\\/p><p>ELIMINATE FAILURE.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>\\u201cA funny, uncomfortable, intense, sweaty night of brilliant theatre\\u201d&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00bd - A Young(ish) Perspective<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>\\u201cA perfectly choreographed rollercoaster\\u201d&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Theatre &amp; Tonic<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>\\u201c<\\/strong><i><strong>Severance <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>meets Shakespeare\\u201d&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - EdFringe Review<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>\\u201cLike something by Samuel Beckett on acid\\u201d - The Scotsman<\\/strong><\\/p> Daniel Moore\\u2019s Definitive Guide To Failure-Free Living  One man. One button. 19,999 hours of failure-free living.Daniel Moore does not fail. For 19\\u2019999 hours, he has succeeded in his mysterious task. Now, on the verge of completing his second 10,000 hours, Daniel Moore prepares to leave his solitude to share his double expertise.The debut play from Off West-End Award nominated actor, Matthew Edgar (Wet Feet, 2024) and directed by up-and-coming director, and LAMDA MA Directing 2025 Graduate Harry Daisley (All is Pink In West Berkshire County), \\u2018Daniel Moore\\u2019s\\u2026\\u2019 is a darkly comic one-man dystopian fable that satirises modern obsessions with success, productivity and self-improvement, asking what achievement really means in an increasingly individualistic worldELIMINATE FAILURE.\\u00a0\\u201cA funny, uncomfortable, intense, sweaty night of brilliant theatre\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00bd - A Young(ish) Perspective\\u201cA perfectly choreographed rollercoaster\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Theatre & Tonic\\u201cSeverance meets Shakespeare\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - EdFringe Review\\u201cLike something by Samuel Beckett on acid\\u201d - The Scotsman Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/oD-can-i-sit-down-please\\/\",\"id\":\"3592\",\"name\":\"Can I Sit Down Please?\",\"title\":\"Can I Sit Down Please?\",\"duration\":\"40 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785970800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/224401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786021200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786143600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/223602\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786200300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1785970800,1786143600],\"times\":[1786021200,1786200300],\"start_date\":\"1786021200\",\"end_date\":\"1786200300\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"N29zWW9TTEcvc2dML2NTbFllZVNrdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 6 - Sat 8 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Roosterbank Productions present\\u2026Can I Sit Down Please?One woman. One badge. One seat.What\\u2019s it really like navigating public transport with an invisible&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/9def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022\\/w1339\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/309def104bff10af11b7adf701c60022.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50.5\",\"29.5\"],\"search_text\":\"Roosterbank Productions present\\u2026Can I Sit Down Please?One woman. One badge. One seat.What\\u2019s it really like navigating public transport with an invisible disability?Described in her medical records as \\u2018this unfortunate 30 year old woman\\u2019 (yes really), Mia has spent the last eight years navigating London and public transport with an invisible disability. She\\u2019s now ready to spill the beans on what it\\u2019s really like spending every day asking strangers if she can sit down, to varying degrees of success. We explore human kindness, human rudeness and, most importantly, whether that man is staring her badge or her boobs.\\u00a0Can I Sit Down Please? was first presented as a 10 minute piece at LAMDA\\u2019s 2026 MishMash Festival with high praise such as:*** \\u2018Definitely worth the 2 hour train commute\\u2019 (Mia\\u2019s childhood friend)**** \\u2018Obviously just absolutely brilliant\\u2019 (Mia\\u2019s parents)* \\u2018She didn\\u2019t look disabled at all. Disappointing\\u2019 (Anon)\\u00a0Mia graduated from LAMDA in 2020 from the Production and Technical Arts course and has spent the last 6 years working backstage up and down the country as a stage manager and props buyer. Unfortunately it has become clear to her that stage management and a chronic illness are not always compatible, and so is trying to find other ways to make theatre that involve a bit more sitting down. Luckily she also writes, and now spends her time telling stories to make the invisible, visible.\\u00a0Roosterbank are a newly formed theatre company made up of actors, directors, stage managers and writers, who have all passed through the halls of LAMDA at some point or another. We are all fuelled by a love of storytelling that is exuberant, curious and unafraid to take risks. In a world of short attention spans and endless screens, we aim to cut through the noise with engaging, energetic, emotionally resonant theatre that stays with you long after the lights come up.Previous shows such as Metamorphoses (Courtyard Theatre and Camden People\\u2019s Theatre), Archive Labs (Riverside Studios) and Can I Sit Down Please? (LAMDA\\u2019s MishMash Festival) have taken the streets of London by storm, proving to be an unexpected sensation! Our shows have sold out multiple venues, received glowing reviews and have been chosen as the \\u2018Pick of the Fringe\\u2019 at Camden 2025.\\u00a0All of the Roosters, including Mia, are really excited to present a new 40 minute version of Can I Sit Down Please? at The Bitesize Festival this August.\\u00a0Photos: \\u00a0Zo\\u00eb Birkbeck.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Can I Sit Down Please? Can I Sit Down Please? Bitesize  <p><strong>Roosterbank Productions present\\u2026<\\/strong><\\/p><h3><i>Can I Sit Down Please?<\\/i><\\/h3><p><br><strong>One woman. One badge. One seat.<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>What\\u2019s it really like navigating public transport with an invisible disability?<\\/strong><\\/p><p><br>Described in her medical records as \\u2018this unfortunate 30 year old woman\\u2019 (yes really), Mia has spent the last eight years navigating London and public transport with an invisible disability. She\\u2019s now ready to spill the beans on what it\\u2019s really like spending every day asking strangers if she can sit down, to varying degrees of success. We explore human kindness, human rudeness and, most importantly, whether that man is staring her badge or her boobs.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><br><i>Can I Sit Down Please? <\\/i>was first presented as a 10 minute piece at LAMDA\\u2019s 2026 MishMash Festival with high praise such as:<\\/p><p>*** \\u2018Definitely worth the 2 hour train commute\\u2019 (<i>Mia\\u2019s childhood friend<\\/i>)<\\/p><p>**** \\u2018Obviously just absolutely brilliant\\u2019 (<i>Mia\\u2019s parents<\\/i>)<\\/p><p>* \\u2018She didn\\u2019t look disabled at all. Disappointing\\u2019 <i>(Anon)<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Mia graduated from LAMDA in 2020 from the Production and Technical Arts course and has spent the last 6 years working backstage up and down the country as a stage manager and props buyer. Unfortunately it has become clear to her that stage management and a chronic illness are not always compatible, and so is trying to find other ways to make theatre that involve a bit more sitting down. Luckily she also writes, and now spends her time telling stories to make the invisible, visible.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Roosterbank are a newly formed theatre company made up of actors, directors, stage managers and writers, who have all passed through the halls of LAMDA at some point or another. We are all fuelled by a love of storytelling that is exuberant, curious and unafraid to take risks. In a world of short attention spans and endless screens, we aim to cut through the noise with engaging, energetic, emotionally resonant theatre that stays with you long after the lights come up.<\\/p><p>Previous shows such as <i>Metamorphoses<\\/i> (<i>Courtyard Theatre and Camden People\\u2019s Theatre<\\/i>), <i>Archive Labs <\\/i>(<i>Riverside Studios<\\/i>) and <i>Can I Sit Down Please?<\\/i> (<i>LAMDA\\u2019s MishMash Festival<\\/i>) have taken the streets of London by storm, proving to be an unexpected sensation! Our shows have sold out multiple venues, received glowing reviews and have been chosen as the \\u2018Pick of the Fringe\\u2019 at Camden 2025.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><br>All of the Roosters, including Mia, are really excited to present a new 40 minute version of <i>Can I Sit Down Please?<\\/i> at The Bitesize Festival this August.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Photos: &nbsp;Zo\\u00eb Birkbeck.<\\/p> Can I Sit Down Please?  Roosterbank Productions present\\u2026Can I Sit Down Please?One woman. One badge. One seat.What\\u2019s it really like navigating public transport with an invisible disability?Described in her medical records as \\u2018this unfortunate 30 year old woman\\u2019 (yes really), Mia has spent the last eight years navigating London and public transport with an invisible disability. She\\u2019s now ready to spill the beans on what it\\u2019s really like spending every day asking strangers if she can sit down, to varying degrees of success. We explore human kindness, human rudeness and, most importantly, whether that man is staring her badge or her boobs.\\u00a0Can I Sit Down Please? was first presented as a 10 minute piece at LAMDA\\u2019s 2026 MishMash Festival with high praise such as:*** \\u2018Definitely worth the 2 hour train commute\\u2019 (Mia\\u2019s childhood friend)**** \\u2018Obviously just absolutely brilliant\\u2019 (Mia\\u2019s parents)* \\u2018She didn\\u2019t look disabled at all. Disappointing\\u2019 (Anon)\\u00a0Mia graduated from LAMDA in 2020 from the Production and Technical Arts course and has spent the last 6 years working backstage up and down the country as a stage manager and props buyer. Unfortunately it has become clear to her that stage management and a chronic illness are not always compatible, and so is trying to find other ways to make theatre that involve a bit more sitting down. Luckily she also writes, and now spends her time telling stories to make the invisible, visible.\\u00a0Roosterbank are a newly formed theatre company made up of actors, directors, stage managers and writers, who have all passed through the halls of LAMDA at some point or another. We are all fuelled by a love of storytelling that is exuberant, curious and unafraid to take risks. In a world of short attention spans and endless screens, we aim to cut through the noise with engaging, energetic, emotionally resonant theatre that stays with you long after the lights come up.Previous shows such as Metamorphoses (Courtyard Theatre and Camden People\\u2019s Theatre), Archive Labs (Riverside Studios) and Can I Sit Down Please? (LAMDA\\u2019s MishMash Festival) have taken the streets of London by storm, proving to be an unexpected sensation! Our shows have sold out multiple venues, received glowing reviews and have been chosen as the \\u2018Pick of the Fringe\\u2019 at Camden 2025.\\u00a0All of the Roosters, including Mia, are really excited to present a new 40 minute version of Can I Sit Down Please? at The Bitesize Festival this August.\\u00a0Photos: \\u00a0Zo\\u00eb Birkbeck. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/DV-republic-of-silence\\/\",\"id\":\"3600\",\"name\":\"Republic Of Silence\",\"title\":\"Republic Of Silence\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1785970800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/223401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786045500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786057200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"