\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a0\\/7d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/a07d48a1badf78eebcb4aa57f4369408.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"\\\"A brave, moving and necessary production\\\" - Londontheatre1Based on true stories from Sean Ross mother and baby institution, Tipperary.When gentle and stoic gardener, Colm, discovers a series of unmarked graves at Sean Ross Abbey, a reckoning with the power of the church and a movement for justice are brought to a head.In 1965, on the same site, two young pregnant girls hear whispers of stolen babies, missing girls and violence within the Abbey. When hardened Niamh witnesses the secrets of the \\u2018home\\u2019, the girls rage against the catholic institution that cage them.\\u00a0Who gets to decide what history is told, and what stories are kept silent?\\u00a0Londontheatre1 \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50Theatreandartsreviews \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50TheVu \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Republic Of Silence Republic Of Silence Bitesize  <blockquote><p><i><strong>\\\"A brave, moving and necessary production\\\" - Londontheatre1<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>Based on true stories from Sean Ross mother and baby institution, Tipperary.<\\/p><p>When gentle and stoic gardener, Colm, discovers a series of unmarked graves at Sean Ross Abbey, a reckoning with the power of the church and a movement for justice are brought to a head.<\\/p><p>In 1965, on the same site, two young pregnant girls hear whispers of stolen babies, missing girls and violence within the Abbey. When hardened Niamh witnesses the secrets of the \\u2018home\\u2019, the girls rage against the catholic institution that cage them.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Who gets to decide what history is told, and what stories are kept silent?<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>Londontheatre1<\\/i> \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50<\\/p><p><i>Theatreandartsreviews<\\/i> \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50<\\/p><p><i>TheVu<\\/i> \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50&nbsp;<\\/p> Republic Of Silence  \\\"A brave, moving and necessary production\\\" - Londontheatre1Based on true stories from Sean Ross mother and baby institution, Tipperary.When gentle and stoic gardener, Colm, discovers a series of unmarked graves at Sean Ross Abbey, a reckoning with the power of the church and a movement for justice are brought to a head.In 1965, on the same site, two young pregnant girls hear whispers of stolen babies, missing girls and violence within the Abbey. When hardened Niamh witnesses the secrets of the \\u2018home\\u2019, the girls rage against the catholic institution that cage them.\\u00a0Who gets to decide what history is told, and what stories are kept silent?\\u00a0Londontheatre1 \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50Theatreandartsreviews \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50TheVu \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/YJ-now-and-at-the-hour-of-our-death-amen\\/\",\"id\":\"3744\",\"name\":\"Now And at The Hour of Our Death, Amen\",\"title\":\"Now And at The Hour of Our Death, Amen\",\"duration\":\"40 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786057200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/235201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786107600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786230000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/235401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786286700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786057200,1786230000],\"times\":[1786107600,1786286700],\"start_date\":\"1786107600\",\"end_date\":\"1786286700\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"cmI5NTNnM0FabUluY3dKajlGT0hsdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 7 - Sun 9 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Maria\\u2019s very Catholic grandmother is dying. She prays for Maria to find a boyfriend every night. But Maria is gay, and she wants Granny to know, so that&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/18\\/4f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/184f2aec608ba650205e17e3ad90e09d.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Maria\\u2019s very Catholic grandmother is dying. She prays for Maria to find a boyfriend every night. But Maria is gay, and she wants Granny to know, so that she doesn\\u2019t send a man looking for her from beyond the grave. But Granny is extremely homophobic and believes all gay people will burn in hell. Everyone in the family is against this. \\u201cJust let the old lady die in peace.\\u201d\\u00a0Is Maria selfish for wanting to tell Granny? Or a liar for keeping the truth? Is God watching all of this?\\u00a0During a night spent at the hospital, Maria needs to make a decision.This autobiographical, comedic and absurdist piece is a reflection on growing up as a queer person in an extremely religious household and country - Brazil - and how we carry that Catholic guilt throughout our lives.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Now And at The Hour of Our Death, Amen Now And at The Hour of Our Death, Amen Bitesize  <p>Maria\\u2019s very Catholic grandmother is dying. She prays for Maria to find a boyfriend every night. But Maria is gay, and she wants Granny to know, so that she doesn\\u2019t send a man looking for her from beyond the grave. But Granny is extremely homophobic and believes all gay people will burn in hell. Everyone in the family is against this. <strong>\\u201cJust let the old lady die in peace.\\u201d&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p><br><strong>Is Maria selfish for wanting to tell Granny? Or a liar for keeping the truth? Is God watching all of this?&nbsp;<\\/strong><br>During a night spent at the hospital, Maria needs to make a decision.<\\/p><p><br>This autobiographical, comedic and absurdist piece is a reflection on growing up as a queer person in an extremely religious household and country - Brazil - and how we carry that Catholic guilt throughout our lives.<\\/p> Now And at The Hour of Our Death, Amen  Maria\\u2019s very Catholic grandmother is dying. She prays for Maria to find a boyfriend every night. But Maria is gay, and she wants Granny to know, so that she doesn\\u2019t send a man looking for her from beyond the grave. But Granny is extremely homophobic and believes all gay people will burn in hell. Everyone in the family is against this. \\u201cJust let the old lady die in peace.\\u201d\\u00a0Is Maria selfish for wanting to tell Granny? Or a liar for keeping the truth? Is God watching all of this?\\u00a0During a night spent at the hospital, Maria needs to make a decision.This autobiographical, comedic and absurdist piece is a reflection on growing up as a queer person in an extremely religious household and country - Brazil - and how we carry that Catholic guilt throughout our lives. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/EU-a-criminal-melody\\/\",\"id\":\"3438\",\"name\":\"A Criminal Melody\",\"title\":\"A Criminal Melody\",\"duration\":\"50 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786143600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">12:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786186800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215002\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786213800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786230000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215003\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">12:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786273200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215004\\/\\