\/ch3216\\/images\\/uploads\\/d1a3d551441d5a66ad6b91046189ee38.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"65.1\",\"47.4\"],\"search_text\":\"Detective Inspector Paulethiast Razmataz is a self-centred detective in the 1920s, more interested in combing over his life than protecting The City. This is until he\\u2019s visited by the ghost of his ex-wife, who warns him of three spirits that will soon visit him. \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Past\\u2019, a paper boy who shows him his time catching crooks as a child, \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Present\\u2019, a mafia boss who messes with the day he receives his detective award, and \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Yet to Crime\\u2019, a business man, who shows Razmataz a death\\u2026but not his own.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"A Criminal Melody A Criminal Melody Bitesize  <p>Detective Inspector Paulethiast Razmataz is a self-centred detective in the 1920s, more interested in combing over his life than protecting The City. This is until he\\u2019s visited by the ghost of his ex-wife, who warns him of three spirits that will soon visit him. \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Past\\u2019, a paper boy who shows him his time catching crooks as a child, \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Present\\u2019, a mafia boss who messes with the day he receives his detective award, and \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Yet to Crime\\u2019, a business man, who shows Razmataz a death\\u2026but not his own.<\\/p> A Criminal Melody  Detective Inspector Paulethiast Razmataz is a self-centred detective in the 1920s, more interested in combing over his life than protecting The City. This is until he\\u2019s visited by the ghost of his ex-wife, who warns him of three spirits that will soon visit him. \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Past\\u2019, a paper boy who shows him his time catching crooks as a child, \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Present\\u2019, a mafia boss who messes with the day he receives his detective award, and \\u2018The Spirit of Crime Yet to Crime\\u2019, a business man, who shows Razmataz a death\\u2026but not his own. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/yu-our-mothers-daughters\\/\",\"id\":\"3473\",\"name\":\"Our Mothers' Daughters\",\"title\":\"Our Mothers' Daughters\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786143600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786191300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786218300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786230000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215803\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786277700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215804\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786295700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786143600,1786143600,1786230000,1786230000],\"times\":[1786191300,1786218300,1786277700,1786295700],\"start_date\":\"1786191300\",\"end_date\":\"1786295700\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"aHY4SU9DWWEwSVhjR0p0WDlBQkpIUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 8 - Sun 9 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Our Mothers\\u2019 Daughters by Sarah Tara Ray, follows three young women navigating friendship, identity, and the pressures of adulthood. At its centre is&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/98\\/2e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/982e74e5b9faaca3f0cdcced362e966f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Our Mothers\\u2019 Daughters by Sarah Tara Ray, follows three young women navigating friendship, identity, and the pressures of adulthood. At its centre is a tight-knit yet contrasting trio: a promising artist, an insecure jester, and an aspiring homemaker. As their lives begin to diverge\\u2014through an engagement, the exploration of queerness, and an unexpected pregnancy\\u2014their bond is tested in profound ways.When the Artist\\u2019s pro-life sister challenges her decision to consider an abortion, a deeply personal conflict unfolds, drawing in family and friends alike. At the same time, the Artist navigates her first queer relationship, while tensions rise between her closest friends as their futures take different paths.Blending sharp humour with emotional depth, the play explores love, feminism, sexuality, and choice, offering a candid and compassionate portrayal of women supporting one another through change. Placing women centre stage, Our Mothers\\u2019 Daughters captures both the harsh and the hilarious edges of the female experience.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Our Mothers' Daughters Our Mothers' Daughters Bitesize  <p><i><strong>Our Mothers\\u2019 Daughters <\\/strong><\\/i>by Sarah Tara Ray, follows three young women navigating friendship, identity, and the pressures of adulthood. At its centre is a tight-knit yet contrasting trio: a promising artist, an insecure jester, and an aspiring homemaker. As their lives begin to diverge\\u2014through an engagement, the exploration of queerness, and an unexpected pregnancy\\u2014their bond is tested in profound ways.<\\/p><p>When the Artist\\u2019s pro-life sister challenges her decision to consider an abortion, a deeply personal conflict unfolds, drawing in family and friends alike. At the same time, the Artist navigates her first queer relationship, while tensions rise between her closest friends as their futures take different paths.<\\/p><p>Blending sharp humour with emotional depth, the play explores love, feminism, sexuality, and choice, offering a candid and compassionate portrayal of women supporting one another through change. Placing women centre stage, <i>Our Mothers\\u2019 Daughters<\\/i> captures both the harsh and the hilarious edges of the female experience.<\\/p> Our Mother's Daughter,Our Mothers' Daughters  Our Mothers\\u2019 Daughters by Sarah Tara Ray, follows three young women navigating friendship, identity, and the pressures of adulthood. At its centre is a tight-knit yet contrasting trio: a promising artist, an insecure jester, and an aspiring homemaker. As their lives begin to diverge\\u2014through an engagement, the exploration of queerness, and an unexpected pregnancy\\u2014their bond is tested in profound ways.When the Artist\\u2019s pro-life sister challenges her decision to consider an abortion, a deeply personal conflict unfolds, drawing in family and friends alike. At the same time, the Artist navigates her first queer relationship, while tensions rise between her closest friends as their futures take different paths.Blending sharp humour with emotional depth, the play explores love, feminism, sexuality, and choice, offering a candid and compassionate portrayal of women supporting one another through change. Placing women centre stage, Our Mothers\\u2019 Daughters captures both the harsh and the hilarious edges of the female experience. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/yN-too-small-to-tell\\/\",\"id\":\"3483\",\"name\":\"Too Small to Tell\",\"title\":\"Too Small to Tell\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786143600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/216001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786204800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786230000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/216002\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786291200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786143600,1786230000],\"times\":[1786204800,1786291200],\"start_date\":\"1786204800\",\"end_date\":\"1786291200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"akhXUkFxcE1nSmVOQm0rUW9IVUFMQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 8 - Sun 9 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Too Small to&nbsp;Tell&nbsp;is inspired by Lisa Rose\\u2019s experiences working as an assistant to Harvey Weinstein in the 1990s.Rose uses humour 