4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Too Small to\\u00a0Tell\\u00a0is inspired by Lisa Rose\\u2019s experiences working as an assistant to Harvey Weinstein in the 1990s.Rose uses humour to explore power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets.\\u00a0Returning to Riverside Studios following successful runs at Bath Theatre Royal, Park Theatre\\u00a0and\\u00a0Upstairs at the Gatehouse. The\\u00a0play was\\u00a0shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025.\\u00a0Co-directed and created by Paula B. Stanic, Elizabeth Ranken and Catherine Alexander, originally directed by Tracy Bargate, it\\u2019s a timely, gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.A powerful and darkly funny solo show\\u00a0Emerging from the silence breakers movement Too Small to Tell\\u00a0 is a solo show about ambition, complicity and survival, asking the question that still matters: how do powerful people keep getting protected by everyone around them?\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Too Small to Tell Too Small to Tell Bitesize  <p><i><strong>Too Small to&nbsp;Tell&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/i>is inspired by Lisa Rose\\u2019s experiences working as an assistant to Harvey Weinstein in the 1990s.<\\/p><p>Rose uses humour to explore power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Returning to Riverside Studios following successful runs at Bath Theatre Royal, Park Theatre&nbsp;and&nbsp;Upstairs at the Gatehouse. The&nbsp;play was&nbsp;shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Co-directed and created by Paula B. Stanic, Elizabeth Ranken and Catherine Alexander, originally directed by Tracy Bargate, it\\u2019s a timely, gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.<\\/p><p><i><strong>A powerful and darkly funny solo show<\\/strong><\\/i><br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Emerging from the silence breakers movement<i><strong> Too Small to Tell&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/i> is a solo show about ambition, complicity and survival, asking the question that still matters: <strong>how do powerful people keep getting protected by everyone around them?<\\/strong><\\/p> Too Small to Tell  Too Small to\\u00a0Tell\\u00a0is inspired by Lisa Rose\\u2019s experiences working as an assistant to Harvey Weinstein in the 1990s.Rose uses humour to explore power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets.\\u00a0Returning to Riverside Studios following successful runs at Bath Theatre Royal, Park Theatre\\u00a0and\\u00a0Upstairs at the Gatehouse. The\\u00a0play was\\u00a0shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025.\\u00a0Co-directed and created by Paula B. Stanic, Elizabeth Ranken and Catherine Alexander, originally directed by Tracy Bargate, it\\u2019s a timely, gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.A powerful and darkly funny solo show\\u00a0Emerging from the silence breakers movement Too Small to Tell\\u00a0 is a solo show about ambition, complicity and survival, asking the question that still matters: how do powerful people keep getting protected by everyone around them? Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uPo-stage-combat-workshop\\/\",\"id\":\"4087\",\"name\":\"Stage Combat Workshop\",\"title\":\"Stage Combat Workshop\",\"duration\":\"360 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786230000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/257201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">10:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786267800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786230000],\"times\":[1786267800],\"start_date\":\"1786267800\",\"end_date\":\"1786267800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"S21oQjltWnBFcU01akpkQjJsQ2ZEZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 9 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Explore unarmed combat and develop a selection of moves to combine in to a choreographed sequence!A well-executed fight scene can make stage combat look&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/12\\/bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9\\/w1390\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx322\\/cw816\\/ch817\\/images\\/uploads\\/12bda30b1a1e588beaad8a16e470fcf9.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"49.9\",\"25.1\"],\"search_text\":\"Explore unarmed combat and develop a selection of moves to combine in to a choreographed sequence!A well-executed fight scene can make stage combat look easy but, much like dancing, it must be intricately choreographed and extensively rehearsed, to provide that authentic feel while remaining safe. Suitable for everyone.What will we cover?We will explore unarmed combat and develop a selection of moves and combine these moves\\u00a0in to\\u00a0a choreographed sequence which we\\u2019ll then look into how we perform this effectively and safely. All participants will explore the themes of the course through a playful and creative approach.\\u00a0HEALTH CHECKYou may or may not be asked to participate in rigorous activity from time to time. Please consider whether you could do this, if you are in any doubt consult a medical practitioner.Please wear comfortable appropriate clothing that allows for ease of movement, as if you were going to the gym.\\u00a0Absolutely no jeans and no boots.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/257201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Stage Combat Workshop Stage Combat Workshop Workshops & Classes  <p>Explore unarmed combat and develop a selection of moves to combine in to a choreographed sequence!<\\/p><p>A well-executed fight scene can make stage combat look easy but, much like dancing, it must be intricately choreographed and extensively rehearsed, to provide that authentic feel while remaining safe. Suitable for everyone.<\\/p><p><i><strong>What will we cover?<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>We will explore unarmed combat and develop a selection of moves and combine these moves&nbsp;in to&nbsp;a choreographed sequence which we\\u2019ll then look into how we perform this effectively and safely. All participants will explore the themes of the course through a playful and creative approach.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>HEALTH CHECK<\\/strong><\\/p><p>You may or may not be asked to participate in rigorous activity from time to time. Please consider whether you could do this, if you are in any doubt consult a medical practitioner.<\\/p><p>Please wear comfortable appropriate clothing that allows for ease of movement, as if you were going to the gym.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Absolutely no jeans and no boots.<\\/p> Stage Combat Workshop  Explore unarmed combat and develop a selection of moves to combine in to a choreographed sequence!A well-executed fight scene can make stage combat look easy but, much like dancing, it must be intricately choreographed and extensively rehearsed, to provide that authentic feel while remaining safe. Suitable for everyone.What will we cover?We will explore unarmed combat and develop a selection of moves and combine these moves\\u00a0in to\\u00a0a choreographed sequence which we\\u2019ll then look into how we perform this effectively and safely. All participants will explore the themes of the course through a playful and creative approach.\\u00a0HEALTH CHECKYou may or may not be asked to participate in rigorous activity from time to time. Please consider whether you could do this, if you are in any doubt consult a medical practitioner.Please wear comfortable appropriate clothing that allows for ease of movement, as if you were going to the gym.\\u00a0Absolutely no jeans and no boots. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/fT-someone-has-got-to-be-john\\/\",\"id\":\"3401\",\"name\":\"Someone Has Got to Be John\",\"title\":\"Someone Has Got to Be John\",\"duration\":\"50 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786316400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/213204\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786391100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786402800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/213205\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786477500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786316400,1786402800],\"times\":[1786391100,1786477500],\"start_date\":\"1786391100\",\"end_date\":\"1786477500\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"SHJqQU9rbUJZN1FVTVpzcDRiK0Y3QT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Mon 10 - Tue 11 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"\\\"And I find they are an extremely frustrated lot of people.\\\"It is the long hot summer of 1969 in London. A sweltering recording session is about to begin.&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fc\\/7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx249\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/fc7361a1565047b6bd74586810225115.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"43.5\",\"42.3\"],\"search_text\":\"\\\"And I find they are an extremely frustrated lot of people.\\\"It is the long hot summer of 1969 in London. A sweltering recording session is about to begin. Tensions are high. The next few hours will be immortalised in vinyl - and will take the world by storm.And also, round the corner, The Beatles are recording their final studio album.\\u00a0From award-winning Queer\\/Trans ensemble Speakbeast, Someone Has Got To Be John is a fifty-minute fever-dream exploration of our very weird, very long relationship with the medical institution - as we remember the First International Symposium on Gender Identity of 1969, and gatecrash the 56th. It is about voicemails, unlisted YouTube videos, and footnotes. It is about medical records, Beatles records, and a vinyl record stashed in a suitcase. There will be lip-syncing. There will be extensive discussions of McLennon. There will be a bedazzled lab coat.And, due to a misunderstanding of copyright law, it will technically, legally, still be a Beatles tribute act.\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0\\u00a0- \\\"a love letter to trans individuals\\\"\\u00a0(A Young(ish) Perspective)\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605- \\\"hugely inventive\\\"\\u00a0(The Scotsman)\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0- \\\"sharp, surreal and thought provoking\\\"\\u00a0(Broadway Baby)\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0- \\\"a fascinating, fresh perspective\\\"\\u00a0(All Edinburgh Theatre)\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Someone Has Got to Be John Someone Has Got to Be John Bitesize  <p>\\\"And I find they are an extremely frustrated lot of people.\\\"<\\/p><p>It is the long hot summer of 1969 in London. A sweltering recording session is about to begin. Tensions are high. The next few hours will be immortalised in vinyl - and will take the world by storm.<\\/p><p>And also, round the corner, The Beatles are recording their final studio album.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>From award-winning Queer\\/Trans ensemble <strong>Speakbeast<\\/strong>, <i><strong>Someone Has Got To Be John<\\/strong><\\/i> is a fifty-minute fever-dream exploration of our very weird, very long relationship with the medical institution - as we remember the First International Symposium on Gender Identity of 1969, and gatecrash the 56th. It is about voicemails, unlisted YouTube videos, and footnotes. It is about medical records, Beatles records, and a vinyl record stashed in a suitcase. There will be lip-syncing. There will be extensive discussions of McLennon. There will be a bedazzled lab coat.<\\/p><p>And, due to a misunderstanding of copyright law, it will technically, legally, still be a Beatles tribute act.<\\/p><blockquote><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605&nbsp;&nbsp;- \\\"a love letter to trans individuals\\\"<i>&nbsp;(A Young(ish) Perspective)<\\/i><\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605- \\\"hugely inventive\\\"<i>&nbsp;(The Scotsman)<\\/i><\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605&nbsp;- \\\"sharp, surreal and thought provoking\\\"&nbsp;<i>(Broadway Baby)<\\/i><\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605&nbsp;- \\\"a fascinating, fresh perspective\\\"<i>&nbsp;(All Edinburgh Theatre)<\\/i><\\/p><\\/blockquote> Someone Has Got to Be John  \\\"And I find they are an extremely frustrated lot of people.\\\"It is the long hot summer of 1969 in London. A sweltering recording session is about to begin. Tensions are high. The next few hours will be immortalised in vinyl - and will take the world by storm.And also, round the corner, The Beatles are recording their final studio album.\\u00a0From award-winning Queer\\/Trans ensemble Speakbeast, Someone Has Got To Be John is a fifty-minute fever-dream exploration of our very weird, very long relationship with the medical institution - as we remember the First International Symposium on Gender Identity of 1969, and gatecrash the 56th. It is about voicemails, unlisted YouTube videos, and footnotes. It is about medical records, Beatles records, and a vinyl record stashed in a suitcase. There will be lip-syncing. There will be extensive discussions of McLennon. There will be a bedazzled lab coat.And, due to a misunderstanding of copyright law, it will technically, legally, still be a Beatles tribute act.\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0\\u00a0- \\\"a love letter to trans individuals\\\"\\u00a0(A Young(ish) Perspective)\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605- \\\"hugely inventive\\\"\\u00a0(The Scotsman)\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0- \\\"sharp, surreal and thought provoking\\\"\\u00a0(Broadway Baby)\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0- \\\"a fascinating, fresh perspective\\\"\\u00a0(All Edinburgh Theatre) Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/oc-phantasia\\/\",\"id\":\"3541\",\"name\":\"Phantasia\",\"title\":\"Phantasia\",\"duration\":\"50 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786402800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/219801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786471200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786662000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/219802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786730400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786748400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/220001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786800600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786834800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/220201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786896000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786402800,1786662000,1786748400,1786834800],\"times\":[1786471200,1786730400,1786800600,1786896000],\"start_date\":\"1786471200\",\"end_date\":\"1786896000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"V2JkbUJxTWlveFZ0TklvVGg4R29odz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 11 - Sun 16 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Phantasia follows Ayaan, a young Somali woman who slips away into Phantasia, a fully realised inner world she builds for herself. For Ayaan, daydreaming&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w2500\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/35\\/cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7\\/w2500\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/35cd158c97bb2c89cf0282195804eef7.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Phantasia follows Ayaan, a young Somali woman who slips away into Phantasia, a fully realised inner world she builds for herself. For Ayaan, daydreaming is not a habit; it is a form of survival. In Phantasia, the audience are not passive observers - they are characters in Ayaan's world. They are the ones she performs for, confides in and ultimately has to let go of. At its heart, Phantasia asks: what happens when the world in your head becomes the only place you feel seen, and what changes when someone else finally enters that world and truly witnesses it too? A love letter to dreamers, to young Somali women,\\u00a0 Phantasia is a debut work about inherited imagination as survival, sisterhood and the cost of living in your head. Funny, tender and playful, it is a play that asks its audience to be present, because Ayaan never quite learned how.Writer: Afnaan OsmanDirector: Lauryn Perkins-MonneyCast: Muna Abdulahi, Salma Muse, Afnaan Osman\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Phantasia Phantasia Bitesize  <p><i><strong>Phantasia<\\/strong><\\/i> follows Ayaan, a young Somali woman who slips away into Phantasia, a fully realised inner world she builds for herself. For Ayaan, daydreaming is not a habit; it is a form of survival. In Phantasia, the audience are not passive observers - they are characters in Ayaan's world. They are the ones she performs for, confides in and ultimately has to let go of. At its heart, Phantasia asks: what happens when the world in your head becomes the only place you feel seen, and what changes when someone else finally enters that world and truly witnesses it too? A love letter to dreamers, to young Somali women,&nbsp; Phantasia is a debut work about inherited imagination as survival, sisterhood and the cost of living in your head. Funny, tender and playful, it is a play that asks its audience to be present, because Ayaan never quite learned how.<\\/p><p>Writer: Afnaan Osman<\\/p><p>Director: Lauryn Perkins-Monney<\\/p><p>Cast: Muna Abdulahi, Salma Muse, Afnaan Osman&nbsp;<\\/p> Phantasia  Phantasia follows Ayaan, a young Somali woman who slips away into Phantasia, a fully realised inner world she builds for herself. For Ayaan, daydreaming is not a habit; it is a form of survival. In Phantasia, the audience are not passive observers - they are characters in Ayaan's world. They are the ones she performs for, confides in and ultimately has to let go of. At its heart, Phantasia asks: what happens when the world in your head becomes the only place you feel seen, and what changes when someone else finally enters that world and truly witnesses it too? A love letter to dreamers, to young Somali women,\\u00a0 Phantasia is a debut work about inherited imagination as survival, sisterhood and the cost of living in your head. Funny, tender and playful, it is a play that asks its audience to be present, because Ayaan never quite learned how.Writer: Afnaan OsmanDirector: Lauryn Perkins-MonneyCast: Muna Abdulahi, Salma Muse, Afnaan Osman\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Yj-beige\\/\",\"id\":\"3741\",\"name\":\"Beige\",\"title\":\"Beige\",\"duration\":\"\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786402800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/235601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786471200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786489200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/235801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786557600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786575600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/236001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786626000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/236201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786644000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786662000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/236401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786712400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786402800,1786489200,1786575600,1786575600,1786662000],\"times\":[1786471200,1786557600,1786626000,1786644000,1786712400],\"start_date\":\"1786471200\",\"end_date\":\"1786712400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"QWFjOWhCdHFZb0tNNTZNa3ltenovQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 11 - Fri 14 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"BEIGE is a bold, funny and deeply personal new theatre work from Swiss-Congolese actress and theatre-maker Jessica Nlabu.Performed by Jessica Nlabu alongside&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3b\\/b9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3bb9a408a6b64c059cbe3f0dbf99660f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"BEIGE is a bold, funny and deeply personal new theatre work from Swiss-Congolese actress and theatre-maker Jessica Nlabu.Performed by Jessica Nlabu alongside Shannon Kurlander, the piece follows a woman caught between cultures, expectations and labels as she struggles to define herself in a world determined to do it for her.As strangers, family, history and society attempt to define her nationality, personality and worth, she finds herself performing versions of herself for everyone except herself. What begins as a playful exploration of identity gradually transforms into a moving confrontation with belonging, inherited narratives and the pressure to fit neatly into categories that rarely reflect the complexity of real people.Blending physical theatre, humour and raw storytelling, BEIGE explores identity, self-perception and the universal desire to be seen beyond assumptions. Inspired by lived experience and shaped through a highly theatrical and inventive lens, the work combines comedy and vulnerability to create an intimate and thought-provoking audience experience. Moving between humour, discomfort and confrontation, BEIGE examines the stories we inherit about ourselves and the roles we learn to perform in order to belong. As the boundaries between expectation and authenticity begin to blur, the piece exposes the absurdity, violence and contradiction of trying to fit a human being into a fixed category. Unsettling, provocative and at times painfully funny, it invites audiences to question not only how they are seen, but how they see others.At its heart, BEIGE is a celebration of complexity. It is for anyone who has ever felt caught between worlds, searching for a place to belong.Funny, provocative and heartfelt, BEIGE invites audiences to embrace the messy, beautiful reality of being human.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Beige Beige Bitesize  <p><i><strong>BEIGE<\\/strong><\\/i> is a bold, funny and deeply personal new theatre work from Swiss-Congolese actress and theatre-maker Jessica Nlabu.<\\/p><p>Performed by Jessica Nlabu alongside Shannon Kurlander, the piece follows a woman caught between cultures, expectations and labels as she struggles to define herself in a world determined to do it for her.<\\/p><p>As strangers, family, history and society attempt to define her nationality, personality and worth, she finds herself performing versions of herself for everyone except herself. What begins as a playful exploration of identity gradually transforms into a moving confrontation with belonging, inherited narratives and the pressure to fit neatly into categories that rarely reflect the complexity of real people.<\\/p><p>Blending physical theatre, humour and raw storytelling, <i>BEIGE <\\/i>explores identity, self-perception and the universal desire to be seen beyond assumptions. Inspired by lived experience and shaped through a highly theatrical and inventive lens, the work combines comedy and vulnerability to create an intimate and thought-provoking audience experience. Moving between humour, discomfort and confrontation, <i>BEIGE <\\/i>examines the stories we inherit about ourselves and the roles we learn to perform in order to belong. As the boundaries between expectation and authenticity begin to blur, the piece exposes the absurdity, violence and contradiction of trying to fit a human being into a fixed category. Unsettling, provocative and at times painfully funny, it invites audiences to question not only how they are seen, but how they see others.<\\/p><p>At its heart, <i>BEIGE<\\/i> is a celebration of complexity. It is for anyone who has ever felt caught between worlds, searching for a place to belong.<\\/p><p>Funny, provocative and heartfelt, <i>BEIGE<\\/i> invites audiences to embrace the messy, beautiful reality of being human.<\\/p> Beige  BEIGE is a bold, funny and deeply personal new theatre work from Swiss-Congolese actress and theatre-maker Jessica Nlabu.Performed by Jessica Nlabu alongside Shannon Kurlander, the piece follows a woman caught between cultures, expectations and labels as she struggles to define herself in a world determined to do it for her.As strangers, family, history and society attempt to define her nationality, personality and worth, she finds herself performing versions of herself for everyone except herself. What begins as a playful exploration of identity gradually transforms into a moving confrontation with belonging, inherited narratives and the pressure to fit neatly into categories that rarely reflect the complexity of real people.Blending physical theatre, humour and raw storytelling, BEIGE explores identity, self-perception and the universal desire to be seen beyond assumptions. Inspired by lived experience and shaped through a highly theatrical and inventive lens, the work combines comedy and vulnerability to create an intimate and thought-provoking audience experience. Moving between humour, discomfort and confrontation, BEIGE examines the stories we inherit about ourselves and the roles we learn to perform in order to belong. As the boundaries between expectation and authenticity begin to blur, the piece exposes the absurdity, violence and contradiction of trying to fit a human being into a fixed category. Unsettling, provocative and at times painfully funny, it invites audiences to question not only how they are seen, but how they see others.At its heart, BEIGE is a celebration of complexity. It is for anyone who has ever felt caught between worlds, searching for a place to belong.Funny, provocative and heartfelt, BEIGE invites audiences to embrace the messy, beautiful reality of being human. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/oj-the-girls-i-look-up-to\\/\",\"id\":\"3555\",\"name\":\"The Girls I Look Up To\",\"title\":\"The Girls I Look Up To\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786489200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/218011\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786544100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/218012\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786557600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786575600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/218013\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786630500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/218014\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786644000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786662000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/218206\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786716900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786748400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/219401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">12:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786791600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786834800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/219402\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">12:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786878000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/218407\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786905000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786489200,1786489200,1786575600,1786575600,1786662000,1786748400,1786834800,1786834800],\"times\":[1786544100,1786557600,1786630500,1786644000,1786716900,1786791600,1786878000,1786905000],\"start_date\":\"1786544100\",\"end_date\":\"1786905000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"ekd2TDI5TGRQQ3N6elFndk1IV3hzdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Wed 12 - Sun 16 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"The Girls I Look Up To; a homage to women.&nbsp;The piece delves into the heartfelt friendship of four girls from childhood to adulthood. Set during Evelyn's&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.JPG\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bf\\/26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803\\/w600\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/images\\/uploads\\/bf26103267088ec8d6119135cbc27803.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"The Girls I Look Up To; a homage to women.\\u00a0The piece delves into the heartfelt friendship of four girls from childhood to adulthood. Set during Evelyn's birthday celebrations, Bonnie embarks on writing the story of their intoxicating friendship; unbreakable girlhood, grief, and all that exists between.\\u00a0What happens when all you know simply vanishes?\\u00a0\\u201cThis play reflects the complexities of being a woman today with extreme joy and sobering sadness\\u201d\\u00a0\\u201cA masterclass in writing and directing\\u201d\\u00a0Creatives:\\u00a0Anna Cleden - WriterAnna Wicks - Director\\u00a0Caera D\\u2019Arcy - Producer\\u00a0Conor Costelloe - Lighting DesignerAlex Courtney - Set Designer\\u00a0Cast:\\u00a0Anna Cleden - RoseJess Dix - EvelynAmelie Manning - Bonnie\\u00a0Georgia Maguire - Gen\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"The Girls I Look Up To The Girls I Look Up To Bitesize  <p><i><strong>The Girls I Look Up To; a homage to women.&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p><i>The piece delves into the heartfelt friendship of four girls from childhood to adulthood. Set during Evelyn's birthday celebrations, Bonnie embarks on writing the story of their intoxicating friendship; unbreakable girlhood, grief, and all that exists between.&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>What happens when all you know simply vanishes?&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/p><p><i><strong>\\u201cThis play reflects the complexities of being a woman today with extreme joy and sobering sadness\\u201d&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p><i><strong>\\u201cA masterclass in writing and directing\\u201d<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Creatives:&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Anna Cleden - Writer<\\/p><p>Anna Wicks - Director&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Caera D\\u2019Arcy - Producer&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Conor Costelloe - Lighting Designer<\\/p><p>Alex Courtney - Set Designer<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Cast:&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Anna Cleden - Rose<\\/p><p>Jess Dix - Evelyn<\\/p><p>Amelie Manning - Bonnie&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Georgia Maguire - Gen<\\/p> The Girls I Look Up To  The Girls I Look Up To; a homage to women.\\u00a0The piece delves into the heartfelt friendship of four girls from childhood to adulthood. Set during Evelyn's birthday celebrations, Bonnie embarks on writing the story of their intoxicating friendship; unbreakable girlhood, grief, and all that exists between.\\u00a0What happens when all you know simply vanishes?\\u00a0\\u201cThis play reflects the complexities of being a woman today with extreme joy and sobering sadness\\u201d\\u00a0\\u201cA masterclass in writing and directing\\u201d\\u00a0Creatives:\\u00a0Anna Cleden - WriterAnna Wicks - Director\\u00a0Caera D\\u2019Arcy - Producer\\u00a0Conor Costelloe - Lighting DesignerAlex Courtney - Set Designer\\u00a0Cast:\\u00a0Anna Cleden - RoseJess Dix - EvelynAmelie Manning - Bonnie\\u00a0Georgia Maguire - Gen Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/udH-take-a-seat\\/\",\"id\":\"4020\",\"name\":\"Take a Seat\",\"title\":\"Take a Seat\",\"duration\":\"40 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786489200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/250801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786563900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786575600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/250802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786650300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786489200,1786575600],\"times\":[1786563900,1786650300],\"start_date\":\"1786563900\",\"end_date\":\"1786650300\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"eU94VUN1Uk1vOFJJem1lTVhFODBKQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Wed 12 - Thu 13 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Two chairs.&nbsp;A&nbsp;projector.&nbsp;And&nbsp;a&nbsp;series of increasingly strange instructions.We do what we&nbsp;are told. But why?&nbsp;Take&nbsp;a&nbsp;Seat&nbsp;explores&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d3ad40991cc8f7a47737ef6859d733e.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Two chairs.\\u00a0A\\u00a0projector.\\u00a0And\\u00a0a\\u00a0series of increasingly strange instructions.We do what we\\u00a0are told. But why?\\u00a0Take\\u00a0a\\u00a0Seat\\u00a0explores copying, imitation\\u00a0and obedience. Using\\u00a0a\\u00a0sequence of bizarre\\u00a0and weirdly specific stock images, two performers\\u00a0attempt to recreate each\\u00a0as precisely\\u00a0as possible.\\u00a0As the copying continues,\\u00a0awkward encounters, fleeting relationships,\\u00a0and unexpected stories begin to\\u00a0arise. Blending movement, mime, voice,\\u00a0and minimal technology, the piece plays with how narratives\\u00a0are formed: not through fixed storytelling, but through the\\u00a0audience's own interpretation.To what extent\\u00a0are we willing to follow? Will you obey the instructions should they be given to you?\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Take a Seat Take a Seat Bitesize  <p>Two chairs.&nbsp;A&nbsp;projector.&nbsp;And&nbsp;a&nbsp;series of increasingly strange instructions.<\\/p><p>We do what we&nbsp;are told. But why?&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Take&nbsp;a&nbsp;Seat<\\/strong><\\/i>&nbsp;explores copying, imitation&nbsp;and obedience. Using&nbsp;a&nbsp;sequence of bizarre&nbsp;and weirdly specific stock images, two performers&nbsp;attempt to recreate each&nbsp;as precisely&nbsp;as possible.&nbsp;As the copying continues,&nbsp;awkward encounters, fleeting relationships,&nbsp;and unexpected stories begin to&nbsp;arise. Blending movement, mime, voice,&nbsp;and minimal technology, the piece plays with how narratives&nbsp;are formed: not through fixed storytelling, but through the&nbsp;audience's own interpretation.<\\/p><p>To what extent&nbsp;are we willing to follow? Will you obey the instructions should they be given to you?<\\/p> Take a Seat  Two chairs.\\u00a0A\\u00a0projector.\\u00a0And\\u00a0a\\u00a0series of increasingly strange instructions.We do what we\\u00a0are told. But why?\\u00a0Take\\u00a0a\\u00a0Seat\\u00a0explores copying, imitation\\u00a0and obedience. Using\\u00a0a\\u00a0sequence of bizarre\\u00a0and weirdly specific stock images, two performers\\u00a0attempt to recreate each\\u00a0as precisely\\u00a0as possible.\\u00a0As the copying continues,\\u00a0awkward encounters, fleeting relationships,\\u00a0and unexpected stories begin to\\u00a0arise. Blending movement, mime, voice,\\u00a0and minimal technology, the piece plays with how narratives\\u00a0are formed: not through fixed storytelling, but through the\\u00a0audience's own interpretation.To what extent\\u00a0are we willing to follow? Will you obey the instructions should they be given to you? Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/5D-jukebox-the-musical\\/\",\"id\":\"3716\",\"name\":\"Jukebox The Musical\",\"title\":\"Jukebox The Musical\",\"duration\":\"55 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786489200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/233601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786563900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786575600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/232615\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786650300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786748400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/233801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786814100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786489200,1786575600,1786748400],\"times\":[1786563900,1786650300,1786814100],\"start_date\":\"1786563900\",\"end_date\":\"1786814100\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"MVo3N1QxdTRDU0s2RHd1bUxwMVIvZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Wed 12 - Sat 15 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"You may&nbsp; have forgotten 1980s pop star, The Gorgeous Diva...but that\\u2019s never stopped her before.Now she's back with a jukebox musical featuring all&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fa\\/bc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4\\/w1260\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fabc15f16f6a5a8252f25fbe425a66d4.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"You may\\u00a0 have forgotten 1980s pop star, The Gorgeous Diva...but that\\u2019s never stopped her before.Now she's back with a jukebox musical featuring all of her hit (sic). Sing along to classics such as Love Hurts When Eagles Fly, hear a celebrity anecdote or two, then stay for the really good plot.One that's at least half as good as We Will Rock You.These days every pop star seems to have a jukebox musical. All you need is a devoted fanbase and a catalogue of hit songs. The Gorgeous Diva has neither, but that hasn\\u2019t stopped her writing one anyway.Whether or not she performs any of it is another matter.A gloriously stupid theatrical spectacle from two-time Musical Comedy Award nominee Jay Bennett.\\u00a0Entertainment Focus \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605BroadwayBaby\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 'Belly laughs come thick and fast'LondonTheatre1 \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 'The shows entire package is a delight'Chortle - \\u2018An unfailingly engaging hour\\u2019\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Jukebox The Musical Jukebox The Musical Bitesize  <p>You may&nbsp; have forgotten 1980s pop star, The Gorgeous Diva...but that\\u2019s never stopped her before.<\\/p><p>Now she's back with a jukebox musical featuring all of her hit (sic). Sing along to classics such as Love Hurts When Eagles Fly, hear a celebrity anecdote or two, then stay for the really good plot.<\\/p><p>One that's at least half as good as We Will Rock You.<\\/p><p>These days every pop star seems to have a jukebox musical. All you need is a devoted fanbase and a catalogue of hit songs. The Gorgeous Diva has neither, but that hasn\\u2019t stopped her writing one anyway.<\\/p><p>Whether or not she performs any of it is another matter.<\\/p><p>A gloriously stupid theatrical spectacle from two-time Musical Comedy Award nominee Jay Bennett.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Entertainment Focus \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>BroadwayBaby\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 'Belly laughs come thick and fast'<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>LondonTheatre1 \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 'The shows entire package is a delight'<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Chortle - \\u2018An unfailingly engaging hour\\u2019<\\/strong><\\/p> Jukebox The Musical  You may\\u00a0 have forgotten 1980s pop star, The Gorgeous Diva...but that\\u2019s never stopped her before.Now she's back with a jukebox musical featuring all of her hit (sic). Sing along to classics such as Love Hurts When Eagles Fly, hear a celebrity anecdote or two, then stay for the really good plot.One that's at least half as good as We Will Rock You.These days every pop star seems to have a jukebox musical. All you need is a devoted fanbase and a catalogue of hit songs. The Gorgeous Diva has neither, but that hasn\\u2019t stopped her writing one anyway.Whether or not she performs any of it is another matter.A gloriously stupid theatrical spectacle from two-time Musical Comedy Award nominee Jay Bennett.\\u00a0Entertainment Focus \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605BroadwayBaby\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 'Belly laughs come thick and fast'LondonTheatre1 \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 'The shows entire package is a delight'Chortle - \\u2018An unfailingly engaging hour\\u2019 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/E2-this-time-is-different\\/\",\"id\":\"3460\",\"name\":\"This Time is Different\",\"title\":\"This Time is Different\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786662000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786730400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786662000],\"times\":[1786730400],\"start_date\":\"1786730400\",\"end_date\":\"1786730400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"SXA2SFZvb0xuRy9NTTdrbzlMc3NLUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 14 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"This Time is Different&nbsp;is a one-hour solo comedy show by Zhou Ning, mixing stand-up, live music and storytelling.&nbsp;The show is a loose emotional&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx1043\\/cy60\\/cw2294\\/ch2298\\/images\\/uploads\\/28f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\