70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1043\\/cy60\\/cw2294\\/ch2298\\/images\\/uploads\\/28f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1043\\/cy60\\/cw2294\\/ch2298\\/images\\/uploads\\/28f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1043\\/cy60\\/cw2294\\/ch2298\\/images\\/uploads\\/28f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1043\\/cy60\\/cw2294\\/ch2298\\/images\\/uploads\\/28f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1043\\/cy60\\/cw2294\\/ch2298\\/images\\/uploads\\/28f70706d75ff109a95774c8fa20411d.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"51.6\",\"48.4\"],\"search_text\":\"This Time is Different\\u00a0is a one-hour solo comedy show by Zhou Ning, mixing stand-up, live music and storytelling.\\u00a0The show is a loose emotional journey, talking about love, shame, queerness, family, immigration, emotional patterns that she keeps repeating, relationships that almost worked out, leftover food she microwaves, and\\u00a0a driving licence that never quite happens.After two sold-out work-in-progress performances, the show comes to Riverside Studios as the next step in its development.\\u00a0Bringing together Ning\\u2019s background in visual art, music and comedy, This Time is Different turns intimate personal experiences into moments that are both emotionally honest and absurdly funny. It is a sincere, playful and slightly awkward show, carrying a quiet sense of hope.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"This Time is Different This Time is Different Bitesize  <p><i><strong>This Time is Different<\\/strong><\\/i><strong>&nbsp;<\\/strong>is a one-hour solo comedy show by Zhou Ning, mixing stand-up, live music and storytelling.&nbsp;The show is a loose emotional journey, talking about love, shame, queerness, family, immigration, emotional patterns that she keeps repeating, relationships that almost worked out, leftover food she microwaves, and&nbsp;a driving licence that never quite happens.<\\/p><p>After two sold-out work-in-progress performances, the show comes to Riverside Studios as the next step in its development.&nbsp;Bringing together Ning\\u2019s background in visual art, music and comedy, <i>This Time is Different<\\/i> turns intimate personal experiences into moments that are both emotionally honest and absurdly funny. It is a sincere, playful and slightly awkward show, carrying a quiet sense of hope.<\\/p> This Time is Different  This Time is Different\\u00a0is a one-hour solo comedy show by Zhou Ning, mixing stand-up, live music and storytelling.\\u00a0The show is a loose emotional journey, talking about love, shame, queerness, family, immigration, emotional patterns that she keeps repeating, relationships that almost worked out, leftover food she microwaves, and\\u00a0a driving licence that never quite happens.After two sold-out work-in-progress performances, the show comes to Riverside Studios as the next step in its development.\\u00a0Bringing together Ning\\u2019s background in visual art, music and comedy, This Time is Different turns intimate personal experiences into moments that are both emotionally honest and absurdly funny. It is a sincere, playful and slightly awkward show, carrying a quiet sense of hope. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/oz-mollusc\\/\",\"id\":\"3575\",\"name\":\"Mollusc\",\"title\":\"Mollusc\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786662000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/222401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786736700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786748400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/221402\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786818600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786662000,1786748400],\"times\":[1786736700,1786818600],\"start_date\":\"1786736700\",\"end_date\":\"1786818600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"SlN4VEU5Zk1nMHBaRDRIcXE3bWNtQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 14 - Sat 15 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"FRANKIE: You want me to wash the blood out of your jorts? Really?&nbsp;EL: It literally wouldn\\u2019t be the first time.&nbsp;Born from an award-winning short&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c5\\/f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c5f8f5e24cd928b369632dd904adadb5.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"FRANKIE: You want me to wash the blood out of your jorts? Really?\\u00a0EL: It literally wouldn\\u2019t be the first time.\\u00a0Born from an award-winning short play, Mollusc is a sapphic anti-rom-com three-hander, chronicling the shifting relationship of Frankie, a paralegal, and El, a costume designer, jumping across five chaotic years.Identity, sexuality, availability and accountability are all blurred lines as this couple zig-zag through a relationship we know from the beginning is doomed to fail. But, as the curtains draw shut on their relationship, it\\u2019s hard not to fall in love with their beginning.\\u00a0Sexy, funny, sharply drawn, come dive headfirst into the universally dreaded realisation that your ex\\u2019s life does indeed continue after you're gone.\\u00a0\\u00a0Written and Produced by Caoimhe BlairCaoimhe Blair is an emerging writer from London. She works at a production company in London, and was previously an Agent\\u2019s Assistant at Curtis Brown.\\u00a0Mollusc was her first short play, performed at The Lion and Unicorn Theatre in March 2025, winning Second Quarter Production\\u2019s PRESSURE 1, and introducing her to director Lilly Butcher. Her recent short play, Locker, directed by Aaron Finnegan, won at Second Quarter Production's PRESSURE 4 in March 2026 at Playhouse East.\\u00a0After getting some (medically induced) help with her attention span, Mollusc marks Caoimhe\\u2019s debut hour.\\u00a0\\u00a0Directed and Sound Designed by Lilly ButcherLily is a Queer director with a focus on new writing. Selected credits as director include: It\\u2019s a Wonderful Knife: Christmas Dundee- The Old Joint Stock Birmingham, Don Jon in Barcelona- The Jag Belgrade Theatre, Shark H8ter- The Etcetera Theatre Camden, In Memoriam- Edinburgh Fringe.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Mollusc Mollusc Bitesize  <p><i>FRANKIE: You want me to wash the blood out of your jorts? Really?&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>EL: It literally wouldn\\u2019t be the first time.<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Born from an award-winning short play, <i>Mollusc<\\/i> is a sapphic anti-rom-com three-hander, chronicling the shifting relationship of Frankie, a paralegal, and El, a costume designer, jumping across five chaotic years.<\\/p><p>Identity, sexuality, availability and accountability are all blurred lines as this couple zig-zag through a relationship we know from the beginning is doomed to fail. But, as the curtains draw shut on their relationship, it\\u2019s hard not to fall in love with their beginning.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Sexy, funny, sharply drawn, come dive headfirst into the universally dreaded realisation that your ex\\u2019s life does indeed continue after you're gone.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Written and Produced by Caoimhe Blair<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Caoimhe Blair is an emerging writer from London. She works at a production company in London, and was previously an Agent\\u2019s Assistant at Curtis Brown.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>Mollusc <\\/i>was her first short play, performed at The Lion and Unicorn Theatre in March 2025, winning Second Quarter Production\\u2019s PRESSURE 1, and introducing her to director Lilly Butcher. Her recent short play, <i>Locker<\\/i>, directed by Aaron Finnegan, won at Second Quarter Production's PRESSURE 4 in March 2026 at Playhouse East.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>After getting some (medically induced) help with her attention span,<i> Mollusc <\\/i>marks Caoimhe\\u2019s debut hour.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Directed and Sound Designed by Lilly Butcher<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Lily is a Queer director with a focus on new writing. Selected credits as director include: It\\u2019s a Wonderful Knife: Christmas Dundee- The Old Joint Stock Birmingham, Don Jon in Barcelona- The Jag Belgrade Theatre, Shark H8ter- The Etcetera Theatre Camden, In Memoriam- Edinburgh Fringe.<\\/p> Mollusc  FRANKIE: You want me to wash the blood out of your jorts? Really?\\u00a0EL: It literally wouldn\\u2019t be the first time.\\u00a0Born from an award-winning short play, Mollusc is a sapphic anti-rom-com three-hander, chronicling the shifting relationship of Frankie, a paralegal, and El, a costume designer, jumping across five chaotic years.Identity, sexuality, availability and accountability are all blurred lines as this couple zig-zag through a relationship we know from the beginning is doomed to fail. But, as the curtains draw shut on their relationship, it\\u2019s hard not to fall in love with their beginning.\\u00a0Sexy, funny, sharply drawn, come dive headfirst into the universally dreaded realisation that your ex\\u2019s life does indeed continue after you're gone.\\u00a0\\u00a0Written and Produced by Caoimhe BlairCaoimhe Blair is an emerging writer from London. She works at a production company in London, and was previously an Agent\\u2019s Assistant at Curtis Brown.\\u00a0Mollusc was her first short play, performed at The Lion and Unicorn Theatre in March 2025, winning Second Quarter Production\\u2019s PRESSURE 1, and introducing her to director Lilly Butcher. Her recent short play, Locker, directed by Aaron Finnegan, won at Second Quarter Production's PRESSURE 4 in March 2026 at Playhouse East.\\u00a0After getting some (medically induced) help with her attention span, Mollusc marks Caoimhe\\u2019s debut hour.\\u00a0\\u00a0Directed and Sound Designed by Lilly ButcherLily is a Queer director with a focus on new writing. Selected credits as director include: It\\u2019s a Wonderful Knife: Christmas Dundee- The Old Joint Stock Birmingham, Don Jon in Barcelona- The Jag Belgrade Theatre, Shark H8ter- The Etcetera Theatre Camden, In Memoriam- Edinburgh Fringe. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/oC-stuck-in-dubai\\/\",\"id\":\"3561\",\"name\":\"Stuck in Dubai\",\"title\":\"Stuck in Dubai\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786662000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/220601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786736700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786748400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/220801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786796100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/220602\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786823100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786834800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/220802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786882500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/221001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786900500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786662000,1786748400,1786748400,1786834800,1786834800],\"times\":[1786736700,1786796100,1786823100,1786882500,1786900500],\"start_date\":\"1786736700\",\"end_date\":\"1786900500\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"RkR5TlpNYWdDK2RaeFQxajFualdHUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 14 - Sun 16 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"South African comedian Dalin Oliver is set to take the stage at Bitesize Festival in London with the international debut of his brand\\u2011new stand\\u2011up comedy&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d3\\/cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1598\\/cyNaN\\/cw2148\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/d3cdbd7525ce0c8d0b98a20d328bef2a.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"51.1\",\"31.5\"],\"search_text\":\"South African comedian Dalin Oliver is set to take the stage at Bitesize Festival in London with the international debut of his brand\\u2011new stand\\u2011up comedy show, Stuck in Dubai - a wild, true story born from an experience no traveller ever wants. En route to perform at Adelaide Fringe, Dalin was in transit when conflict broke out in the region, leaving him stranded in Dubai for four long, surreal days.What followed was a chaotic mix of uncertainty, humour and unexpected viral fame. His social media updates exploded, and Dalin suddenly became South Africa\\u2019s favourite \\u201cofficial\\u2011unofficial international news correspondent,\\u201dearning both local and international media attention. In classic South African style, he turned a traumatic moment into comedy gold - finding laughter and love in his posts, and receiving the same in return.\\u00a0It\\u2019s a miracle he made his connecting flight to Australia, eventually landing Down Under just hours before showtime. Fresh from surviving the wildest layover imaginable, including witnessing live missiles, he now brings the chaos, adrenaline and high\\u2011energy storytelling to the Riverside Studios for a limited five\\u2011show run from 14 to 16 August.See you at the show, mate.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Stuck in Dubai Stuck in Dubai Bitesize  <p>South African comedian Dalin Oliver is set to take the stage at Bitesize Festival in London with the international debut of his brand\\u2011new stand\\u2011up comedy show, Stuck in Dubai - a wild, true story born from an experience no traveller ever wants. En route to perform at Adelaide Fringe, Dalin was in transit when conflict broke out in the region, leaving him stranded in Dubai for four long, surreal days.<\\/p><p>What followed was a chaotic mix of uncertainty, humour and unexpected viral fame. His social media updates exploded, and Dalin suddenly became South Africa\\u2019s favourite \\u201cofficial\\u2011unofficial international news correspondent,\\u201dearning both local and international media attention. In classic South African style, he turned a traumatic moment into comedy gold - finding laughter and love in his posts, and receiving the same in return.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>It\\u2019s a miracle he made his connecting flight to Australia, eventually landing Down Under just hours before showtime. Fresh from surviving the wildest layover imaginable, including witnessing live missiles, he now brings the chaos, adrenaline and high\\u2011energy storytelling to the Riverside Studios for a limited five\\u2011show run from 14 to 16 August.<\\/p><p>See you at the show, mate.<\\/p> Stuck in Dubai  South African comedian Dalin Oliver is set to take the stage at Bitesize Festival in London with the international debut of his brand\\u2011new stand\\u2011up comedy show, Stuck in Dubai - a wild, true story born from an experience no traveller ever wants. En route to perform at Adelaide Fringe, Dalin was in transit when conflict broke out in the region, leaving him stranded in Dubai for four long, surreal days.What followed was a chaotic mix of uncertainty, humour and unexpected viral fame. His social media updates exploded, and Dalin suddenly became South Africa\\u2019s favourite \\u201cofficial\\u2011unofficial international news correspondent,\\u201dearning both local and international media attention. In classic South African style, he turned a traumatic moment into comedy gold - finding laughter and love in his posts, and receiving the same in return.\\u00a0It\\u2019s a miracle he made his connecting flight to Australia, eventually landing Down Under just hours before showtime. Fresh from surviving the wildest layover imaginable, including witnessing live missiles, he now brings the chaos, adrenaline and high\\u2011energy storytelling to the Riverside Studios for a limited five\\u2011show run from 14 to 16 August.See you at the show, mate. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uqX-bitesize-festival-music-day-free-entry\\/\",\"id\":\"4205\",\"name\":\"Bitesize Festival 50 - Music Day (FREE ENTRY)\",\"title\":\"Bitesize Festival - Music Day (FREE ENTRY)\",\"duration\":\"\",\"slot_tag\":\"Music\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"0\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\",\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[],\"times\":[],\"start_date\":\"1786800600\",\"end_date\":\"1786822200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"TmZ2VWhBNnFJcVNLb0lZbXpkc2kydz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 15 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Venue: Riverside Studios Atrium&nbsp;Spend an unforgettable summer afternoon at Bitesize Festival 50 Music Day, a celebration of exceptional live music&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1755\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1755\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1755\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1755\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1755\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e7\\/f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5\\/w1755\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/e7f364095406ef0eab1e4f319df5f9b5.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Venue: Riverside Studios Atrium\\u00a0Spend an unforgettable summer afternoon at Bitesize Festival 50 Music Day, a celebration of exceptional live music showcasing emerging and established artists from across London and beyond.From intimate singer-songwriters and soulful vocals to indie, folk, jazz and world music, discover six unique live performances throughout the day in the heart of Riverside Studios. Whether you\\u2019re staying for one set or immersing yourself in the full programme, Music Day is the perfect opportunity to discover your next favourite artist.\\u00a0Live Line-upJuelma: 2:30-3pmClove: 3pm-3:30pmLouella: 5-5:30pmCora: 5:30-6pmSachinn: 7:30-8pmSarabanda: 8pm - 8:30pm\\u00a0With performances running from 2:30pm until 8:30pm, expect an afternoon filled with outstanding music, new discoveries and a vibrant festival atmosphere as part of Bitesize Festival 50.Come for the music, stay for the riverside setting, enjoy great food and drinks from our Bar & Kitchen, and celebrate the next generation of artists!\",\"book_link\":\"no-link\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\",\"113\"],\"search\":\"Bitesize Festival 50 - Music Day (FREE ENTRY) Bitesize Festival - Music Day (FREE ENTRY) Music  <p><strong>Venue: Riverside Studios Atrium<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Spend an unforgettable summer afternoon at Bitesize Festival 50 Music Day, a celebration of exceptional live music showcasing emerging and established artists from across London and beyond.<\\/p><p>From intimate singer-songwriters and soulful vocals to indie, folk, jazz and world music, discover six unique live performances throughout the day in the heart of Riverside Studios. Whether you\\u2019re staying for one set or immersing yourself in the full programme, Music Day is the perfect opportunity to discover your next favourite artist.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Live Line-up<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Juelma: 2:30-3pm<\\/p><p>Clove: 3pm-3:30pm<\\/p><p>Louella: 5-5:30pm<\\/p><p>Cora: 5:30-6pm<\\/p><p>Sachinn: 7:30-8pm<\\/p><p>Sarabanda: 8pm - 8:30pm<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>With performances running from 2:30pm until 8:30pm, expect an afternoon filled with outstanding music, new discoveries and a vibrant festival atmosphere as part of Bitesize Festival 50.<\\/p><p>Come for the music, stay for the riverside setting, enjoy great food and drinks from our Bar &amp; Kitchen, and celebrate the next generation of artists!<\\/p>   Venue: Riverside Studios Atrium\\u00a0Spend an unforgettable summer afternoon at Bitesize Festival 50 Music Day, a celebration of exceptional live music showcasing emerging and established artists from across London and beyond.From intimate singer-songwriters and soulful vocals to indie, folk, jazz and world music, discover six unique live performances throughout the day in the heart of Riverside Studios. Whether you\\u2019re staying for one set or immersing yourself in the full programme, Music Day is the perfect opportunity to discover your next favourite artist.\\u00a0Live Line-upJuelma: 2:30-3pmClove: 3pm-3:30pmLouella: 5-5:30pmCora: 5:30-6pmSachinn: 7:30-8pmSarabanda: 8pm - 8:30pm\\u00a0With performances running from 2:30pm until 8:30pm, expect an afternoon filled with outstanding music, new discoveries and a vibrant festival atmosphere as part of Bitesize Festival 50.Come for the music, stay for the riverside setting, enjoy great food and drinks from our Bar & Kitchen, and celebrate the next generation of artists! Bitesize Music\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/YQ-the-risotto-is-burning\\/\",\"id\":\"3760\",\"name\":\"The Risotto Is Burning\",\"title\":\"The Risotto Is Burning\",\"duration\":\"30 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786748400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\",\"0\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/237801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786809600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1786834800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\",\"0\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/238001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786887000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1786748400,1786834800],\"times\":[1786809600,1786887000],\"start_date\":\"1786809600\",\"end_date\":\"1786887000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"prio