ges\\/uploads\\/1eb0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/b0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500\\/w1149\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/1eb0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/b0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500\\/w1149\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/1eb0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/b0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500\\/w1149\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/1eb0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/b0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500\\/w1149\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/1eb0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/b0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500\\/w1149\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/1eb0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/b0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500\\/w1149\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/1eb0e678217d797453b67e5fc4e09500.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"A long-standing couple, Annabelle and Benjamin, get ready to host their first dinner party at their new flat. The guest list? Annabelle\\u2019s university best friends, Leah and Maddy, and their respective partners. It\\u2019s been years since the three of them have been together properly.\\u00a0Tensions run high and wine runs rampant as Leah arrives with her new girlfriend Layla, a 20-year-old vegan she picked up at a Buddhist retreat.\\u00a0Things take a turn for the absurd when Maddy arrives with her new partner Jeremy - a fuzzy blue puppet. Throughout the night the six of them are forced to hash out what it means to love and be loved in a rapidly changing world, and whether it\\u2019s better to be with someone wrong than to be with no one at all. Annabelle and Leah\\u2019s past is brought into question, and old feelings resurface. But at the end of the night - who\\u2019s going home with who?\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"The Risotto Is Burning The Risotto Is Burning Bitesize  <p>A long-standing couple, Annabelle and Benjamin, get ready to host their first dinner party at their new flat. The guest list? Annabelle\\u2019s university best friends, Leah and Maddy, and their respective partners. It\\u2019s been years since the three of them have been together properly.&nbsp;<br><br>Tensions run high and wine runs rampant as Leah arrives with her new girlfriend Layla, a 20-year-old vegan she picked up at a Buddhist retreat.&nbsp;<br><br>Things take a turn for the absurd when Maddy arrives with her new partner Jeremy - a fuzzy blue puppet. Throughout the night the six of them are forced to hash out what it means to love and be loved in a rapidly changing world, and whether it\\u2019s better to be with someone wrong than to be with no one at all. Annabelle and Leah\\u2019s past is brought into question, and old feelings resurface. But at the end of the night - who\\u2019s going home with who?<\\/p> The Risotto Is Burning  A long-standing couple, Annabelle and Benjamin, get ready to host their first dinner party at their new flat. The guest list? Annabelle\\u2019s university best friends, Leah and Maddy, and their respective partners. It\\u2019s been years since the three of them have been together properly.\\u00a0Tensions run high and wine runs rampant as Leah arrives with her new girlfriend Layla, a 20-year-old vegan she picked up at a Buddhist retreat.\\u00a0Things take a turn for the absurd when Maddy arrives with her new partner Jeremy - a fuzzy blue puppet. Throughout the night the six of them are forced to hash out what it means to love and be loved in a rapidly changing world, and whether it\\u2019s better to be with someone wrong than to be with no one at all. Annabelle and Leah\\u2019s past is brought into question, and old feelings resurface. But at the end of the night - who\\u2019s going home with who? Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/YV-kingdom-of-ghosts\\/\",\"id\":\"3724\",\"name\":\"Kingdom of Ghosts\",\"title\":\"Kingdom of Ghosts\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1786921200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/234601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1786989600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787007600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/234801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787076000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787094000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/232205\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787162400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787180400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/234802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787248800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787266800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/233802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n