eeabd0a0.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9c\\/347b81245dff67a80fc75feeabd0a0\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/9c347b81245dff67a80fc75feeabd0a0.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Kingdom of Ghosts is a solo performance that takes the form of a live guerrilla radio broadcast - urgent and charged, blending hip-hop, lecture, and radio storytelling. The performer moves between rap and direct address to dial into Congo's unresolved past. What emerges is a live transmission about power, betrayal, and fractures that refuse to close.\\u00a0Presented by The multi-award-winning South African theatre company TheatreDuo and Co.\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Kingdom of Ghosts Kingdom of Ghosts Bitesize  <p><i><strong>Kingdom of Ghosts<\\/strong><\\/i> is a solo performance that takes the form of a live guerrilla radio broadcast - urgent and charged, blending hip-hop, lecture, and radio storytelling. The performer moves between rap and direct address to dial into Congo's unresolved past. What emerges is a live transmission about power, betrayal, and fractures that refuse to close.<\\/p><p><br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Presented by The multi-award-winning South African theatre company TheatreDuo and Co.&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p> Kingdom of Ghosts  Kingdom of Ghosts is a solo performance that takes the form of a live guerrilla radio broadcast - urgent and charged, blending hip-hop, lecture, and radio storytelling. The performer moves between rap and direct address to dial into Congo's unresolved past. What emerges is a live transmission about power, betrayal, and fractures that refuse to close.\\u00a0Presented by The multi-award-winning South African theatre company TheatreDuo and Co.\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/EA-splintered\\/\",\"id\":\"3410\",\"name\":\"Splintered\",\"title\":\"Splintered\",\"duration\":\"55 minutes\",\"