\\/c7\\/521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/c7521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c7\\/521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/c7521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c7\\/521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/c7521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c7\\/521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/c7521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c7\\/521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/c7521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c7\\/521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/c7521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c7\\/521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/c7521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c7\\/521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/c7521be77a07efbbe626a4ba1a8d3728.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"39.0\",\"32.2\"],\"search_text\":\"Little Lord Fondleroy is a saccharine nightmare in velvet and lace, whose cherubic curls and perfect manners provide foolproof cover for his constant yearnings - primarily for poetry, pleasure, head boys and complete theatrical chaos.In this riotous hour, whirl through a formative annus eroticus at Flippitts Darstardly Boarding School for Badly Behaved Boys, where forbidden desires flourish amidst a sadistic culture of cruelty cultivated by prefects and masters alike. Here, Fondleroy discovers that masculinity and Empire are stitched together by caning, cunning and carefully repressed desire.Can he retain his innocent charm and boyish over-generosity while the forces around him attempt to stamp all that soppy, frilly, froppy feeling out of him?\\u00a0Written & Performed by Jordana BelaicheDirected by Ros Watt\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Little Lord Fondleroy Little Lord Fondleroy Bitesize  <p><i><strong>Little Lord Fondleroy<\\/strong><\\/i> is a saccharine nightmare in velvet and lace, whose cherubic curls and perfect manners provide foolproof cover for his constant yearnings - primarily for poetry, pleasure, head boys and complete theatrical chaos.In this riotous hour, whirl through a formative annus eroticus at Flippitts Darstardly Boarding School for Badly Behaved Boys, where forbidden desires flourish amidst a sadistic culture of cruelty cultivated by prefects and masters alike. Here, Fondleroy discovers that masculinity and Empire are stitched together by caning, cunning and carefully repressed desire.<\\/p><p>Can he retain his innocent charm and boyish over-generosity while the forces around him attempt to stamp all that soppy, frilly, froppy feeling out of him?<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Written &amp; Performed by Jordana Belaiche<\\/p><p>Directed by Ros Watt<\\/p> Little Lord Fondleroy  Little Lord Fondleroy is a saccharine nightmare in velvet and lace, whose cherubic curls and perfect manners provide foolproof cover for his constant yearnings - primarily for poetry, pleasure, head boys and complete theatrical chaos.In this riotous hour, whirl through a formative annus eroticus at Flippitts Darstardly Boarding School for Badly Behaved Boys, where forbidden desires flourish amidst a sadistic culture of cruelty cultivated by prefects and masters alike. Here, Fondleroy discovers that masculinity and Empire are stitched together by caning, cunning and carefully repressed desire.Can he retain his innocent charm and boyish over-generosity while the forces around him attempt to stamp all that soppy, frilly, froppy feeling out of him?\\u00a0Written & Performed by Jordana BelaicheDirected by Ros Watt Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/yK-custard-tarts\\/\",\"id\":\"3492\",\"name\":\"Custard Tarts\",\"title\":\"Custard Tarts\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787180400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/217201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787235300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787266800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/217401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787335200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787353200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/217601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">12:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787396400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/217602\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787414400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787439600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/217801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\