rd Tarts Custard Tarts Bitesize  <p>A witty, heartwarming and gloriously eggy romp that follows Nancy, a young queer woman, as she summons four lesbians from across the twentieth century to her dinner table. At times, <i>Custard Tarts<\\/i> is a poignant look at queer costuming, coding and community-building, at others a campy, raucous spectacle. There are many fingers in many pies.&nbsp;<\\/p> Custard Tarts  A witty, heartwarming and gloriously eggy romp that follows Nancy, a young queer woman, as she summons four lesbians from across the twentieth century to her dinner table. At times, Custard Tarts is a poignant look at queer costuming, coding and community-building, at others a campy, raucous spectacle. There are many fingers in many pies.\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/EF-the-waiting\\/\",\"id\":\"3433\",\"name\":\"The Waiting\",\"title\":\"The Waiting\",\"duration\":\"40 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787180400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/210602\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787255100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787266800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/210603\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787341500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787353200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/213604\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787409900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787180400,1787266800,1787353200],\"times\":[1787255100,1787341500,1787409900],\"start_date\":\"1787255100\",\"end_date\":\"1787409900\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"dFh3aVhzZWNOYkxxSi9BaStla0FSUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 20 - Sat 22 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Everything is just un PUTAIN de jeu!Join Maeva, a French posh girl and former supermodel who just ran away from the altar. She bursts in this rustic pub.&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/38\\/c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx708\\/cy138\\/cw3539\\/ch3537\\/images\\/uploads\\/38c99041d3a4d28a481c0f24a027fc5e.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"49.3\",\"35.5\"],\"search_text\":\"Everything is just un PUTAIN de jeu!Join Maeva, a French posh girl and former supermodel who just ran away from the altar. She bursts in this rustic pub. Waiting. For nothing. She just needs a minute, okay? To think. And remember. Maybe? About her previous life, full of fame, dodgy shrimps and Jean-Paul Gaultier. The good old days, you see?Under layers of Champagne Ros\\u00e9 and glitters, The Waiting is feminist, sarcastic and punchy. We take the time to wait with Maeva, who left a trail of destruction behind her whole life. Have a sit, have a sip while she navigates her mind, and shares hidden memories.Will she ever get her diet Martini?\\u00ab Nina-Lou Bricard delivers a fearless and intimate performance that oscillates between glamour and grief, comedy and confession.\\u00a0The Waiting is\\u00a0funny, frantic and hauntingly human \\u00bb\\u00a0-\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0Binge Fringe Magazine\\u00ab The Waiting is a hard-hitting exploration of the pervasive exploitation of young girls and women. Peppered with humour and physical comedy, the darker narrative is deftly woven into a broader story of a larger-than-life character laying her soul bare. \\u00bb\\u00a0-\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 A shiny life for me\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"The Waiting The Waiting Bitesize  <p>Everything is just un PUTAIN de jeu!<\\/p><p>Join Maeva, a French posh girl and former supermodel who just ran away from the altar. She bursts in this rustic pub. Waiting. For nothing. She just needs a minute, okay? To think. And remember. Maybe? About her previous life, full of fame, dodgy shrimps and Jean-Paul Gaultier. The good old days, you see?<\\/p><p>Under layers of Champagne Ros\\u00e9 and glitters, The Waiting is feminist, sarcastic and punchy. We take the time to wait with Maeva, who left a trail of destruction behind her whole life. Have a sit, have a sip while she navigates her mind, and shares hidden memories.<\\/p><p>Will she ever get her diet Martini?<\\/p><blockquote><p>\\u00ab Nina-Lou Bricard delivers a fearless and intimate performance that oscillates between glamour and grief, comedy and confession.&nbsp;The Waiting is&nbsp;funny, frantic and hauntingly human \\u00bb<\\/p><p>&nbsp;-&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605<i>&nbsp;Binge Fringe Magazine<\\/i><\\/p><p>\\u00ab The Waiting is a hard-hitting exploration of the pervasive exploitation of young girls and women. Peppered with humour and physical comedy, the darker narrative is deftly woven into a broader story of a larger-than-life character laying her soul bare. \\u00bb&nbsp;<\\/p><p>-&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605<i> A shiny life for me<\\/i><\\/p><\\/blockquote> The Waiting  Everything is just un PUTAIN de jeu!Join Maeva, a French posh girl and former supermodel who just ran away from the altar. She bursts in this rustic pub. Waiting. For nothing. She just needs a minute, okay? To think. And remember. Maybe? About her previous life, full of fame, dodgy shrimps and Jean-Paul Gaultier. The good old days, you see?Under layers of Champagne Ros\\u00e9 and glitters, The Waiting is feminist, sarcastic and punchy. We take the time to wait with Maeva, who left a trail of destruction behind her whole life. Have a sit, have a sip while she navigates her mind, and shares hidden memories.Will she ever get her diet Martini?\\u00ab Nina-Lou Bricard delivers a fearless and intimate performance that oscillates between glamour and grief, comedy and confession.\\u00a0The Waiting is\\u00a0funny, frantic and hauntingly human \\u00bb\\u00a0-\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u00a0Binge Fringe Magazine\\u00ab The Waiting is a hard-hitting exploration of the pervasive exploitation of young girls and women. Peppered with humour and physical comedy, the darker narrative is deftly woven into a broader story of a larger-than-life character laying her soul bare. \\u00bb\\u00a0-\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 A shiny life for me Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Ef-bitesize-short-film-festival-2026-day-1\\/\",\"id\":\"3464\",\"name\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 1\",\"title\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 1\",\"duration\":\"105 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787266800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\",\"81000\",\"81022\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/216801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787333400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787266800],\"times\":[1787333400],\"start_date\":\"1787333400\",\"end_date\":\"1787333400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"15\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"SDNzcGpCRTFOTDNxZlBoRFJ1bDdrdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 21 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Bitesize Short Film Fest Opening Night (Presented by The Developing Room)Bitesize 2026 opens with an evening of emotionally charged storytelling, striking&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/2c\\/064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/2c064e2b81b91f61ea30068751ad0bfa.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Bitesize Short Film Fest Opening Night (Presented by The Developing Room)Bitesize 2026 opens with an evening of emotionally charged storytelling, striking visuals and immersive genre filmmaking from emerging voices across the UK and beyond.Day 1 moves between grounded drama, mystery, sci-fi and suspense, balancing intimate human stories with imaginative worlds and cinematic tension. The programme explores identity, connection, resistance and transformation through a carefully curated mix of bold and distinctive short films.Highlights include the dystopian sci-fi drama Paper Tiger and the moving drama Something Pointless, starring BAFTA-winner Owen Teale.From atmospheric thrillers and haunting animation to emotionally resonant character pieces, Opening Night sets the tone for a festival built around discovery, creativity and unforgettable storytelling.Followed by post-screening networking in the cinema bar.\\u00a0Outrun The CloudsDirected by Will KnightUnited Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 11m 55sBurdened by new responsibilities, a young woman fights to escape the grip of her charismatic but controlling boyfriend.\\u00a0Paper TigerDirected by Eden Quine-TaylorUnited Kingdom | Sci-Fi | Runtime: 14m 49sIn the future citizens are forced to consume gene-altering medication as resistance begins to rise.\\u00a0ExpectationDirected by Corin AndersonUnited Kingdom | Animation | Runtime: 2m 51sA moment of intense introspective crisis before the big match.\\u00a0How To Hide ItDirected by Ramla Ali & Richard A. MooreUnited Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 12m 54sA British-Sudanese woman secretly wins the lottery and struggles to hide it from her traditional family.\\u00a0Fine Print PactDirected by Ruben GrayUnited Kingdom | Fantasy\\/Comedy | Runtime: 10m 23sA young woman races to escape a supernatural contract with an eldritch god.\\u00a0QuotaDirected by Cecil DuffyUnited Kingdom | Animation\\/Horror | Runtime: 2m 57sAfter seeing something she shouldn\\u2019t, an office worker spirals into paranoia.\\u00a0Slow-DownDirected by Ornella Hawthorn GardezUnited Kingdom | Suspense\\/Thriller | Runtime: 10m 05sA mother launches into a desperate midnight chase after her daughter is abducted.\\u00a0Something PointlessDirected by Asa BaileyUnited Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 14m 21sA bullied young boy forms an unlikely friendship with an elderly artist.\\u00a0Dear JinjiDirected by Zhou XinyiChina | Mystery\\/Drama | Runtime: 25mAfter her grandmother\\u2019s death, Zhou Qingyu follows a mysterious photograph and forms a tender connection with Jinji.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/216801\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81000\"],\"cinema\":[\"81022\"],\"search\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 1 Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 1 Bitesize  <h3>Bitesize Short Film Fest Opening Night (Presented by The Developing Room)<\\/h3><p><strong>Bitesize 2026<\\/strong> opens with an evening of emotionally charged storytelling, striking visuals and immersive genre filmmaking from emerging voices across the UK and beyond.<\\/p><p>Day 1 moves between grounded drama, mystery, sci-fi and suspense, balancing intimate human stories with imaginative worlds and cinematic tension. The programme explores identity, connection, resistance and transformation through a carefully curated mix of bold and distinctive short films.<\\/p><p>Highlights include the dystopian sci-fi drama <i>Paper Tiger <\\/i>and the moving drama <i>Something Pointless<\\/i>, starring BAFTA-winner Owen Teale.<\\/p><p>From atmospheric thrillers and haunting animation to emotionally resonant character pieces, Opening Night sets the tone for a festival built around discovery, creativity and unforgettable storytelling.<\\/p><p><i><strong>Followed by post-screening networking in the cinema bar.<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Outrun The Clouds<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Will Knight<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 11m 55s<\\/p><p>Burdened by new responsibilities, a young woman fights to escape the grip of her charismatic but controlling boyfriend.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Paper Tiger<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Eden Quine-Taylor<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Sci-Fi | Runtime: 14m 49s<\\/p><p>In the future citizens are forced to consume gene-altering medication as resistance begins to rise.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Expectation<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Corin Anderson<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Animation | Runtime: 2m 51s<\\/p><p>A moment of intense introspective crisis before the big match.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>How To Hide It<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Ramla Ali &amp; Richard A. Moore<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 12m 54s<\\/p><p>A British-Sudanese woman secretly wins the lottery and struggles to hide it from her traditional family.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Fine Print Pact<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Ruben Gray<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Fantasy\\/Comedy | Runtime: 10m 23s<\\/p><p>A young woman races to escape a supernatural contract with an eldritch god.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Quota<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Cecil Duffy<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Animation\\/Horror | Runtime: 2m 57s<\\/p><p>After seeing something she shouldn\\u2019t, an office worker spirals into paranoia.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Slow-Down<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Ornella Hawthorn Gardez<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Suspense\\/Thriller | Runtime: 10m 05s<\\/p><p>A mother launches into a desperate midnight chase after her daughter is abducted.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Something Pointless<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Asa Bailey<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 14m 21s<\\/p><p>A bullied young boy forms an unlikely friendship with an elderly artist.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Dear Jinji<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Zhou Xinyi<\\/p><p>China | Mystery\\/Drama | Runtime: 25m<\\/p><p>After her grandmother\\u2019s death, Zhou Qingyu follows a mysterious photograph and forms a tender connection with Jinji.<\\/p> Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 1  Bitesize Short Film Fest Opening Night (Presented by The Developing Room)Bitesize 2026 opens with an evening of emotionally charged storytelling, striking visuals and immersive genre filmmaking from emerging voices across the UK and beyond.Day 1 moves between grounded drama, mystery, sci-fi and suspense, balancing intimate human stories with imaginative worlds and cinematic tension. The programme explores identity, connection, resistance and transformation through a carefully curated mix of bold and distinctive short films.Highlights include the dystopian sci-fi drama Paper Tiger and the moving drama Something Pointless, starring BAFTA-winner Owen Teale.From atmospheric thrillers and haunting animation to emotionally resonant character pieces, Opening Night sets the tone for a festival built around discovery, creativity and unforgettable storytelling.Followed by post-screening networking in the cinema bar.\\u00a0Outrun The CloudsDirected by Will KnightUnited Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 11m 55sBurdened by new responsibilities, a young woman fights to escape the grip of her charismatic but controlling boyfriend.\\u00a0Paper TigerDirected by Eden Quine-TaylorUnited Kingdom | Sci-Fi | Runtime: 14m 49sIn the future citizens are forced to consume gene-altering medication as resistance begins to rise.\\u00a0ExpectationDirected by Corin AndersonUnited Kingdom | Animation | Runtime: 2m 51sA moment of intense introspective crisis before the big match.\\u00a0How To Hide ItDirected by Ramla Ali & Richard A. MooreUnited Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 12m 54sA British-Sudanese woman secretly wins the lottery and struggles to hide it from her traditional family.\\u00a0Fine Print PactDirected by Ruben GrayUnited Kingdom | Fantasy\\/Comedy | Runtime: 10m 23sA young woman races to escape a supernatural contract with an eldritch god.\\u00a0QuotaDirected by Cecil DuffyUnited Kingdom | Animation\\/Horror | Runtime: 2m 57sAfter seeing something she shouldn\\u2019t, an office worker spirals into paranoia.\\u00a0Slow-DownDirected by Ornella Hawthorn GardezUnited Kingdom | Suspense\\/Thriller | Runtime: 10m 05sA mother launches into a desperate midnight chase after her daughter is abducted.\\u00a0Something PointlessDirected by Asa BaileyUnited Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 14m 21sA bullied young boy forms an unlikely friendship with an elderly artist.\\u00a0Dear JinjiDirected by Zhou XinyiChina | Mystery\\/Drama | Runtime: 25mAfter her grandmother\\u2019s death, Zhou Qingyu follows a mysterious photograph and forms a tender connection with Jinji. Bitesize 15 Bitesize SFF\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/YC-does-my-privilege-look-big-in-this\\/\",\"id\":\"3747\",\"name\":\"Does my privilege look big in this?\",\"title\":\"Does my privilege look big in this?\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787353200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/236601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787418900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787439600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/236801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787505300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787353200,1787439600],\"times\":[1787418900,1787505300],\"start_date\":\"1787418900\",\"end_date\":\"1787505300\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"cDd1cFRDQUJKQ0I4WnJlamVBM1N5UT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 22 - Sun 23 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Jealousy. Obsession. Power. Ambition.How far would you go to hold onto power once you\\u2019ve tasted it?Jess and Millie have lived in Windsor all their lives,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/36\\/ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/36ac0de1c423f30f4d9b6cc60615c3a4.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Jealousy. Obsession. Power. Ambition.How far would you go to hold onto power once you\\u2019ve tasted it?Jess and Millie have lived in Windsor all their lives, partying with the posh boys in the shadow of the infamous Eton College. But this year they will discover the truth about that iconic uniform. And it will turn their worlds upside down.Does my privilege look big in this?, Si\\u00e2n Lawrence\\u2019s incisive new satire, is gruesome, outrageously funny, and offers a scathing critique of the injustices ingrained in Britain\\u2019s education system.Writer: Si\\u00e2n Lawrence\\u00a0Director: Eilidh EvansStage Manager: Ro West\\u00a0Assistant stage manager: Mia BatchelorMarketing manager: Jessica Burgess\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Does my privilege look big in this? Does my privilege look big in this? Bitesize  <p><strong>Jealousy. Obsession. Power. Ambition.<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>How far would you go to hold onto power once you\\u2019ve tasted it?<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Jess and Millie have lived in Windsor all their lives, partying with the posh boys in the shadow of the infamous Eton College. But this year they will discover the truth about that iconic uniform. And it will turn their worlds upside down.<\\/p><p><i>Does my privilege look big in this?, <\\/i>Si\\u00e2n Lawrence\\u2019s incisive new satire, is gruesome, outrageously funny, and offers a scathing critique of the injustices ingrained in Britain\\u2019s education system.<\\/p><p><br>Writer: Si\\u00e2n Lawrence&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Director: Eilidh Evans<\\/p><p>Stage Manager: Ro West&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Assistant stage manager: Mia Batchelor<\\/p><p>Marketing manager: Jessica Burgess&nbsp;<\\/p> Does my privilege look big in this?  Jealousy. Obsession. Power. Ambition.How far would you go to hold onto power once you\\u2019ve tasted it?Jess and Millie have lived in Windsor all their lives, partying with the posh boys in the shadow of the infamous Eton College. But this year they will discover the truth about that iconic uniform. And it will turn their worlds upside down.Does my privilege look big in this?, Si\\u00e2n Lawrence\\u2019s incisive new satire, is gruesome, outrageously funny, and offers a scathing critique of the injustices ingrained in Britain\\u2019s education system.Writer: Si\\u00e2n Lawrence\\u00a0Director: Eilidh EvansStage Manager: Ro West\\u00a0Assistant stage manager: Mia BatchelorMarketing manager: Jessica Burgess\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Ey-bitesize-short-film-festival-2026-day-2\\/\",\"id\":\"3466\",\"name\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 2\",\"title\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 2\",\"duration\":\"102 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787353200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\",\"81000\",\"81022\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/217001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787419800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787353200],\"times\":[1787419800],\"start_date\":\"1787419800\",\"end_date\":\"1787419800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"15\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"ZktnN1pBMm12endBU1Q5SVNRQnAydz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 22 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Day 2 turns up the intensity with Bitesize\\u2019s most unpredictable and genre-blending screening night.Mixing dark comedy, thriller, horror, fantasy and emotionally&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ea\\/b18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/eab18b1165273736d079c36a68b1b325.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Day 2 turns up the intensity with Bitesize\\u2019s most unpredictable and genre-blending screening night.Mixing dark comedy, thriller, horror, fantasy and emotionally charged drama, the evening takes audiences through a cinematic world filled with paranoia, strange encounters, moral dilemmas and moments of unexpected humour.The night opens with the gripping Iranian thriller Nigeria before diving into occult bureaucracy, countryside horror, psychological tension and explosive comedy. Highlights include the award-winning filmmaking team behind Spoken In Plain Sight, returning to Bitesize with a stylish noir mystery set in London\\u2019s criminal underworld.Alongside the tension and chaos, Day 2 also delivers deeply human stories exploring grief, identity, resilience and family, creating a screening that is both entertaining and emotionally rich.Bold, strange, funny and full of energy, Day 2 captures the adventurous spirit of independent cinema at its best.\\u00a0NigeriaDirected by Samiye TaheriIran | Thriller | Runtime: 17mAfter a hit-and-run, two young delinquents are confronted by a mysterious armed stranger demanding blackmail money.\\u00a0Spoken In Plain SightDirected by Ilya Wray & Ariel De La Garza DavidoffUnited Kingdom | Mystery\\/Noir | Runtime: 11mAfter a young woman disappears, two detectives uncover a conspiracy tied to her secret double life.\\u00a0EdenDirected by Ed LockleyUnited Kingdom | Action | Runtime: 3m 45sBased on artwork by Jakub Rosalski, this film blends war-time machinery with pastoral contemporary life.\\u00a0DriftDirected by Samuel Joseph Cheshire & Benedict HutchinsonUnited Kingdom | Horror | Runtime: 5m 44sA countryside walk takes a sinister turn when an orange balloon reveals a mind of its own.\\u00a0Face To FaceDirected by Danny JeffsUnited Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 13m 43sThree siblings come face to face with the man who killed their mother.\\u00a0PanspermiaDirected by Moses SsebandekeUnited Kingdom | Sci-Fi | Runtime: 12mA microbiologist alone in orbit begins to question his mission after receiving unsettling messages from Earth.\\u00a0The Last BreathDirected by Octavio Maya RochaMexico | Drama | Runtime: 16m 40sA poetic journey through the medical afterlife exploring heroism, morality and despair.\\u00a0Nervous EllieDirected by David YorkeUnited Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 6m 40sA painfully shy young woman struggles to survive an increasingly awkward first date.\\u00a0The Last DanceDirected by Hayden McleanUnited Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 16m 39sAs a beloved Caribbean bar faces closure, one final night celebrates memory, music and community.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/217001\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81000\"],\"cinema\":[\"81022\"],\"search\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 2 Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 2 Bitesize  <p>Day 2 turns up the intensity with Bitesize\\u2019s most unpredictable and genre-blending screening night.<\\/p><p>Mixing dark comedy, thriller, horror, fantasy and emotionally charged drama, the evening takes audiences through a cinematic world filled with paranoia, strange encounters, moral dilemmas and moments of unexpected humour.<\\/p><p>The night opens with the gripping Iranian thriller <i>Nigeria <\\/i>before diving into occult bureaucracy, countryside horror, psychological tension and explosive comedy. Highlights include the award-winning filmmaking team behind <i>Spoken In Plain Sight<\\/i>, returning to Bitesize with a stylish noir mystery set in London\\u2019s criminal underworld.<\\/p><p>Alongside the tension and chaos, Day 2 also delivers deeply human stories exploring grief, identity, resilience and family, creating a screening that is both entertaining and emotionally rich.<\\/p><p>Bold, strange, funny and full of energy, Day 2 captures the adventurous spirit of independent cinema at its best.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Nigeria<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Samiye Taheri<\\/p><p>Iran | Thriller | Runtime: 17m<\\/p><p>After a hit-and-run, two young delinquents are confronted by a mysterious armed stranger demanding blackmail money.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Spoken In Plain Sight<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Ilya Wray &amp; Ariel De La Garza Davidoff<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Mystery\\/Noir | Runtime: 11m<\\/p><p>After a young woman disappears, two detectives uncover a conspiracy tied to her secret double life.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Eden<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Ed Lockley<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Action | Runtime: 3m 45s<\\/p><p>Based on artwork by Jakub Rosalski, this film blends war-time machinery with pastoral contemporary life.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Drift<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Samuel Joseph Cheshire &amp; Benedict Hutchinson<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Horror | Runtime: 5m 44s<\\/p><p>A countryside walk takes a sinister turn when an orange balloon reveals a mind of its own.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Face To Face<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Danny Jeffs<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 13m 43s<\\/p><p>Three siblings come face to face with the man who killed their mother.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Panspermia<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Moses Ssebandeke<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Sci-Fi | Runtime: 12m<\\/p><p>A microbiologist alone in orbit begins to question his mission after receiving unsettling messages from Earth.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>The Last Breath<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Octavio Maya Rocha<\\/p><p>Mexico | Drama | Runtime: 16m 40s<\\/p><p>A poetic journey through the medical afterlife exploring heroism, morality and despair.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Nervous Ellie<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by David Yorke<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 6m 40s<\\/p><p>A painfully shy young woman struggles to survive an increasingly awkward first date.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>The Last Dance<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Hayden Mclean<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 16m 39s<\\/p><p>As a beloved Caribbean bar faces closure, one final night celebrates memory, music and community.<\\/p> Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 2  Day 2 turns up the intensity with Bitesize\\u2019s most unpredictable and genre-blending screening night.Mixing dark comedy, thriller, horror, fantasy and emotionally charged drama, the evening takes audiences through a cinematic world filled with paranoia, strange encounters, moral dilemmas and moments of unexpected humour.The night opens with the gripping Iranian thriller Nigeria before diving into occult bureaucracy, countryside horror, psychological tension and explosive comedy. Highlights include the award-winning filmmaking team behind Spoken In Plain Sight, returning to Bitesize with a stylish noir mystery set in London\\u2019s criminal underworld.Alongside the tension and chaos, Day 2 also delivers deeply human stories exploring grief, identity, resilience and family, creating a screening that is both entertaining and emotionally rich.Bold, strange, funny and full of energy, Day 2 captures the adventurous spirit of independent cinema at its best.\\u00a0NigeriaDirected by Samiye TaheriIran | Thriller | Runtime: 17mAfter a hit-and-run, two young delinquents are confronted by a mysterious armed stranger demanding blackmail money.\\u00a0Spoken In Plain SightDirected by Ilya Wray & Ariel De La Garza DavidoffUnited Kingdom | Mystery\\/Noir | Runtime: 11mAfter a young woman disappears, two detectives uncover a conspiracy tied to her secret double life.\\u00a0EdenDirected by Ed LockleyUnited Kingdom | Action | Runtime: 3m 45sBased on artwork by Jakub Rosalski, this film blends war-time machinery with pastoral contemporary life.\\u00a0DriftDirected by Samuel Joseph Cheshire & Benedict HutchinsonUnited Kingdom | Horror | Runtime: 5m 44sA countryside walk takes a sinister turn when an orange balloon reveals a mind of its own.\\u00a0Face To FaceDirected by Danny JeffsUnited Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 13m 43sThree siblings come face to face with the man who killed their mother.\\u00a0PanspermiaDirected by Moses SsebandekeUnited Kingdom | Sci-Fi | Runtime: 12mA microbiologist alone in orbit begins to question his mission after receiving unsettling messages from Earth.\\u00a0The Last BreathDirected by Octavio Maya RochaMexico | Drama | Runtime: 16m 40sA poetic journey through the medical afterlife exploring heroism, morality and despair.\\u00a0Nervous EllieDirected by David YorkeUnited Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 6m 40sA painfully shy young woman struggles to survive an increasingly awkward first date.\\u00a0The Last DanceDirected by Hayden McleanUnited Kingdom | Drama | Runtime: 16m 39sAs a beloved Caribbean bar faces closure, one final night celebrates memory, music and community. Bitesize 15 Bitesize SFF\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/ED-bitesize-short-film-festival-2026-day-3\\/\",\"id\":\"3468\",\"name\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 3\",\"title\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 3\",\"duration\":\"88 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787439600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\",\"81000\",\"81022\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/216802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787506200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787439600],\"times\":[1787506200],\"start_date\":\"1787506200\",\"end_date\":\"1787506200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"15\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"UURCNlgxazhkMm51anh3TmlzTUdHUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 23 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival Closing NightBitesize 2026 closes with a vibrant final night of bold storytelling, striking visuals and unforgettable cinema&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/9d\\/1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9d1e08cd4d85be8d8bce7d65f474660d.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival Closing NightBitesize 2026 closes with a vibrant final night of bold storytelling, striking visuals and unforgettable cinema from across the world.Blending fantasy, drama, animation and imaginative genre filmmaking, Day 3 celebrates the creativity and ambition of independent short film through a programme filled with cinematic energy, emotional depth and visually distinctive storytelling.Highlights include the atmospheric French drama Asphalt and the visually daring fantasy-thriller Baiser Baiser. The evening also features imaginative animated works including Simulacrum alongside the fantasy tale Among The Beasts.From intimate human stories to visually inventive worlds, Closing Night brings together films that are thought-provoking, entertaining and emotionally engaging, creating the perfect finale to this year\\u2019s festival.A cinematic final chapter celebrating emerging filmmakers and the power of short-form storytelling.\\u00a0Rabbit\\u2019s FootDirected by Austen Taylor PeaseUnited Kingdom | Crime\\/Drama | Runtime: 7m 24sAfter a robbery gone wrong, two brothers hide out in the countryside where tension and buried desires begin to tear them apart.\\u00a0The Ninth CycleDirected by Samiye TaheriIran | Drama | Runtime: 12m 27sOn a remote cattle farm, Delvin fights to save her shattered family after tragedy drives her mother into madness.\\u00a0Loud And ProudDirected by Eliana AnselmoUnited Kingdom | Animation | Runtime: 2m 20sA young volleyball player reveals how her toughest opponent isn\\u2019t on the court, but her overbearing mother.\\u00a0Easy SellDirected by Ken Abalos & Ash MeshkatiUnited Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 7m 10sA bargain hunter gets more than he bargained for when a charity shop worker pressures him to buy a mysterious wedding dress.\\u00a0BluffDirected by Naomi WrightUnited Kingdom | Thriller | Runtime: 9m 47sA visually impaired girl hides her worsening sight to protect a long-awaited family holiday.\\u00a0AsphaltDirected by Lara Cl\\u00e9retFrance | Drama | Runtime: 17m 42sReturning to her childhood home, Romy is haunted by memories of one unforgettable summer.\\u00a0SimulacrumDirected by Diogo De Nazareth FernandesUnited Kingdom | Animation\\/Sci-Fi | Runtime: 2m 25sWhen you create new life, does that life become more real than you?\\u00a0Baiser BaiserDirected by Lara LoungeUnited States | Drama\\/Fantasy | Runtime: 14m 18sA rising artist is pulled into her own painting in this surreal 16mm descent into identity and obsession.\\u00a0Among The BeastsDirected by Luchino PaparellaBelgium | Fantasy | Runtime: 14m 44sOn a stormy night, Alix encounters a mysterious creature hunted by their village, forming a bond that changes everything.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/216802\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81000\"],\"cinema\":[\"81022\"],\"search\":\"Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 3 Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 3 Bitesize  <h3>Bitesize Short Film Festival Closing Night<\\/h3><p>Bitesize 2026 closes with a vibrant final night of bold storytelling, striking visuals and unforgettable cinema from across the world.<\\/p><p>Blending fantasy, drama, animation and imaginative genre filmmaking, Day 3 celebrates the creativity and ambition of independent short film through a programme filled with cinematic energy, emotional depth and visually distinctive storytelling.<\\/p><p>Highlights include the atmospheric French drama <i>Asphalt <\\/i>and the visually daring fantasy-thriller <i>Baiser Baiser<\\/i>. The evening also features imaginative animated works including <i>Simulacrum<\\/i> alongside the fantasy tale <i>Among The Beasts<\\/i>.<\\/p><p>From intimate human stories to visually inventive worlds, Closing Night brings together films that are thought-provoking, entertaining and emotionally engaging, creating the perfect finale to this year\\u2019s festival.<\\/p><p>A cinematic final chapter celebrating emerging filmmakers and the power of short-form storytelling.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Rabbit\\u2019s Foot<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Austen Taylor Pease<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Crime\\/Drama | Runtime: 7m 24s<\\/p><p>After a robbery gone wrong, two brothers hide out in the countryside where tension and buried desires begin to tear them apart.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>The Ninth Cycle<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Samiye Taheri<\\/p><p>Iran | Drama | Runtime: 12m 27s<\\/p><p>On a remote cattle farm, Delvin fights to save her shattered family after tragedy drives her mother into madness.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Loud And Proud<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Eliana Anselmo<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Animation | Runtime: 2m 20s<\\/p><p>A young volleyball player reveals how her toughest opponent isn\\u2019t on the court, but her overbearing mother.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Easy Sell<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Ken Abalos &amp; Ash Meshkati<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 7m 10s<\\/p><p>A bargain hunter gets more than he bargained for when a charity shop worker pressures him to buy a mysterious wedding dress.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Bluff<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Naomi Wright<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Thriller | Runtime: 9m 47s<\\/p><p>A visually impaired girl hides her worsening sight to protect a long-awaited family holiday.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Asphalt<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Lara Cl\\u00e9ret<\\/p><p>France | Drama | Runtime: 17m 42s<\\/p><p>Returning to her childhood home, Romy is haunted by memories of one unforgettable summer.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Simulacrum<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Diogo De Nazareth Fernandes<\\/p><p>United Kingdom | Animation\\/Sci-Fi | Runtime: 2m 25s<\\/p><p>When you create new life, does that life become more real than you?<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Baiser Baiser<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Lara Lounge<\\/p><p>United States | Drama\\/Fantasy | Runtime: 14m 18s<\\/p><p>A rising artist is pulled into her own painting in this surreal 16mm descent into identity and obsession.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Among The Beasts<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Directed by Luchino Paparella<\\/p><p>Belgium | Fantasy | Runtime: 14m 44s<\\/p><p>On a stormy night, Alix encounters a mysterious creature hunted by their village, forming a bond that changes everything.<\\/p> Bitesize Short Film Festival 2026 - Day 3  Bitesize Short Film Festival Closing NightBitesize 2026 closes with a vibrant final night of bold storytelling, striking visuals and unforgettable cinema from across the world.Blending fantasy, drama, animation and imaginative genre filmmaking, Day 3 celebrates the creativity and ambition of independent short film through a programme filled with cinematic energy, emotional depth and visually distinctive storytelling.Highlights include the atmospheric French drama Asphalt and the visually daring fantasy-thriller Baiser Baiser. The evening also features imaginative animated works including Simulacrum alongside the fantasy tale Among The Beasts.From intimate human stories to visually inventive worlds, Closing Night brings together films that are thought-provoking, entertaining and emotionally engaging, creating the perfect finale to this year\\u2019s festival.A cinematic final chapter celebrating emerging filmmakers and the power of short-form storytelling.\\u00a0Rabbit\\u2019s FootDirected by Austen Taylor PeaseUnited Kingdom | Crime\\/Drama | Runtime: 7m 24sAfter a robbery gone wrong, two brothers hide out in the countryside where tension and buried desires begin to tear them apart.\\u00a0The Ninth CycleDirected by Samiye TaheriIran | Drama | Runtime: 12m 27sOn a remote cattle farm, Delvin fights to save her shattered family after tragedy drives her mother into madness.\\u00a0Loud And ProudDirected by Eliana AnselmoUnited Kingdom | Animation | Runtime: 2m 20sA young volleyball player reveals how her toughest opponent isn\\u2019t on the court, but her overbearing mother.\\u00a0Easy SellDirected by Ken Abalos & Ash MeshkatiUnited Kingdom | Comedy | Runtime: 7m 10sA bargain hunter gets more than he bargained for when a charity shop worker pressures him to buy a mysterious wedding dress.\\u00a0BluffDirected by Naomi WrightUnited Kingdom | Thriller | Runtime: 9m 47sA visually impaired girl hides her worsening sight to protect a long-awaited family holiday.\\u00a0AsphaltDirected by Lara Cl\\u00e9retFrance | Drama | Runtime: 17m 42sReturning to her childhood home, Romy is haunted by memories of one unforgettable summer.\\u00a0SimulacrumDirected by Diogo De Nazareth FernandesUnited Kingdom | Animation\\/Sci-Fi | Runtime: 2m 25sWhen you create new life, does that life become more real than you?\\u00a0Baiser BaiserDirected by Lara LoungeUnited States | Drama\\/Fantasy | Runtime: 14m 18sA rising artist is pulled into her own painting in this surreal 16mm descent into identity and obsession.\\u00a0Among The BeastsDirected by Luchino PaparellaBelgium | Fantasy | Runtime: 14m 44sOn a stormy night, Alix encounters a mysterious creature hunted by their village, forming a bond that changes everything. Bitesize 15 Bitesize SFF\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/fC-the-saboteur\\/\",\"id\":\"3375\",\"name\":\"The Saboteur\",\"title\":\"The Saboteur\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787526000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/213202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787594400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787612400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/213203\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787680800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787526000,1787612400],\"times\":[1787594400,1787680800],\"start_date\":\"1787594400\",\"end_date\":\"1787680800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"Nmw5VWhhL2FmT09NOG9KTjJ3NUlXdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Mon 24 - Tue 25 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Five performers are all working hard to put on a good improv show. Well, almost all of them. One of them is trying to sabotage the show without getting&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/26\\/22a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx335\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/2622a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/26\\/22a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx335\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/2622a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudi