74\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/2622a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/26\\/22a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx335\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/2622a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/26\\/22a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx335\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/2622a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/26\\/22a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx335\\/cw674\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/2622a4b4595df0633185481763e6579e.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50.9\",\"45.7\"],\"search_text\":\"Five performers are all working hard to put on a good improv show. Well, almost all of them. One of them is trying to sabotage the show without getting caught. Will The Saboteur be unmasked before the evening is ruined?It\\u2019s a reality television show on stage, for fans of The Traitors and Whose Line alike. It\\u2019s devious. It\\u2019s hilarious. It\\u2019s thrilling. It\\u2019s The Saboteur. Good luck.Fresh from hit seasons in San Francisco, Australia and New Zealand, join us for a high-stakes, interactive evening of subterfuge, treachery, backstabbing, and laughs!\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"The Saboteur The Saboteur Bitesize  <p>Five performers are all working hard to put on a good improv show. Well, almost all of them. One of them is trying to sabotage the show without getting caught. Will The Saboteur be unmasked before the evening is ruined?<\\/p><p>It\\u2019s a reality television show on stage, for fans of <i>The Traitors<\\/i> and <i>Whose Line<\\/i> alike. It\\u2019s devious. It\\u2019s hilarious. It\\u2019s thrilling. It\\u2019s <i><strong>The Saboteur<\\/strong><\\/i>. Good luck.<\\/p><p>Fresh from hit seasons in San Francisco, Australia and New Zealand, join us for a high-stakes, interactive evening of subterfuge, treachery, backstabbing, and laughs!<\\/p> The Saboteur  Five performers are all working hard to put on a good improv show. Well, almost all of them. One of them is trying to sabotage the show without getting caught. Will The Saboteur be unmasked before the evening is ruined?It\\u2019s a reality television show on stage, for fans of The Traitors and Whose Line alike. It\\u2019s devious. It\\u2019s hilarious. It\\u2019s thrilling. It\\u2019s The Saboteur. Good luck.Fresh from hit seasons in San Francisco, Australia and New Zealand, join us for a high-stakes, interactive evening of subterfuge, treachery, backstabbing, and laughs! Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/De-panto-dame-ego-death\\/\",\"id\":\"3644\",\"name\":\"Panto Dame Ego Death\",\"title\":\"Panto Dame Ego Death\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787526000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/230601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787594400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787698800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/230801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787749200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/231001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787773500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787526000,1787698800,1787698800],\"times\":[1787594400,1787749200,1787773500],\"start_date\":\"1787594400\",\"end_date\":\"1787773500\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"cWh5dUJxWm9JbC92ZWRWOFB1dHBidz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Mon 24 - Wed 26 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"A Pantomime Dame wakes up in a bizarre world filled with real panto characters and sets out on a deadly quest.&nbsp;Winner of the Buzz Goodbody Director\\u2019s&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1e\\/9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/1e9fa4d802ec9e6ef8dd0a6f395be1b5.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"A Pantomime Dame wakes up in a bizarre world filled with real panto characters and sets out on a deadly quest.\\u00a0Winner of the Buzz Goodbody Director\\u2019s Award 2025, Panto Dame Ego Death is a slap-dash musical comedy about staring failure in the face and belting out that show-stopping number anyway.\\u00a0Four performers and a workhorse piano tell the story of Denise, a washed-up Pantomime Dame who is transported to a strange other world after choking on stage.\\u00a0On a mission to return home and save her career, can Denise and a crew of nonsense panto-land characters uncover the scary (and sexy) evil plaguing this world?Bold, queer, and unashamedly silly, Panto Dame Ego Death is the tale of hitting rock bottom and clawing your way back just in time for the curtain call.\\u00a0Shortlisted for the Charlie Hartill Award 2026, this absurd adventure is the debut production of North-West based devising company Pint Glass Theatre.\\u00a0\\u201cDrag Into the Woods, but like if an improv comedy group wrote it in one very inebriated night.\\u201d\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Panto Dame Ego Death Panto Dame Ego Death Bitesize  <p>A Pantomime Dame wakes up in a bizarre world filled with real panto characters and sets out on a deadly quest.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Winner of the Buzz Goodbody Director\\u2019s Award 2025, <i><strong>Panto Dame Ego Death<\\/strong><\\/i> is a slap-dash musical comedy about staring failure in the face and belting out that show-stopping number anyway.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Four performers and a workhorse piano tell the story of Denise, a washed-up Pantomime Dame who is transported to a strange other world after choking on stage.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;On a mission to return home and save her career, can Denise and a crew of nonsense panto-land characters uncover the scary (and sexy) evil plaguing this world?<\\/p><p>Bold, queer, and unashamedly silly, <i>Panto Dame Ego Death<\\/i> is the tale of hitting rock bottom and clawing your way back just in time for the curtain call.<\\/p><p><strong>&nbsp;Shortlisted for the Charlie Hartill Award 2026<\\/strong>, this absurd adventure is the debut production of North-West based devising company Pint Glass Theatre.<\\/p><blockquote><p><strong>&nbsp;\\u201cDrag Into the Woods, but like if an improv comedy group wrote it in one very inebriated night.\\u201d&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><\\/blockquote> Panto Dame Ego Death  A Pantomime Dame wakes up in a bizarre world filled with real panto characters and sets out on a deadly quest.\\u00a0Winner of the Buzz Goodbody Director\\u2019s Award 2025, Panto Dame Ego Death is a slap-dash musical comedy about staring failure in the face and belting out that show-stopping number anyway.\\u00a0Four performers and a workhorse piano tell the story of Denise, a washed-up Pantomime Dame who is transported to a strange other world after choking on stage.\\u00a0On a mission to return home and save her career, can Denise and a crew of nonsense panto-land characters uncover the scary (and sexy) evil plaguing this world?Bold, queer, and unashamedly silly, Panto Dame Ego Death is the tale of hitting rock bottom and clawing your way back just in time for the curtain call.\\u00a0Shortlisted for the Charlie Hartill Award 2026, this absurd adventure is the debut production of North-West based devising company Pint Glass Theatre.\\u00a0\\u201cDrag Into the Woods, but like if an improv comedy group wrote it in one very inebriated night.\\u201d\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/E0-la-baby\\/\",\"id\":\"3454\",\"name\":\"L.A Baby\",\"title\":\"L.A Baby\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787612400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/214201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787680800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787698800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/214202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787767200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787785200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/214203\\/\\\">\\n   \\