stom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w2726\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e2\\/917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5\\/w2726\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx979\\/cy18\\/cw851\\/ch849\\/images\\/uploads\\/e2917a76c5649bae43541bfe6d25cac5.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"52.4\",\"32.0\"],\"search_text\":\"The unbelievable truth of nearly a decade in L.A from award-winning actor and comedian Ambrosine Davies (Funny or Die, The Inbetweeners) L.A Baby is the darkly comedic story of Davies\\u2019 nine years in L.A, caught in a cycle of cringeworthy auditions, balancing odd jobs and working as a nanny for an Orthodox family in the middle of the world\\u2019s most expensive divorce. Soon swapping comedy aspirations for hard won survival skills, Davies\\u2019 relationship at home escalates from toxic to terrifying. When stalking, death threats and the prospect of carrying a gun to school pick-ups become her only viable option, Davies realises her American Dream has become a life-threatening nightmare.\\\"A highly talented performer. The writing achieves a nice balance of comically quirky edginess.\\\" - The TimesAn excellent one woman show - BBC Radio\\\"Intimate, raw honesty, you can't help but laugh along, even as you wince.\\\" \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - One4Review\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Derek Awards\\u201cBrave, direct and powerful\\u201d - The Scotsman\\u201cA powerful tale\\u201d \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - The List\\u201cDark and punchy\\u2026cleverly written, devastatingly honest and told with heart\\u201d \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Edinburgh Guide\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"L.A Baby L.A Baby Bitesize  <p>The unbelievable truth of nearly a decade in L.A from award-winning actor and comedian Ambrosine Davies (<i>Funny or Die<\\/i>, <i>The Inbetweeners<\\/i>)<i><strong> L.A Baby<\\/strong><\\/i> is the darkly comedic story of Davies\\u2019 nine years in L.A, caught in a cycle of cringeworthy auditions, balancing odd jobs and working as a nanny for an Orthodox family in the middle of the world\\u2019s most expensive divorce. Soon swapping comedy aspirations for hard won survival skills, Davies\\u2019 relationship at home escalates from toxic to terrifying. When stalking, death threats and the prospect of carrying a gun to school pick-ups become her only viable option, Davies realises her American Dream has become a life-threatening nightmare.<\\/p><p><strong>\\\"A highly talented performer. The writing achieves a nice balance of comically quirky edginess.\\\" - The Times<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>An excellent one woman show - BBC Radio<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>\\\"Intimate, raw honesty, you can't help but laugh along, even as you wince.\\\" \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - One4Review<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Derek Awards<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>\\u201cBrave, direct and powerful\\u201d - The Scotsman<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>\\u201cA powerful tale\\u201d \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - The List<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>\\u201cDark and punchy\\u2026cleverly written, devastatingly honest and told with heart\\u201d \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Edinburgh Guide<\\/strong><\\/p> L.A Baby  The unbelievable truth of nearly a decade in L.A from award-winning actor and comedian Ambrosine Davies (Funny or Die, The Inbetweeners) L.A Baby is the darkly comedic story of Davies\\u2019 nine years in L.A, caught in a cycle of cringeworthy auditions, balancing odd jobs and working as a nanny for an Orthodox family in the middle of the world\\u2019s most expensive divorce. Soon swapping comedy aspirations for hard won survival skills, Davies\\u2019 relationship at home escalates from toxic to terrifying. When stalking, death threats and the prospect of carrying a gun to school pick-ups become her only viable option, Davies realises her American Dream has become a life-threatening nightmare.\\\"A highly talented performer. The writing achieves a nice balance of comically quirky edginess.\\\" - The TimesAn excellent one woman show - BBC Radio\\\"Intimate, raw honesty, you can't help but laugh along, even as you wince.\\\" \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - One4Review\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Derek Awards\\u201cBrave, direct and powerful\\u201d - The Scotsman\\u201cA powerful tale\\u201d \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - The List\\u201cDark and punchy\\u2026cleverly written, devastatingly honest and told with heart\\u201d \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 - Edinburgh Guide Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/o8-the-rise-of-josephine-baker\\/\",\"id\":\"3566\",\"name\":\"The Rise of Josephine Baker\",\"title\":\"The Rise of Josephine Baker\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787612400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/221201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787687100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787785200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/221202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787859900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787871600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/221401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787926500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1787958000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/221002\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788028200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787612400,1787785200,1787871600,1787958000],\"times\":[1787687100,1787859900,1787926500,1788028200],\"start_date\":\"1787687100\",\"end_date\":\"1788028200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"UnlteGlRdHlHR3ZtVmNSckhHTFBEUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 25 - Sat 29 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Set in 1920s Paris,&nbsp;The Rise of Josephine Baker&nbsp;follows African American performer&nbsp;Josephine Baker&nbsp;as she escapes segregation-era&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w2808\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/8fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e\\/w2808\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/308fac58f5e122773c0eadc2373b0d6e.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"38.4\",\"16.6\"],\"search_text\":\"Set in 1920s Paris,\\u00a0The Rise of Josephine Baker\\u00a0follows African American performer\\u00a0Josephine Baker\\u00a0as she escapes segregation-era America to become an international sensation. Arriving in Paris\\u2019 dazzling Jazz Age, she prepares for her breakthrough in\\u00a0La Revue N\\u00e8gre,\\u00a0a sensational production which ignited controversy and propelled her to fame across Europe.\\u00a0Frequently painted by\\u00a0French artist Paul Colin, the play examines their relationship and how his work, inspired by Cubism and Art Deco, became a vehicle for Josephine\\u2019s image to be projected across the world.\\u00a0Marking 100 years since her iconic Banana Skirt Dance, the show revisits a performance both celebrated and contested, prompting reflections on race and desire.Rooted in archival research from the New York Public Library for the Performing Arts, The Rise of Josephine Baker\\u00a0captures life at the threshold of international stardom during the era of\\u00a0Le Tumulte Noir - The Black Craze.\\u00a0\\u200bWith ambition, romance, and hedonism abound -\\u00a0Paris awaits darling\\u2026\\u00a0Written and performed by Shani Gray, presented by Gray Stripe Productions.\\u00a0\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"The Rise of Josephine Baker The Rise of Josephine Baker Bitesize  <p>Set in 1920s Paris,&nbsp;<i>The Rise of Josephine Baker<\\/i>&nbsp;follows African American performer&nbsp;Josephine Baker&nbsp;as she escapes segregation-era America to become an international sensation. Arriving in Paris\\u2019 dazzling Jazz Age, she prepares for her breakthrough in&nbsp;La Revue N\\u00e8gre<i>,<\\/i>&nbsp;a sensational production which ignited controversy and propelled her to fame across Europe.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Frequently painted by&nbsp;French artist Paul Colin, the play examines their relationship and how his work, inspired by Cubism and Art Deco, became a vehicle for Josephine\\u2019s image to be projected across the world.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Marking 100 years since her iconic Banana Skirt Dance, the show revisits a performance both celebrated and contested, prompting reflections on race and desire.<\\/p><p>Rooted in archival research from the New York Public Library for the Performing Arts, <i>The Rise of Josephine Baker<\\/i>&nbsp;captures life at the threshold of international stardom during the era of&nbsp;Le Tumulte Noir - The Black Craze<i>.<\\/i><br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>\\u200b<\\/i>With ambition, romance, and hedonism abound -&nbsp;Paris awaits darling\\u2026<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Written and performed by Shani Gray, presented by Gray Stripe Productions.&nbsp;<\\/strong><br>&nbsp;<\\/p> The Rise of Josephine Baker  Set in 1920s Paris,\\u00a0The Rise of Josephine Baker\\u00a0follows African American performer\\u00a0Josephine Baker\\u00a0as she escapes segregation-era America to become an international sensation. Arriving in Paris\\u2019 dazzling Jazz Age, she prepares for her breakthrough in\\u00a0La Revue N\\u00e8gre,\\u00a0a sensational production which ignited controversy and propelled her to fame across Europe.\\u00a0Frequently painted by\\u00a0French artist Paul Colin, the play examines their relationship and how his work, inspired by Cubism and Art Deco, became a vehicle for Josephine\\u2019s image to be projected across the world.\\u00a0Marking 100 years since her iconic Banana Skirt Dance, the show revisits a performance both celebrated and contested, prompting reflections on race and desire.Rooted in archival research from the New York Public Library for the Performing Arts, The Rise of Josephine Baker\\u00a0captures life at the threshold of international stardom during the era of\\u00a0Le Tumulte Noir - The Black Craze.\\u00a0\\u200bWith ambition, romance, and hedonism abound -\\u00a0Paris awaits darling\\u2026\\u00a0Written and performed by Shani Gray, presented by Gray Stripe Productions.\\u00a0\\u00a0 Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Es-baby-steps\\/\",\"id\":\"3444\",\"name\":\"Baby Steps\",\"title\":\"Baby Steps\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787698800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"p