na is trying to decide whether she wants children or not. The only problem is, she\\u2019s currently in labour.Twenty-something years old, spiralling,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/d7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/3ed7d7ce5e9d6f8d6eee0ed8b4211ed0.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Georgina is trying to decide whether she wants children or not. The only problem is, she\\u2019s currently in labour.Twenty-something years old, spiralling, alone, Georgina travels from London to her hometown hospital with the notion of getting her no-nonsense, midwife ex-best friend, Molly, to deliver her baby. Between contractions, Molly and Georgina dive head first into quarter life existential crises.Meanwhile, we take you on a crash course covering 400 years of the history of midwives. From the witch hunts to forceps, this comic yet disturbing story reveals how midwives have been pushed aside for men to show them how it\\u2019s (not) done.Grounded in Georgina and Molly\\u2019s rekindled friendship, Baby Steps is a heart-warming, pressure-cooker comedy about the impossible tangle of life-decisions facing young women right now.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Baby Steps Baby Steps Bitesize  <p>Georgina is trying to decide whether she wants children or not. The only problem is, she\\u2019s currently in labour.<\\/p><p>Twenty-something years old, spiralling, alone, Georgina travels from London to her hometown hospital with the notion of getting her no-nonsense, midwife ex-best friend, Molly, to deliver her baby. Between contractions, Molly and Georgina dive head first into quarter life existential crises.<\\/p><p>Meanwhile, we take you on a crash course covering 400 years of the history of midwives. From the witch hunts to forceps, this comic yet disturbing story reveals how midwives have been pushed aside for men to show them how it\\u2019s (not) done.<\\/p><p>Grounded in Georgina and Molly\\u2019s rekindled friendship, <i><strong>Baby Steps<\\/strong><\\/i> is a heart-warming, pressure-cooker comedy about the impossible tangle of life-decisions facing young women right now.<\\/p> Baby Steps  Georgina is trying to decide whether she wants children or not. The only problem is, she\\u2019s currently in labour.Twenty-something years old, spiralling, alone, Georgina travels from London to her hometown hospital with the notion of getting her no-nonsense, midwife ex-best friend, Molly, to deliver her baby. Between contractions, Molly and Georgina dive head first into quarter life existential crises.Meanwhile, we take you on a crash course covering 400 years of the history of midwives. From the witch hunts to forceps, this comic yet disturbing story reveals how midwives have been pushed aside for men to show them how it\\u2019s (not) done.Grounded in Georgina and Molly\\u2019s rekindled friendship, Baby Steps is a heart-warming, pressure-cooker comedy about the impossible tangle of life-decisions facing young women right now. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/oO-playing-the-feeld\\/\",\"id\":\"3546\",\"name\":\"Playing the Feeld\",\"title\":\"Playing the Feeld\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"pe