 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/5016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/685016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/5016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/685016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/5016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/685016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/5016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/685016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/5016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/685016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/5016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/images\\/uploads\\/685016e4dac9927b69133d0b6f2a66cf.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Playing the Feeld is a raucous comedy about sex, dating, and the things we do in search of connection.\\u00a0Newly single, Emily throws herself into the world of Feeld, collecting stories, surprises, and the occasional emotional bruise. As one date blurs into the next, she discovers that finding what turns you on\\/off is often easier than figuring out what you actually want.Silly, sexy, and startlingly honest,Playing the Feeld is a celebration of desire in all its messy glory.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"Playing the Feeld Playing the Feeld Bitesize  <p><strong>Playing the Feeld <\\/strong>is a raucous comedy about sex, dating, and the things we do in search of connection.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Newly single, Emily throws herself into the world of Feeld, collecting stories, surprises, and the occasional emotional bruise. As one date blurs into the next, she discovers that finding what turns you on\\/off is often easier than figuring out what you actually want.<\\/p><p>Silly, sexy, and startlingly honest,<i>Playing the Feeld <\\/i>is a celebration of desire in all its messy glory.<\\/p> Playing the Feeld  Playing the Feeld is a raucous comedy about sex, dating, and the things we do in search of connection.\\u00a0Newly single, Emily throws herself into the world of Feeld, collecting stories, surprises, and the occasional emotional bruise. As one date blurs into the next, she discovers that finding what turns you on\\/off is often easier than figuring out what you actually want.Silly, sexy, and startlingly honest,Playing the Feeld is a celebration of desire in all its messy glory. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/yL-the-great-divinator-touched-by-spirits\\/\",\"id\":\"3480\",\"name\":\"The Great Divinator: Touched by Spirits\",\"title\":\"The Great Divinator: Touched by Spirits\",\"duration\":\"55 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787871600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1787946300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787871600],\"times\":[1787946300],\"start_date\":\"1787946300\",\"end_date\":\"1787946300\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"OTB1ZlBWSjk1cHlNRmVMWlIxVld2UT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 28 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"Fake Moustache! Real Mindreading!Celebrated 19th century spirit medium The Great Divinator returns to the stage following a career break of 106 years...Vintage&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/