/images\\/uploads\\/4ac05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/c05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/4ac05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/c05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/4ac05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/c05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/4ac05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/c05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/4ac05362453ab1927d882188c0cd9e91.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Fake Moustache! Real Mindreading!Celebrated 19th century spirit medium The Great Divinator returns to the stage following a career break of 106 years...Vintage mind reading and outrageous audience participation in this unique evening of comedy Victorian seance and spooky paranormal happenings from multi award-winner and member of the Magic Circle Katie Tranter (The Magician's Table, Sonic the Hedgehog 3, Doctor Who).Expect comedy, drag, mentalism and a lot of audience interaction in this 'extraordinary evening'. (NE Bylines).\\u00a0Winner - Best Variety Show | Leicester Comedy Festival 2025Winner - Best Cabaret | The SPOOKIE Awards 2025Winner - Critic\\u2019s Choice | Newcastle Fringe Festival 2025Highly Recommended | Mervyn Stutter\\u2019s Pick of the Fringe 2025\\u00a0\\u2018Mind blown\\u2026.one to watch!\\u2019 Mervyn Stutter\\u2019s Pick of the Fringe\\u2018Impressively impossible\\u2026an incredible experience\\u2019 World Magic Review'blends Victorian charm with modern magic for a delightful comedic experience\\u2019 Everything Theatre\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/215202\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"The Great Divinator: Touched by Spirits The Great Divinator: Touched by Spirits Bitesize  <h3>Fake Moustache! Real Mindreading!<\\/h3><p>Celebrated 19th century spirit medium <i><strong>The Great Divinator<\\/strong><\\/i> returns to the stage following a career break of 106 years...<\\/p><p>Vintage mind reading and outrageous audience participation in this unique evening of comedy Victorian seance and spooky paranormal happenings from multi award-winner and member of the Magic Circle Katie Tranter (<i>The Magician's Table<\\/i>, <i>Sonic the Hedgehog 3<\\/i>, <i>Doctor Who<\\/i>).<\\/p><p>Expect comedy, drag, mentalism and a lot of audience interaction in this 'extraordinary evening'. (NE Bylines).<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Winner - Best Variety Show | Leicester Comedy Festival 2025<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Winner - Best Cabaret | The SPOOKIE Awards 2025<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Winner - Critic\\u2019s Choice | Newcastle Fringe Festival 2025<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Highly Recommended | Mervyn Stutter\\u2019s Pick of the Fringe 2025<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u2018Mind blown\\u2026.one to watch!\\u2019 Mervyn Stutter\\u2019s Pick of the Fringe<\\/p><p>\\u2018Impressively impossible\\u2026an incredible experience\\u2019 World Magic Review<\\/p><p>'blends Victorian charm with modern magic for a delightful comedic experience\\u2019 Everything Theatre<\\/p> The Great Divinator: Touched by Spirits  Fake Moustache! Real Mindreading!Celebrated 19th century spirit medium The Great Divinator returns to the stage following a career break of 106 years...Vintage mind reading and outrageous audience participation in this unique evening of comedy Victorian seance and spooky paranormal happenings from multi award-winner and member of the Magic Circle Katie Tranter (The Magician's Table, Sonic the Hedgehog 3, Doctor Who).Expect comedy, drag, mentalism and a lot of audience interaction in this 'extraordinary evening'. (NE Bylines).\\u00a0Winner - Best Variety Show | Leicester Comedy Festival 2025Winner - Best Cabaret | The SPOOKIE Awards 2025Winner - Critic\\u2019s Choice | Newcastle Fringe Festival 2025Highly Recommended | Mervyn Stutter\\u2019s Pick of the Fringe 2025\\u00a0\\u2018Mind blown\\u2026.one to watch!\\u2019 Mervyn Stutter\\u2019s Pick of the Fringe\\u2018Impressively impossible\\u2026an incredible experience\\u2019 World Magic Review'blends Victorian charm with modern magic for a delightful comedic experience\\u2019 Everything Theatre Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/ER-how-can-a-body-withstand-this\\/\",\"id\":\"3447\",\"name\":\"How Can A Body Withstand This?\",\"title\":\"How Can A Body Withstand This?\",\"duration\":\"50 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Bitesize\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1787958000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/216201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788019200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1788044400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"81021\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/216202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788105600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1787958000,1788044400],\"times\":[1788019200,1788105600],\"start_date\":\"1788019200\",\"end_date\":\"1788105600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"RmVnUnBmdWVtUWxhbDlVZmRueERjUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 29 - Sun 30 Aug 2026\",\"text\":\"A powerful solo theatre show exploring grief, abortion, and the stories imposed on women's bodies. When her best friend's medical crisis becomes a national&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1850\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1850\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1850\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1850\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1850\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b0\\/c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc\\/w1850\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/b0c967fda4c913c3d2db9b45971982cc.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"A powerful solo theatre show exploring grief, abortion, and the stories imposed on women's bodies. When her best friend's medical crisis becomes a national abortion headline in America, one woman retraces the days that led there, determined to reclaim the person at the centre of the story.Set in Tennessee in the immediate aftermath of Roe v. Wade, How Can a Body Withstand This? explores friendship, memory, healthcare, and what it means to love a place while questioning the forces that shape it. Years later, now living in London, she finds herself confronting how easily political upheaval and human suffering can feel distant when viewed from afar. Moving between Tennessee and London, the play asks audiences to close that distance and consider abortion not as an abstract debate, but as a deeply human experience.Developed through a commission at the 2026 MishMash Festival.Written and performed by Mimi Harlow Robinson.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"81021\"],\"search\":\"How Can A Body Withstand This? How Can A Body Withstand This? Bitesize  <p>A powerful solo theatre show exploring grief, abortion, and the stories imposed on women's bodies. When her best friend's medical crisis becomes a national abortion headline in America, one woman retraces the days that led there, determined to reclaim the person at the centre of the story.<\\/p><p>Set in Tennessee in the immediate aftermath of Roe v. Wade, How Can a Body Withstand This? explores friendship, memory, healthcare, and what it means to love a place while questioning the forces that shape it. Years later, now living in London, she finds herself confronting how easily political upheaval and human suffering can feel distant when viewed from afar. Moving between Tennessee and London, the play asks audiences to close that distance and consider abortion not as an abstract debate, but as a deeply human experience.<\\/p><p>Developed through a commission at the 2026 MishMash Festival.<\\/p><p>Written and performed by Mimi Harlow Robinson.<\\/p> How Can A Body Withstand This?  A powerful solo theatre show exploring grief, abortion, and the stories imposed on women's bodies. When her best friend's medical crisis becomes a national abortion headline in America, one woman retraces the days that led there, determined to reclaim the person at the centre of the story.Set in Tennessee in the immediate aftermath of Roe v. Wade, How Can a Body Withstand This? explores friendship, memory, healthcare, and what it means to love a place while questioning the forces that shape it. Years later, now living in London, she finds herself confronting how easily political upheaval and human suffering can feel distant when viewed from afar. Moving between Tennessee and London, the play asks audiences to close that distance and consider abortion not as an abstract debate, but as a deeply human experience.Developed through a commission at the 2026 MishMash Festival.Written and performed by Mimi Harlow Robinson. Bitesize\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/T7-romeo-and-hamed\\/\",\"id\":\"3316\",\"name\":\"Romeo and Hamed\",\"title\":\"Romeo and Hamed\",\"duration\":\"140 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1788303600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/209401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788372000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1788390000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/209601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788440400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/209402\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788458400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1788476400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/209403\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788544800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1788562800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/209602\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788613200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/209404\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788631200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1788649200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/209603\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1788699600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1788303600,1788390000,1788390000,1788476400,1788562800,1788562800,1788649200],\"times\":[1788372000,1788440400,1788458400,1788544800,1788613200,1788631200,1788699600],\"start_date\":\"1788372000\",\"end_date\":\"1788699600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"SCtvQmJVTlV5c0tRTlJqcnl0UlN1UT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Wed 2 - Sun 6 Sep 2026\",\"text\":\"\\u201cTonight, a story, a myth, a testamentThat tells of love, sorrow and loves descentA tale that tells of two lovers heartsWritten in stars, ancient heavenly&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx3037\\/cyNaN\\/cw3814\\/chNaN\\/images\\/uploads\\/bd5391c188b4fc06ea0a15dd9789cb13.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"45.5\",\"56.2\"],\"search_text\":\"\\u201cTonight, a story, a myth, a testamentThat tells of love, sorrow and loves descentA tale that tells of two lovers heartsWritten in stars, ancient heavenly charts.\\u201dRomeo\\u00a0and Hamed\\u00a0is a bold, provocative queer reimagining of Shakespeare\\u2019s tragedy from debut writer Scott Horgan.Romeo\\u00a0moves through a world that never softens. Croydon\\u2019s concrete glare presses in from every side, until Hamed cuts through it. Their connection is immediate and dangerously alive, burning through expectation, faith, and the weight of family loyalty. Yet tragedy, as always, feels inescapable for our young lovers.This is a story of pain and pleasure, desire and violence, love as something that leaves a mark. Raves become arenas of chaos and release, a rooftop in Croydon becomes a place of worship, and emotions swing without warning from euphoria to devastation.Told in relentless, lyrical verse,\\u00a0Romeo\\u00a0& Hamed\\u00a0is urgent, feral, sexy and unafraid to ask difficult questions. It plays freely in Shakespeare\\u2019s sandpit, leaning into huge emotional swings, high drama, and catastrophic tenderness. It\\u2019s a story for right now that surges with energy and a pounding soundtrack, unlike anything currently on London stages.This new play explores family devotion, identity, religion and belonging, asking if we have the courage to love freely in a world that often refuses it.All performances of Romeo and Hamed will be Creatively Captioned.\\u201cHIGHLY COMMENDED\\u201d - National Theatre Script department.PRAISE FOR DIRECTOR, MADDY CORNER:\\u201cEnthralling\\u2026 fascinating analysis of the human condition\\u201d -\\u00a0Guardian \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605Corner bring[s] an inventiveness to the staging of each play that keeps everything visually interesting and distinctive\\u201d\\u00a0-\\u00a0The Stage\\u201cSuperbly directed by Maddy Corner, this is a play that pulls you into another world and continuously wrong-foots expectations and it will haunt me for days\\u201d -\\u00a0Ithankyou\\u00a0CREATIVE TEAM:A Sinew Productions x Slime and Pies co-productionWriter - Scott HorganDirector - Maddy CornerProducers - Eleanor Roberts, Scott Horgan, Maddy CornerConsultant Producer - Mina MoniriAssistant Director and Creative Consultant - Bilal Sha JihanStage Management - Joni Falconer and Ibraheem HamiraniMental Health Support Worker - Suzanna StoreyScript Consultants - Mohammed Barber and Huda DualehScript Editor - Dinarte GouveiaCasting by LANE CastingCasting Director - Hannah Ashby WardCasting Associates - Priyanka Patel and Steph ColesWith thanks to our Queer Muslim Focus Group - Hidayah, Gazzy from Hidayah, and Bilal Sha Jihan, with actors Jamahyl Chan Ellis, Aarushi Ganju and Tiran Aakel, led by Mina Moniri\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"search\":\"Romeo and Hamed Romeo and Hamed Theatre  <p><i>\\u201cTonight, a story, a myth, a testament<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>That tells of love, sorrow and loves descent<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>A tale that tells of two lovers hearts<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>Written in stars, ancient heavenly charts.\\u201d<\\/i><\\/p><p><i><strong>Romeo&nbsp;and Hamed&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/i>is a bold, provocative queer reimagining of Shakespeare\\u2019s tragedy from debut writer Scott Horgan.<\\/p><p>Romeo&nbsp;moves through a world that never softens. Croydon\\u2019s concrete glare presses in from every side, until Hamed cuts through it. Their connection is immediate and dangerously alive, burning through expectation, faith, and the weight of family loyalty. Yet tragedy, as always, feels inescapable for our young lovers.<\\/p><p>This is a story of pain and pleasure, desire and violence, love as something that leaves a mark. Raves become arenas of chaos and release, a rooftop in Croydon becomes a place of worship, and emotions swing without warning from euphoria to devastation.<\\/p><p>Told in relentless, lyrical verse,&nbsp;<i>Romeo&nbsp;&amp; Hamed<\\/i>&nbsp;is urgent, feral, sexy and unafraid to ask difficult questions. It plays freely in Shakespeare\\u2019s sandpit, leaning into huge emotional swings, high drama, and catastrophic tenderness. It\\u2019s a story for right now that surges with energy and a pounding soundtrack, unlike anything currently on London stages.<\\/p><p>This new play explores family devotion, identity, religion and belonging, asking if we have the courage to love freely in a world that often refuses it.<\\/p><p><strong>All performances of <\\/strong><i><strong>Romeo and Hamed <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>will be Creatively Captioned.<\\/strong><\\/p><blockquote><p><i>\\u201cHIGHLY COMMENDED<\\/i>\\u201d - National Theatre Script department.<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p><strong>PRAISE FOR DIRECTOR, MADDY CORNER:<\\/strong><\\/p><p><i>\\u201cEnthralling\\u2026 fascinating analysis of the human condition\\u201d -&nbsp;<\\/i>Guardian <strong>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605<\\/strong><\\/p><p><i>Corner bring[s] an inventiveness to the staging of each play that keeps everything visually interesting and distinctive\\u201d&nbsp;-&nbsp;<\\/i>The Stage<\\/p><p><i>\\u201cSuperbly directed by Maddy Corner, this is a play that pulls you into another world and continuously wrong-foots expectations and it will haunt me for days\\u201d -&nbsp;<\\/i>Ithankyou<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>CREATIVE TEAM:<\\/strong><br><br>A Sinew Productions x Slime and Pies co-production<br><br>Writer - Scott Horgan<br>Director - Maddy Corner<br>Producers - Eleanor Roberts, Scott Horgan, Maddy Corner<br>Consultant Producer - Mina Moniri<br>Assistant Director and Creative Consultant - Bilal Sha Jihan<br>Stage Management - Joni Falconer and Ibraheem Hamirani<br>Mental Health Support Worker - Suzanna Storey<br>Script Consultants - Mohammed Barber and Huda Dualeh<br>Script Editor - Dinarte Gouveia<br><br>Casting by LANE Casting<br>Casting Director - Hannah Ashby Ward<br>Casting Associates - Priyanka Patel and Steph Coles<br><br>With thanks to our Queer Muslim Focus Group - Hidayah, Gazzy from Hidayah, and Bilal Sha Jihan, with actors Jamahyl Chan Ellis, Aarushi Ganju and Tiran Aakel, led by Mina Moniri<\\/p> Romeo and Hamed  \\u201cTonight, a story, a myth, a testamentThat tells of love, sorrow and loves descentA tale that tells of two lovers heartsWritten in stars, ancient heavenly charts.\\u201dRomeo\\u00a0and Hamed\\u00a0is a bold, provocative queer reimagining of Shakespeare\\u2019s tragedy from debut writer Scott Horgan.Romeo\\u00a0moves through a world that never softens. Croydon\\u2019s concrete glare presses in from every side, until Hamed cuts through it. Their connection is immediate and dangerously alive, burning through expectation, faith, and the weight of family loyalty. Yet tragedy, as always, feels inescapable for our young lovers.This is a story of pain and pleasure, desire and violence, love as something that leaves a mark. Raves become arenas of chaos and release, a rooftop in Croydon becomes a place of worship, and emotions swing without warning from euphoria to devastation.Told in relentless, lyrical verse,\\u00a0Romeo\\u00a0& Hamed\\u00a0is urgent, feral, sexy and unafraid to ask difficult questions. It plays freely in Shakespeare\\u2019s sandpit, leaning into huge emotional swings, high drama, and catastrophic tenderness. It\\u2019s a story for right now that surges with energy and a pounding soundtrack, unlike anything currently on London stages.This new play explores family devotion, identity, religion and belonging, asking if we have the courage to love freely in a world that often refuses it.All performances of Romeo and Hamed will be Creatively Captioned.\\u201cHIGHLY COMMENDED\\u201d - National Theatre Script department.PRAISE FOR DIRECTOR, MADDY CORNER:\\u201cEnthralling\\u2026 fascinating analysis of the human condition\\u201d -\\u00a0Guardian \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605Corner bring[s] an inventiveness to the staging of each play that keeps everything visually interesting and distinctive\\u201d\\u00a0-\\u00a0The Stage\\u201cSuperbly directed by Maddy Corner, this is a play that pulls you into another world and continuously wrong-foots expectations and it will haunt me for days\\u201d -\\u00a0Ithankyou\\u00a0CREATIVE TEAM:A Sinew Productions x Slime and Pies co-productionWriter - Scott HorganDirector - Maddy CornerProducers - Eleanor Roberts, Scott Horgan, Maddy CornerConsultant Producer - Mina MoniriAssistant Director and Creative Consultant - Bilal Sha JihanStage Management - Joni Falconer and Ibraheem HamiraniMental Health Support Worker - Suzanna StoreyScript Consultants - Mohammed Barber and Huda DualehScript Editor - Dinarte GouveiaCasting by LANE CastingCasting Director - Hannah Ashby WardCasting Associates - Priyanka Patel and Steph ColesWith thanks to our Queer Muslim Focus Group - Hidayah, Gazzy from Hidayah, and Bilal Sha Jihan, with actors Jamahyl Chan Ellis, Aarushi Ganju and Tiran Aakel, led by Mina Moniri Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/H6-the-song-of-grace\\/\",\"id\":\"3271\",\"name\":\"The Song of Grace\",\"title\":\"The Song of Grace\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1789081200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\",\"80901\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/206003\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timest