/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/96\\/a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx395\\/cy13\\/cw669\\/ch665\\/images\\/uploads\\/96a1a29f17155d0ece15930bea2ca8f5.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"A contemporary theatrical experience of music, movement, and story.A young musician grows up with a song from her grandmother, Grace. What begins as a childhood lullaby becomes a thread through her life, guiding her through love, loss, and the search for truth.Blending original live music, dance, and dialogue,\\u00a0The Song of Grace\\u00a0is an intimate and visually rich stage production about the people who shape us, the wisdom they leave behind, and the grace that continues to guide us when life changes form.Created by an international ensemble of artists from 10 countries, the production is inspired by real life events, the wisdom of the Bhagavad Gita, and the global cultural work of Indradyumna Swami, whose festivals and travels have inspired artists around the world.For anyone who has loved, lost, or searched for meaning,\\u00a0The Song of Grace\\u00a0is a moving theatrical experience about truth that endures and the courage to follow our calling.\\u00a0UK PremiereWritten by Vana Mali and Prema Hamilton\\u00a0Directed by Vana MaliArtistic Producer: Ravin J. Ganatra\\u00a0Original music by Prema Hamilton, performed liveProduced by The Prema Collective in association with Friends Forever\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"3\",\"80901\"],\"search\":\"The Song of Grace The Song of Grace Theatre  <h3>A contemporary theatrical experience of music, movement, and story.<\\/h3><p>A young musician grows up with a song from her grandmother, Grace. What begins as a childhood lullaby becomes a thread through her life, guiding her through love, loss, and the search for truth.<\\/p><p>Blending original live music, dance, and dialogue,&nbsp;<i>The Song of Grace<\\/i>&nbsp;is an intimate and visually rich stage production about the people who shape us, the wisdom they leave behind, and the grace that continues to guide us when life changes form.<\\/p><p>Created by an international ensemble of artists from 10 countries, the production is inspired by real life events, the wisdom of the Bhagavad Gita, and the global cultural work of Indradyumna Swami, whose festivals and travels have inspired artists around the world.<\\/p><p>For anyone who has loved, lost, or searched for meaning,&nbsp;<i>The Song of Grace<\\/i>&nbsp;is a moving theatrical experience about truth that endures and the courage to follow our calling.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>UK Premiere<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Written by Vana Mali and Prema Hamilton&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Directed by Vana Mali<\\/p><p>Artistic Producer: Ravin J. Ganatra&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Original music by Prema Hamilton, performed live<\\/p><p>Produced by The Prema Collective in association with Friends Forever<\\/p> The Song of Grace  A contemporary theatrical experience of music, movement, and story.A young musician grows up with a song from her grandmother, Grace. What begins as a childhood lullaby becomes a thread through her life, guiding her through love, loss, and the search for truth.Blending original live music, dance, and dialogue,\\u00a0The Song of Grace\\u00a0is an intimate and visually rich stage production about the people who shape us, the wisdom they leave behind, and the grace that continues to guide us when life changes form.Created by an international ensemble of artists from 10 countries, the production is inspired by real life events, the wisdom of the Bhagavad Gita, and the global cultural work of Indradyumna Swami, whose festivals and travels have inspired artists around the world.For anyone who has loved, lost, or searched for meaning,\\u00a0The Song of Grace\\u00a0is a moving theatrical experience about truth that endures and the courage to follow our calling.\\u00a0UK PremiereWritten by Vana Mali and Prema Hamilton\\u00a0Directed by Vana MaliArtistic Producer: Ravin J. Ganatra\\u00a0Original music by Prema Hamilton, performed liveProduced by The Prema Collective in association with Friends Forever Theatre Dance\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uqU-prophets-an-rd-at-riverside-sharing\\/\",\"id\":\"4182\",\"name\":\"Prophets (An R&D at Riverside Sharing)\",\"title\":\"Prophets (An R&D at Riverside Sharing)\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1789081200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\",\"81013\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/263401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1789132500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1789081200],\"times\":[1789132500],\"start_date\":\"1789132500\",\"end_date\":\"1789132500\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"OHpPa2Vnb0VmdDdlVU9STkdqbEtGUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 11 Sep 2026\",\"text\":\"When Day\\u2019s world is shattered, it takes everything he believed in with it. Set entirely within his flat, Prophets follows a young man whose grief leads&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/1cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx1670\\/cw5149\\/ch5149\\/images\\/uploads\\/681cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.