g\\/cx1670\\/cw5149\\/ch5149\\/images\\/uploads\\/681cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/1cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1670\\/cw5149\\/ch5149\\/images\\/uploads\\/681cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/1cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1670\\/cw5149\\/ch5149\\/images\\/uploads\\/681cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/1cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1670\\/cw5149\\/ch5149\\/images\\/uploads\\/681cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/68\\/1cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx1670\\/cw5149\\/ch5149\\/images\\/uploads\\/681cb21bc1b43cfd3c627af8fa89f008.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"51.1\",\"44.8\"],\"search_text\":\"When Day\\u2019s world is shattered, it takes everything he believed in with it. Set entirely within his flat, Prophets follows a young man whose grief leads him to ask a simple but devastating question: what happens when God dies? A dark comedy about faith, family and the promises made in God\\u2019s name.This sharing was selected for our R&D at Riverside Programme - providing free rehearsal space for new writing. Every year we offer several opportunities for free rehearsal space with a ticketed sharing of the very best brand-new work that would otherwise face financial barriers in securing space. Supporting new work is at the heart of what we do, and buying a ticket for this sharing helps us to fund future opportunities for artists.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/263401\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"theatre\":[\"81013\"],\"search\":\"Prophets (An R&D at Riverside Sharing) Prophets (An R&D at Riverside Sharing) Theatre  <p>When Day\\u2019s world is shattered, it takes everything he believed in with it. Set entirely within his flat, <i><strong>Prophets <\\/strong><\\/i>follows a young man whose grief leads him to ask a simple but devastating question: what happens when God dies? A dark comedy about faith, family and the promises made in God\\u2019s name.<\\/p><p><i>This sharing was selected for our R&amp;D at Riverside Programme - providing free rehearsal space for new writing. Every year we offer several opportunities for free rehearsal space with a ticketed sharing of the very best brand-new work that would otherwise face financial barriers in securing space. Supporting new work is at the heart of what we do, and buying a ticket for this sharing helps us to fund future opportunities for artists.<\\/i><\\/p> Prophets (An R&D at Riverside Sharing)  When Day\\u2019s world is shattered, it takes everything he believed in with it. Set entirely within his flat, Prophets follows a young man whose grief leads him to ask a simple but devastating question: what happens when God dies? A dark comedy about faith, family and the promises made in God\\u2019s name.This sharing was selected for our R&D at Riverside Programme - providing free rehearsal space for new writing. Every year we offer several opportunities for free rehearsal space with a ticketed sharing of the very best brand-new work that would otherwise face financial barriers in securing space. Supporting new work is at the heart of what we do, and buying a ticket for this sharing helps us to fund future opportunities for artists. Theatre Riverside R&D\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uAq-national-theatre-live-the-misanthrope\\/\",\"id\":\"3849\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: The Misanthrope\",\"title\":\"National Theatre Live: The Misanthrope\",\"duration\":\"150 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1790031600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/247201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1790101800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1790031600],\"times\":[1790101800],\"start_date\":\"1790101800\",\"end_date\":\"1790101800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"15\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"QWxla2ZqdXJjeU5sempzbTFWWng3QT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 22 Sep 2026\",\"text\":\"Award-winner Sandra Oh (Killing Eve) plays the title role in this razor-sharp reimagining of Moli\\u00e8re\\u2019s classic dark comedy. &nbsp;Telling the truth isn\\u2019t&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3e\\/5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx33\\/cy112\\/cw608\\/ch608\\/images\\/uploads\\/3e5ebfa2cc53e5ab7ed5b50cbc8f7ecb.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"51.6\",\"49.3\"],\"search_text\":\"Award-winner Sandra Oh (Killing Eve) plays the title role in this razor-sharp reimagining of Moli\\u00e8re\\u2019s classic dark comedy. \\u00a0Telling the truth isn\\u2019t always that simple. Alice, a brilliant novelist, despises the carefully constructed lies of modern society. But the more she challenges those around her, the fiercer the backlash becomes. Soon, she must confront the price of speaking her truth in a world that would rather silence her. \\u00a0Filmed live on stage at the National Theatre, Indhu Rubasingham directs Martin Crimp\\u2019s (Cyrano de Bergerac) highly anticipated play.Age Rating:15Language:EnglishContent Warnings:TBCDirector:Indhu RubasinghamCast:Sandra OhCompany:National Theatre LiveInterval:TBCTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:2026\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/247201\\/\",\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81000\"],\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"search\":\"National Theatre Live: The Misanthrope National Theatre Live: The Misanthrope Cinema  <p>Award-winner Sandra Oh (Killing Eve) plays the title role in this razor-sharp reimagining of Moli\\u00e8re\\u2019s classic dark comedy. &nbsp;<\\/p><p>Telling the truth isn\\u2019t always that simple. Alice, a brilliant novelist, despises the carefully constructed lies of modern society. But the more she challenges those around her, the fiercer the backlash becomes. Soon, she must confront the price of speaking her truth in a world that would rather silence her. &nbsp;<\\/p><p>Filmed live on stage at the <strong>National Theatre<\\/strong>, Indhu Rubasingham directs Martin Crimp\\u2019s (Cyrano de Bergerac) highly anticipated play.<\\/p><figure class=\\\"table\\\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Age Rating:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>15<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Language:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>English<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Content Warnings:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>TBC<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Director:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Indhu Rubasingham<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Cast:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>Sandra Oh<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Company:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>National Theatre Live<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Interval:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>TBC<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Trailers:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>20 mins<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td><strong>Year of Release:<\\/strong><\\/td><td>2026<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><\\/figure> National Theatre Live: The Misanthrope  Award-winner Sandra Oh (Killing Eve) plays the title role in this razor-sharp reimagining of Moli\\u00e8re\\u2019s classic dark comedy. \\u00a0Telling the truth isn\\u2019t always that simple. Alice, a brilliant novelist, despises the carefully constructed lies of modern society. But the more she challenges those around her, the fiercer the backlash becomes. Soon, she must confront the price of speaking her truth in a world that would rather silence her. \\u00a0Filmed live on stage at the National Theatre, Indhu Rubasingham directs Martin Crimp\\u2019s (Cyrano de Bergerac) highly anticipated play.Age Rating:15Language:EnglishContent Warnings:TBCDirector:Indhu RubasinghamCast:Sandra OhCompany:National Theatre LiveInterval:TBCTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:2026 15 Cinema\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uwQ-affluenza\\/\",\"id\":\"4256\",\"name\":\"Affluenza\",\"title\":\"Affluenza\",\"duration\":\"\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"0\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[],\"times\":[],\"start_date\":\"1790447400\",\"end_date\":\"1795289400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"VGN4MUcxcTZwdVgzOWNhOHhXOVlYdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 26 Sep - Sat 21 Nov 2026\",\"text\":\"Written and Directed by Andy SandbergPrivilege is inherited. So are the consequences.When a teen\\u2019s drunken car ride ends in devastation, the verdict comes&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e6\\/7af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793\\/w1667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/e67af25b07dc2e9adc82883ad2bd9793.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Written and Directed by Andy SandbergPrivilege is inherited. So are the consequences.When a teen\\u2019s drunken car ride ends in devastation, the verdict comes down to one question - is it possible to be too affluent to know the difference between right and wrong? Inspired by true events surrounding a shocking legal defence, Affluenza explores the ripple effects of power and privilege.\\u00a0Set against the ultra-wealthy social haven of the Hamptons, Affluenza\\u00a0raises thought-provoking questions about moral accountability, family legacy, and the American justice system. Do any of us truly understand the cost and generational impact of privilege and opulence?Don\\u2019t miss the world premiere of Affluenza, a provocative new play written and directed by Andy Sandberg. Casting for this biting and darkly funny new play is to be announced soon.Affluenza is the first of five plays launching the Mainstage 26-27 season at Riverside Studios, from 26 September 2026 for a limited 8-week run.Additional productions will be announced.\",\"book_link\":\"no-link\",\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"search\":\"Affluenza Affluenza Theatre  <h3>Written and Directed by Andy Sandberg<\\/h3><h3><i><strong>Privilege is inherited. So are the consequences.<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/h3><p>When a teen\\u2019s drunken car ride ends in devastation, the verdict comes down to one question - is it possible to be <i>too<\\/i> affluent to know the difference between right and wrong? Inspired by true events surrounding a shocking legal defence, <i><strong>Affluenza <\\/strong><\\/i>explores the ripple effects of power and privilege.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Set against the ultra-wealthy social haven of the Hamptons, <i>Affluenza&nbsp;<\\/i>raises thought-provoking questions about moral accountability, family legacy, and the American justice system. Do any of us truly understand the cost and generational impact of privilege and opulence?<\\/p><p>Don\\u2019t miss the world premiere of <strong>Affluenza<\\/strong>, a provocative new play written and directed by <strong>Andy Sandberg<\\/strong>. Casting for this biting and darkly funny new play is to be announced soon.<\\/p><p><br><i><strong>Affluenza <\\/strong><\\/i>is the first of five plays launching the <strong>Mainstage 26-27<\\/strong> season at <strong>Riverside Studios<\\/strong>, from 26 September 2026 for a limited 8-week run.<\\/p><p><i>Additional productions will be announced.<\\/i><\\/p>   Written and Directed by Andy SandbergPrivilege is inherited. So are the consequences.When a teen\\u2019s drunken car ride ends in devastation, the verdict comes down to one question - is it possible to be too affluent to know the difference between right and wrong? Inspired by true events surrounding a shocking legal defence, Affluenza explores the ripple effects of power and privilege.\\u00a0Set against the ultra-wealthy social haven of the Hamptons, Affluenza\\u00a0raises thought-provoking questions about moral accountability, family legacy, and the American justice system. Do any of us truly understand the cost and generational impact of privilege and opulence?Don\\u2019t miss the world premiere of Affluenza, a provocative new play written and directed by Andy Sandberg. Casting for this biting and darkly funny new play is to be announced soon.Affluenza is the first of five plays launching the Mainstage 26-27 season at Riverside Studios, from 26 September 2026 for a limited 8-week run.Additional productions will be announced. Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/ld-cadel-lungs-on-legs\\/\",\"id\":\"2854\",\"name\":\"CADEL: Lungs on Legs\",\"title\":\"CADEL: Lungs on Legs\",\"duration\":\"70 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1791846000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/180201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1791915300\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1791932400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/180202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1792001700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1792018800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/180401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1792088100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1792105200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/180601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\