cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/82ad9059323b4cd329dd6dfbb7ca2b50.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Seabright Live and Cadel the Play LLC in association with Anant Das presentCADEL: Lungs on LegsONE ACTOR. ONE BIKE. ONE DREAM.Connor Delves stars as Cadel Evans in CADEL: Lungs On Legs, the London premiere of the smash-hit play about the first Australian to win the Tour de France. CADEL: Lungs on Legs is a groundbreaking play set in motion by award-winning Australian actor Connor Delves. Performed entirely on a bicycle, this one man show captures the drive and determination of Cadel Evans and explores his inspiring true story as the first Australian to win the Tour de France.\\u00a0Pedalling non-stop for over an hour, Delves immerses the audience in the highs and lows, heartaches and sacrifices of Cadel Evans\\u2019 2011 victory.\\u00a0Edinburgh Festival Fringe - Sellout Show 2025\\\"Best Show Of The Fringe\\\" Award Winner - Theatre WeeklyUnderbelly Fringe Fix Wild Card Winner - London West End Showcase SelectionEFFTA Award Winner - Fringe Theatre AwardWinner: Best of Theatre Weekly Award, Adelaide Fringe 2026\\u00a0Written by Connor Delves and Steve McMahonCreator and Performer Connor DelvesDirector and Dramaturg Mark BarfordProduction Designer Imagine BlackLighting Designer Mitchell FentonVideo Designer Lauren CochraneSound Designer Nate EdmondsonAssistant Stage Manager Mecca Christy\\u00a0\\\"The audience roars\\u2026 Delves IS Evans\\\"\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 The Guardian\\u201cPitch-perfect theatre-making\\\"\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 The List\\\"Delves is magnetic\\u2026 pioneering work\\\"\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605The Scoop\\u201cTriumphant performance by the talented actor\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605The Recs\\\"You\\u2019ll be riveted and have a wheely good time. Captivating\\u2026 with his vivid storytelling about the intense cycling world\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605Three Weeks\\u201cThe best show I\\u2019ve seen in 24 years of the fringe\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 My Cultural Life\\u201cA must see! He locks his feet into the pedals, and the audience embarks on a ride I doubt they will ever forget\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Theatre and Art Reviews\\u00a0www.Cadeltheplay.com\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"search\":\"CADEL: Lungs on Legs CADEL: Lungs on Legs Theatre  <h3>Seabright Live and Cadel the Play LLC in association with Anant Das present<\\/h3><h3><strong>CADEL: Lungs on Legs<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>ONE ACTOR. ONE BIKE. ONE DREAM.<\\/p><p>Connor Delves stars as Cadel Evans in <i>CADEL: Lungs On Legs<\\/i>, the London premiere of the smash-hit play about the first Australian to win the Tour de France. <i>CADEL: Lungs on Legs<\\/i> is a groundbreaking play set in motion by award-winning Australian actor Connor Delves. Performed entirely on a bicycle, this one man show captures the drive and determination of Cadel Evans and explores his inspiring true story as the first Australian to win the Tour de France.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Pedalling non-stop for over an hour, Delves immerses the audience in the highs and lows, heartaches and sacrifices of Cadel Evans\\u2019 2011 victory.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Edinburgh Festival Fringe - Sellout Show 2025<\\/p><p>\\\"Best Show Of The Fringe\\\" Award Winner - Theatre Weekly<\\/p><p>Underbelly Fringe Fix Wild Card Winner - London West End Showcase Selection<\\/p><p>EFFTA Award Winner - Fringe Theatre Award<\\/p><p>Winner: Best of Theatre Weekly Award, Adelaide Fringe 2026<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Written by <strong>Connor Delves<\\/strong> and <strong>Steve McMahon<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Creator and Performer <strong>Connor Delves<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Director and Dramaturg <strong>Mark Barford<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Production Designer <strong>Imagine Black<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Lighting Designer <strong>Mitchell Fenton<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Video Designer <strong>Lauren Cochrane<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Sound Designer <strong>Nate Edmondson<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Assistant Stage Manager <strong>Mecca Christy<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\\"The audience roars\\u2026 Delves IS Evans\\\"&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 The Guardian<\\/p><p>\\u201cPitch-perfect theatre-making\\\"&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 The List<\\/p><p>\\\"Delves is magnetic\\u2026 pioneering work\\\"&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605The Scoop<\\/p><p>\\u201cTriumphant performance by the talented actor\\u201d&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605The Recs<\\/p><p>\\\"You\\u2019ll be riveted and have a wheely good time. Captivating\\u2026 with his vivid storytelling about the intense cycling world\\u201d&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605Three Weeks<\\/p><p>\\u201cThe best show I\\u2019ve seen in 24 years of the fringe\\u201d&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 My Cultural Life<\\/p><p>\\u201cA must see! He locks his feet into the pedals, and the audience embarks on a ride I doubt they will ever forget\\u201d&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Theatre and Art Reviews<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.Cadeltheplay.com\\\">www.Cadeltheplay.com<\\/a><\\/p> CADEL: Lungs on Legs  Seabright Live and Cadel the Play LLC in association with Anant Das presentCADEL: Lungs on LegsONE ACTOR. ONE BIKE. ONE DREAM.Connor Delves stars as Cadel Evans in CADEL: Lungs On Legs, the London premiere of the smash-hit play about the first Australian to win the Tour de France. CADEL: Lungs on Legs is a groundbreaking play set in motion by award-winning Australian actor Connor Delves. Performed entirely on a bicycle, this one man show captures the drive and determination of Cadel Evans and explores his inspiring true story as the first Australian to win the Tour de France.\\u00a0Pedalling non-stop for over an hour, Delves immerses the audience in the highs and lows, heartaches and sacrifices of Cadel Evans\\u2019 2011 victory.\\u00a0Edinburgh Festival Fringe - Sellout Show 2025\\\"Best Show Of The Fringe\\\" Award Winner - Theatre WeeklyUnderbelly Fringe Fix Wild Card Winner - London West End Showcase SelectionEFFTA Award Winner - Fringe Theatre AwardWinner: Best of Theatre Weekly Award, Adelaide Fringe 2026\\u00a0Written by Connor Delves and Steve McMahonCreator and Performer Connor DelvesDirector and Dramaturg Mark BarfordProduction Designer Imagine BlackLighting Designer Mitchell FentonVideo Designer Lauren CochraneSound Designer Nate EdmondsonAssistant Stage Manager Mecca Christy\\u00a0\\\"The audience roars\\u2026 Delves IS Evans\\\"\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 The Guardian\\u201cPitch-perfect theatre-making\\\"\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 The List\\\"Delves is magnetic\\u2026 pioneering work\\\"\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605The Scoop\\u201cTriumphant performance by the talented actor\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605The Recs\\\"You\\u2019ll be riveted and have a wheely good time. Captivating\\u2026 with his vivid storytelling about the intense cycling world\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605Three Weeks\\u201cThe best show I\\u2019ve seen in 24 years of the fringe\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 My Cultural Life\\u201cA must see! He locks his feet into the pedals, and the audience embarks on a ride I doubt they will ever forget\\u201d\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Theatre and Art Reviews\\u00a0www.Cadeltheplay.com Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Yp-victor-daniels-certified-classics\\/\",\"id\":\"3762\",\"name\":\"Victor Daniels: Certified Classics\",\"title\":\"Victor Daniels: Certified Classics\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Comedy\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1792105200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"313\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/238801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">21:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1792182600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1792105200],\"times\":[1792182600],\"start_date\":\"1792182600\",\"end_date\":\"1792182600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"c0lKcEhhNjJCV281SVZ2TDBIOFBNQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 16 Oct 2026\",\"text\":\"Victor Daniels \\u2014 The UK\\u2019s answer to Dave Chappelle \\u2014 presents Certified Classics.One hour of his favourite jokes. No filler. Just straight bants and guaranteed&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/80\\/b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx177\\/cy3\\/cw624\\/ch623\\/images\\/uploads\\/80b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/80\\/b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx177\\/cy3\\/cw624\\/ch623\\/images\\/uploads\\/80b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/80\\/b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf\\/w979\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx177\\/cy3\\/cw624\\/ch623\\/images\\/uploads\\/80b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/80\\/b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf\\/w979\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx177\\/cy3\\/cw624\\/ch623\\/images\\/uploads\\/80b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/80\\/b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf\\/w979\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx177\\/cy3\\/cw624\\/ch623\\/images\\/uploads\\/80b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/80\\/b0cc7b84d195cc100eb3913243fdcf\\/w979\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx177\\/cy3\\/cw624\\/ch623\\/images\\/uploads\\/