\"],\"focal_point\":[\"48.6\",\"33.4\"],\"search_text\":\"Victor Daniels \\u2014 The UK\\u2019s answer to Dave Chappelle \\u2014 presents Certified Classics.One hour of his favourite jokes. No filler. Just straight bants and guaranteed laughs.\\u00a0Please note this comedy special is being filmed for the big and small screen.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/238801\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"313\"],\"search\":\"Victor Daniels: Certified Classics Victor Daniels: Certified Classics Comedy  <p>Victor Daniels \\u2014 The UK\\u2019s answer to Dave Chappelle \\u2014 presents <i><strong>Certified Classics<\\/strong><\\/i>.<\\/p><p>One hour of his favourite jokes. No filler. Just straight bants and guaranteed laughs.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Please note this comedy special is being filmed for the big and small screen.<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p> Victor Daniels: Certified Classics  Victor Daniels \\u2014 The UK\\u2019s answer to Dave Chappelle \\u2014 presents Certified Classics.One hour of his favourite jokes. No filler. Just straight bants and guaranteed laughs.\\u00a0Please note this comedy special is being filmed for the big and small screen. Comedy\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/3J-five-day-autumn-writing-intensive-with-tristan-fynn-aiduenu\\/\",\"id\":\"2690\",\"name\":\"Five Day Autumn Writing Intensive with Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu\",\"title\":\"Five Day Autumn Writing Intensive with Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu\",\"duration\":\"420 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1792972800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"81015\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/168201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">10:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1793008800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1792972800],\"times\":[1793008800],\"start_date\":\"1793008800\",\"end_date\":\"1793008800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"b0dHamVwWjc5SDJ4ZTNlWkp2SXVTZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Mon 26 Oct 2026\",\"text\":\"Welcome to SCRUM\\u2019s summer workshop series! You can explore the full programme here: https:\\/\\/www.scrumtheatre.co.uk\\/current-workshopsThe workshop will&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7d\\/9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7d9e10e3e46b86f49ddbe05ac3758b5d.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50\",\"50\"],\"search_text\":\"Welcome to SCRUM\\u2019s summer workshop series! You can explore the full programme here: https:\\/\\/www.scrumtheatre.co.uk\\/current-workshopsThe workshop will run 10am-5pm every day from Monday 26th-Friday 30th October and participants should be available to attend the whole course. If you have any questions please email workshops@scrumtheatre.co.uk\\u00a0\\u00a0And now the event information you\\u2019re here for!\\u00a0TELL ME A TALE X BLACK PHANTASTIC: PLAY IN A WEEKDeriving from the Tell Me A Tale Method, this five-day intensive writing workshop will be geared towards enhancing skills in devising, story structure, character, acting, dramaturgy and world building whilst creating a piece of work responding to a speculative stimuli (i.e. fantasy, sci-fi, horror). By the end of the course, each participant will have the framework and start of a new piece or have enough guidance\\/development to take their next steps on an existing piece.This workshop is for theatremakers (actor-writers) looking to premiere a short section of a work-in-progress solo work or piece of ensemble storytelling.\\u00a0\\u00a0Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu\\u2019s Theatre work includes; (as Director):\\u00a0Pig Heart Boy\\u00a0(Unicorn\\/Fiery Angel Tour),\\u00a0For Black Boys Who Have Considered Suicide When the Hue Gets Too Heavy\\u00a0(Nouveau Riche\\/Boundless\\/New Diorama\\/ Royal Court Theatre),\\u00a0Deep Azure\\u00a0(Shakespeare\\u2019s Globe),\\u00a0Little Baby Jesus\\u00a0(Orange Tree); (as Writer\\/Director):\\u00a0Sweet Like Chocolate Boy\\u00a0(JackStudio\\/BAC\\/Tobacco Factory\\/Theatre Peckham),\\u00a0Sundown Kiki\\u00a0(Young Vic),\\u00a0Hyde & Seek\\u00a0(Guildhall); (as Writer):\\u00a0Rumble In The Jungle\\u00a0(Rematch ltd).\\u00a0Tristan\\u2019s awards include: 2019 JMK Young Director Award, 2022 Black British Theatre Award for Best Director, 2025 UK Theatre Award for Best Children\\u2019s Show, 2025 Bruntwood Playwrighting Prize Longlist, 2022 Oliver Nominee for Best New Play, 2025 Arts Foundation Future Fellow.\\u00a0TICKETSThe cost of this workshop is \\u00a3480 and we also have a limited number of discounted tickets available which will be released to our SCRUMmunity members via our mailing list, which you can join here.\\u00a0There are four free bursary places available for this workshop for those facing financial barriers. Bursary applications will be open soon, please keep an eye on this page, our website\\u00a0www.scrumtheatre.co.uk, our socials, or join our mailout for further information here.\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/168201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"theatre\":[\"81015\"],\"search\":\"Five Day Autumn Writing Intensive with Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu Five Day Autumn Writing Intensive with Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu Workshops & Classes  <p>Welcome to SCRUM\\u2019s summer workshop series! You can explore the full programme here: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.scrumtheatre.co.uk\\/current-workshops\\\">https:\\/\\/www.scrumtheatre.co.uk\\/current-workshops<\\/a><\\/p><p>The workshop will run 10am-5pm every day from Monday 26th-Friday 30th October and participants should be available to attend the whole course. If you have any questions please email <a href=\\\"mailto:workshops@scrumtheatre.co.uk\\\">workshops@scrumtheatre.co.uk<\\/a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p>And now the event information you\\u2019re here for!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>TELL ME A TALE X BLACK PHANTASTIC: PLAY IN A WEEK<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Deriving from the <strong>Tell Me A Tale Method<\\/strong>, this five-day intensive writing workshop will be geared towards enhancing skills in devising, story structure, character, acting, dramaturgy and world building whilst creating a piece of work responding to a speculative stimuli (i.e. fantasy, sci-fi, horror). By the end of the course, each participant will have the framework and start of a new piece or have enough guidance\\/development to take their next steps on an existing piece.<\\/p><p>This workshop is for theatremakers (actor-writers) looking to premiere a short section of a work-in-progress solo work or piece of ensemble storytelling.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu<\\/strong>\\u2019s Theatre work includes; (as Director):&nbsp;<i>Pig Heart Boy<\\/i>&nbsp;(Unicorn\\/Fiery Angel Tour),&nbsp;<i>For Black Boys Who Have Considered Suicide When the Hue Gets Too Heavy<\\/i>&nbsp;(Nouveau Riche\\/Boundless\\/New Diorama\\/ Royal Court Theatre),&nbsp;<i>Deep Azure<\\/i>&nbsp;(Shakespeare\\u2019s Globe),&nbsp;<i>Little Baby Jesus<\\/i>&nbsp;(Orange Tree); (as Writer\\/Director):&nbsp;<i>Sweet Like Chocolate Boy<\\/i>&nbsp;(JackStudio\\/BAC\\/Tobacco Factory\\/Theatre Peckham),&nbsp;<i>Sundown Kiki<\\/i>&nbsp;(Young Vic),&nbsp;<i>Hyde &amp; Seek<\\/i>&nbsp;(Guildhall); (as Writer):&nbsp;<i>Rumble In The Jungle<\\/i>&nbsp;(Rematch ltd).&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Tristan\\u2019s awards include: 2019 JMK Young Director Award, 2022 Black British Theatre Award for Best Director, 2025 UK Theatre Award for Best Children\\u2019s Show, 2025 Bruntwood Playwrighting Prize Longlist, 2022 Oliver Nominee for Best New Play, 2025 Arts Foundation Future Fellow.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>TICKETS<\\/strong><\\/p><p>The cost of this workshop is \\u00a3480 and we also have a limited number of discounted tickets available which will be released to our SCRUMmunity members via our mailing list, which you can join here.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>There are four free bursary places available for this workshop for those facing financial barriers. Bursary applications will be open soon, please keep an eye on this page, our website&nbsp;<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.scrumtheatre.co.uk\\/\\\">www.scrumtheatre.co.uk<\\/a>, our socials, or join our mailout for further information <a href=\\\" https:\\/\\/scrumtheatre.us14.list-manage.com\\/subscribe?u=780670bd39315a708f7273f3f&amp;id=0e777707aa \\\"><strong>here.<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p> Summer Writing Intensive with Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu,Five Day Autumn Writing Intensive with Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu  Welcome to SCRUM\\u2019s summer workshop series! You can explore the full programme here: https:\\/\\/www.scrumtheatre.co.uk\\/current-workshopsThe workshop will run 10am-5pm every day from Monday 26th-Friday 30th October and participants should be available to attend the whole course. If you have any questions please email workshops@scrumtheatre.co.uk\\u00a0\\u00a0And now the event information you\\u2019re here for!\\u00a0TELL ME A TALE X BLACK PHANTASTIC: PLAY IN A WEEKDeriving from the Tell Me A Tale Method, this five-day intensive writing workshop will be geared towards enhancing skills in devising, story structure, character, acting, dramaturgy and world building whilst creating a piece of work responding to a speculative stimuli (i.e. fantasy, sci-fi, horror). By the end of the course, each participant will have the framework and start of a new piece or have enough guidance\\/development to take their next steps on an existing piece.This workshop is for theatremakers (actor-writers) looking to premiere a short section of a work-in-progress solo work or piece of ensemble storytelling.\\u00a0\\u00a0Tristan Fynn-Aiduenu\\u2019s Theatre work includes; (as Director):\\u00a0Pig Heart Boy\\u00a0(Unicorn\\/Fiery Angel Tour),\\u00a0For Black Boys Who Have Considered Suicide When the Hue Gets Too Heavy\\u00a0(Nouveau Riche\\/Boundless\\/New Diorama\\/ Royal Court Theatre),\\u00a0Deep Azure\\u00a0(Shakespeare\\u2019s Globe),\\u00a0Little Baby Jesus\\u00a0(Orange Tree); (as Writer\\/Director):\\u00a0Sweet Like Chocolate Boy\\u00a0(JackStudio\\/BAC\\/Tobacco Factory\\/Theatre Peckham),\\u00a0Sundown Kiki\\u00a0(Young Vic),\\u00a0Hyde & Seek\\u00a0(Guildhall); (as Writer):\\u00a0Rumble In The Jungle\\u00a0(Rematch ltd).\\u00a0Tristan\\u2019s awards include: 2019 JMK Young Director Award, 2022 Black British Theatre Award for Best Director, 2025 UK Theatre Award for Best Children\\u2019s Show, 2025 Bruntwood Playwrighting Prize Longlist, 2022 Oliver Nominee for Best New Play, 2025 Arts Foundation Future Fellow.\\u00a0TICKETSThe cost of this workshop is \\u00a3480 and we also have a limited number of discounted tickets available which will be released to our SCRUMmunity members via our mailing list, which you can join here.\\u00a0There are four free bursary places available for this workshop for those facing financial barriers. Bursary applications will be open soon, please keep an eye on this page, our website\\u00a0www.scrumtheatre.co.uk, our socials, or join our mailout for further information here.\\u00a0 Workshops & Classes SCRUM Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/ho-maxim-rad-live-at-riverside-studios\\/\",\"id\":\"3839\",\"name\":\"Maxim Rad: Live at Riverside Studios\",\"title\":\"Maxim Rad: Live at Riverside Studios\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Music\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":[],\"performance_dates\":[],\"times\":[],\"start_date\":false,\"end_date\":false,\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"andhbVFuUHp4VWhsVXhWTFJyUU4xdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"\",\"text\":\"Maxim Rad is a London based singer songwriter, composer and producer. Over time he evolved into experimental and genre-crossing projects.&nbsp;Rad has&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1895\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1895\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1895\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053\\/w1895\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx445\\/cw1081\\/ch1080\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a82ff2c7004f70e8231567edca45053.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"54.3\",\"43.1\"],\"search_text\":\"Maxim Rad is a London based singer songwriter, composer and producer. Over time he evolved into experimental and genre-crossing projects.\\u00a0Rad has recorded six albums. He has worked with renowned producers including Allen Toussaint and Clive Langer\\/Winstanley.\\u00a0Maxim Rad will be performing his latest album Muddy Island Glitch alongside material from his back catalogue, blending traditional song writing with glitch-driven electronics, the Malian ngoni and layered vocal textures. The music bridges traditional roots and forward looking experimentation making for a groovy dance that slowly pulls you into a trance.Rad will perform as a solo act, bringing an intimate and evolving dimension to the work.\\u00a0Social Mediahttps:\\/\\/maximrad.bandcamp.com\\/https:\\/\\/open.spotify.com\\/album\\/4cDP4CEbDEnl9kluEIxzIohttps:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@musicinhatshttps:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/maximrad_original\\/\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/246201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"113\"],\"search\":\"Maxim Rad: Live at Riverside Studios Maxim Rad: Live at Riverside Studios Music  <p><strong>Maxim Rad <\\/strong>is a London based singer songwriter, composer and producer. Over time he evolved into experimental and genre-crossing projects.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Rad has recorded six albums. He has worked with renowned producers including Allen Toussaint and Clive Langer\\/Winstanley.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Maxim Rad will be performing his latest album <i>Muddy Island Glitch<\\/i> alongside material from his back catalogue, blending traditional song writing with glitch-driven electronics, the Malian ngoni and layered vocal textures. The music bridges traditional roots and forward looking experimentation making for a groovy dance that slowly pulls you into a trance.<\\/p><p>Rad will perform as a solo act, bringing an intimate and evolving dimension to the work.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Social Media<\\/strong><\\/p><p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maximrad.bandcamp.com\\/\\\">https:\\/\\/maximrad.bandcamp.com\\/<\\/a><\\/p><p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/open.spotify.com\\/album\\/4cDP4CEbDEnl9kluEIxzIo\\\">https:\\/\\/open.spotify.com\\/album\\/4cDP4CEbDEnl9kluEIxzIo<\\/a><\\/p><p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@musicinhats\\\">https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@musicinhats<\\/a><\\/p><p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/maximrad_original\\/\\\">https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/maximrad_original\\/<\\/a><\\/p> Maxim Rad: Live at Riverside Studios  Maxim Rad is a London based singer songwriter, composer and producer. Over time he evolved into experimental and genre-crossing projects.\\u00a0Rad has recorded six albums. He has worked with renowned producers including Allen Toussaint and Clive Langer\\/Winstanley.\\u00a0Maxim Rad will be performing his latest album Muddy Island Glitch alongside material from his back catalogue, blending traditional song writing with glitch-driven electronics, the Malian ngoni and layered vocal textures. The music bridges traditional roots and forward looking experimentation making for a groovy dance that slowly pulls you into a trance.Rad will perform as a solo act, bringing an intimate and evolving dimension to the work.\\u00a0Social Mediahttps:\\/\\/maximrad.bandcamp.com\\/https:\\/\\/open.spotify.com\\/album\\/4cDP4CEbDEnl9kluEIxzIohttps:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/@musicinhatshttps:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/maximrad_original\\/ Music\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/uPE-kick-the-door-down-bts-development-night\\/\",\"id\":\"4085\",\"name\":\"Kick The Door Down: BTS Development Night\",\"title\":\"Kick The Door Down: BTS Development Night\",\"duration\":\"70 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":false,\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1794009600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/257001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1794078000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1794009600],\"times\":[1794078000],\"start_date\":\"1794078000\",\"end_date\":\"1794078000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"NU5ubnRqZCszTDdkNUxsM0tid2c5QT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 7 Nov 2026\",\"text\":\"In an industry full of slamming doors, we create paid opportunities for excellent emerging writers &amp; actors. Over 3 months, our&nbsp;writers &amp;&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/28\\/1872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0\\/w320\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx76\\/cy1\\/cw159\\/ch159\\/images\\/uploads\\/281872abeb28b590a79c36b6435260e0.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":[\"50.4\",\"45.6\"],\"search_text\":\"In an industry full of slamming doors, we create paid opportunities for excellent emerging writers & actors. Over 3 months, our\\u00a0writers & their teams will develop a new piece of writing through a series of performances with peer review, professional feedback & showcases with industry panels.This is our second performance:\\u00a0BTS Development Night with feedback from Natalie Denton (BIFA voter and BAFTA Connect Member & Development Producer at The Pleasance).This community created by Claudia Vyvyan & Oli Fyne offers a supportive & accessible programme for London theatre makers to develop their work. Providing meaningful support for emerging artists is at the heart of our community-building efforts. Thanks to our Arts Council National Lottery Project Grant, we are proud to make this a paid and sustainable opportunity for our participants.No more waiting for the phone to ring or sitting twiddling thumbs - We are taking things into our own hands, our own pens, our own space...It\\u2019s time to KICK THE DOOR DOWN! \\ud83d\\udca5\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/257001\\/\",\"search\":\"Kick The Door Down: BTS Development Night Kick The Door Down: BTS Development Night   <p>In an industry full of slamming doors, we create paid opportunities for excellent emerging writers &amp; actors. Over 3 months, our&nbsp;writers &amp; their teams will develop a new piece of writing through a series of performances with peer review, professional feedback &amp; showcases with industry panels.<\\/p><p>This is our second performance:&nbsp;<strong>BTS Development Night with feedback from Natalie Denton <\\/strong>(BIFA voter and BAFTA Connect Member &amp; Development Producer at The Pleasance).<\\/p><p>This community created by Claudia Vyvyan &amp; Oli Fyne offers a supportive &amp; accessible programme for London theatre makers to develop their work. Providing meaningful support for emerging artists is at the heart of our community-building efforts. Thanks to our Arts Council National Lottery Project Grant, we are proud to make this a paid and sustainable opportunity for our participants.<\\/p><p>No more waiting for the phone to ring or sitting twiddling thumbs - We are taking things into our own hands, our own pens, our own space...<\\/p><p>It\\u2019s time to <strong>KICK THE DOOR DOWN! <\\/strong>\\ud83d\\udca5<\\/p> Kick The Door Down: BTS Development Night  In an industry full of slamming doors, we create paid opportunities for excellent emerging writers & actors. Over 3 months, our\\u00a0writers & their teams will develop a new piece of writing through a series of performances with peer review, professional feedback & showcases with industry panels.This is our second performance:\\u00a0BTS Development Night with feedback from Natalie Denton (BIFA voter and BAFTA Connect Member & Development Producer at The Pleasance).This community created by Claudia Vyvyan & Oli Fyne offers a supportive & accessible programme for London theatre makers to develop their work. Providing meaningful support for emerging artists is at the heart of our community-building efforts. Thanks to our Arts Council National Lottery Project Grant, we are proud to make this a paid and sustainable opportunity for our participants.No more waiting for the phone to ring or sitting twiddling thumbs - We are taking things into our own hands, our own pens, our own space...It\\u2019s time to KICK THE DOOR DOWN! \\ud83d\\udca5\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/SR-are-you-even-indian\\/\",\"id\":\"2393\",\"name\":\"Are You Even Indian?\",\"title\":\"Are You Even Indian?\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1794873600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/146201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1794944700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1794960000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\