   <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                   \r\n                  <div class=\"template-surtitle font-yellow font-uppercase font-tag font-title\">Cinema</div>  \r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Cactus Pears + Recorded Director Q&A</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                                <div class=\"age-rating r-15\" title=\"15\"></div>\r\n                                              <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Fri 10 Jul 20:15 - Sun 12 Jul 2026 20:15</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"RjJWcXYyN1ZSb2hTV1MyMDZJTGYrUT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <h3>RIVERSIDE PRIDE Film Season July 2026: enjoy 15% off adult and concessions ticket price offer if you buy more than one ticket to the season in the same order!</h3><p><i>LOVE ME TENDER (SPECIAL PREVIEW)</i> - From 3 July</p><p><i>PORTRAIT OF A LADY ON FIRE (RE-RELEASE</i> ) - From 3 July</p><p><i>THE BIRDCAGE (30TH ANNIVERSARY)</i> - From 4 July</p><p><i>CACTUS PEARS </i>- From 10 July</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>We are delighted that director Rohan Parashuram Kanawade has recorded a Q&amp;A for us, which you can see after the end credits finish.</strong></h3><p><strong>WINNER: WORLD CINEMA GRAND JURY PRIZE - SUNDANCE FILM FESTIVAL</strong></p><blockquote><p>\"A tender queer Indian drama born of grief\" - Variety</p><p>\"[a] tender and subtle story of forbidden love and a poignant awakening in India” ★★★★ Guardian</p></blockquote><p>Set in rural Maharashtra, <i><strong>Cactus Pears</strong></i> follows Anand (Bhushaan Manoj), a Mumbai call-centre worker who returns to his ancestral village to observe the ten-day mourning ritual following his father’s death.</p><p>While navigating the pressures of family expectations and marriage, he reconnects with Balya (Suraaj Suman), a childhood friend facing similar struggles.</p><p>Over the course of the mourning period, their bond deepens into a tender and intimate relationship, creating a quiet exploration of grief, identity and queer love within a traditional rural community.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Age Rating:</strong></td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Language:</strong></td><td>Marathi with English subtitles</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Content Warnings:</strong></td><td>strong language and nudity</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Director:</strong></td><td>Rohan Parashuram Kanawade</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cast:</strong></td><td>Bhushaan Manoj, Suraaj Suman, Jayshri Jagtap</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Company:</strong></td><td>Lotus Visual Productions</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Trailers:</strong></td><td>20 mins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Year of Release:</strong></td><td>2026</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">114 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n        \n\n<section class=\"block block-events-list\">\n\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"block-header has-button\">\n            <div class=\"block-header-left\">\n            <h3 class=\"block-title font-medium font-title font-uppercase font-blue\"><span>Upcoming Cinema</span>\r\n</h3>\n                                </div>\n                      \n          </div>\n            <div class=\"grid\">\n          \n\n<div class=\"grid-item event\">\n  <div class=\"slot event\">\n    \n          <div class=\"slot-image\">\n        <a href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/hr-the-invite/\">\n        <div class=\"image-container\">\n                            <picture>\n                  <source sizes=\"(min-width: 1780px) calc(-4.1vw + 484px), (min-width: 1240px) calc(22.12vw + 23px), (min-width: 780px) calc(27.5vw - 21px), (min-width: 460px) 375px, calc(76.43vw + 39px)\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/4d/8da94b4c5c654e2c977b1fd0bdbe66/w400/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/4d8da94b4c5c654e2c977b1fd0bdbe66.webp 400w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/4d/8da94b4c5c654e2c977b1fd0bdbe66/w500/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/4d8da94b4c5c654e2c977b1fd0bdbe66.webp 500w,https://riverside