            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Alpha | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Please note there will be a 10 minute interval at the midway point of this film.Welcome to the newest chapter of the YRF Spy Universe that presents an edgy origin story of a girl raised and built to kill. Alpha is a female-led action film that will take y\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Alpha\",\"description\":\"Please note there will be a 10 minute interval at the midway point of this film.Welcome to the newest chapter of the YRF Spy Universe that presents an edgy origin story of a girl raised and built to kill. Alpha is a female-led action film that will take you on a fun, edge of the seat, thrilling ride that is designed as an out and out entertainer.Produced by Aditya Chopra and directed by Shiv Rawail, acclaimed for the globally celebrated series The Railway Men.Age Rating:15Language:Hindi with subtitlesContent Warnings:strong violence, injury detailDirector:Shiv RawailCast:Alia Bhatt, Sharvari, Madhavan, Anil Kapoor, Bobby DeolCompany:Yash Raj FilmsTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:2026\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/303fed538b5ea2786cbce35d056e28dc.PNG\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-07-11T19:50:00+01:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-07-14T17:40:00+01:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https