            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Kids' Club: The Super Mario Galaxy Movie | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie finds Mario and Luigi solving everyday problems in the Mushroom Kingdom with their \"let's-a-go\" attitude. They meet a new friend in Yoshi, try to reform a miniaturized Bowser, and eagerly look forward to Peach's birthday party\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Kids' Club: The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"description\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie finds Mario and Luigi solving everyday problems in the Mushroom Kingdom with their \\\"let's-a-go\\\" attitude. They meet a new friend in Yoshi, try to reform a miniaturized Bowser, and eagerly look forward to Peach's birthday party. A call for help sends the crew across the galaxy to face new worlds, unexpected threats, and iconic characters like Rosalina and Bowser Jr.Age Rating:PGLanguage:EnglishContent Warnings:mild violence, threatDirector:Aaron Horvath &amp; Michael JelenicCast:Chris Pratt, Anya Taylor-Joy, Brie Larson, Virginia Dare Jelenic, Benny Safdie, Kevin Michael Richardson, Charlie Day, Donald Glover, Keegan-Michael Key, Eric BauzaCompany:UniversalTrailers:20 minsYear of Release:2026Audio Described:Yes\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/a4d5aa61016f8953212cec3e0870eab3.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-07-25T10:30:00+01:00\",\"