              <div class=\"template-surtitle font-yellow font-uppercase font-tag font-title\">Cinema</div>  \r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Spartacus</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                                <div class=\"age-rating r-pg\" title=\"PG\"></div>\r\n                                              <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Sat 25 - Tue 28 Jul 2026</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"T2p3ZXdRRVQrYTlYcHNQaFRLcHlyZz09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p>As master filmmaker Christopher Nolan finally reveals his ambitious take on Homer's epic <i>THE ODYSSEY</i> this July, travel back with us through the ages to explore how other filmmakers have drawn on the ancient myths of yesterday to forge groundbreaking big screen entertainment. Enjoy a multi-buy offer for all films in the <strong>MYTHS AND MONSTERS</strong> season with 15% off adult and concession prices if more than one ticket is purchased in same order.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>MYTHS AND MONSTERS </strong>classic film season at Riverside Studios:</p><p><i>Clash of the Titans</i> (1981): 18th-20th July</p><p><i>Spartacus</i> (1960): 25-28th July</p><p><i>Troy </i>(2004): 1st-3rd August</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>SPARTACUS </strong></i><strong>(1960)</strong></p><blockquote><p>\"One of the greatest Hollywood epics\" - Guardian Film</p></blockquote><p>Future <i>2001: A Space Odyssey</i> director Stanley Kubrick teamed up with acting titan Kirk Douglas to deliver one of the most beloved films in the 'swords and sandals' mode in <i><strong>SPARTACUS</strong></i>. The film earned six Academy Award nominations and won four of them.</p><p>The rebellious Thracian Spartacus (Douglas), born and raised a slave, is sold to Gladiator trainer Batiatus. After weeks of being trained to kill for the arena, Spartacus turns on his owners and leads the other slaves in rebellion. As the rebels move from town to town, their numbers swell as escaped slaves join their ranks. Under the leadership of Spartacus, they make their way to southern Italy, where they will cross the sea and return to their homes.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Age Rating:</strong></td><td>PG</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Language:</strong></td><td>English</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Content Warnings:</strong></td><td>Contains moderate violence</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Director:</strong></td><td>Stnaley Kubrick</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cast:</strong></td><td>Kirk Douglas, Laurence Olivier, Jean Simmons, Peter Ustimov</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Company:</strong></td><td>Park Circus</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Trailers:</strong></td><td>20 mins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Year of Release:</strong></td><td>1960</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">196 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n        \n\n<section class=\"block block-events-list\">\n\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"block-header has-button\">\n            <div class=\"block-header-left\">\n            <h3 class=\"block-title font-medium font-title font-uppercase font-blue\"><span>Upcoming Cinema</span>\r\n</h3>\n                                </div>\n                      \n          </div>\n            <div class=\"grid\">\n          \n\n<div class=\"grid-item event\">\n  <div class=\"slot event\">\n    \n          <div class=\"slot-image\">\n        <a href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/hr-the-invite/\">\n        <div class=\"image-container\">\n                            <picture>\n                  <source sizes=\"(min-width: 1780px) calc(-4.1vw + 484px), (min-width: 1240px) calc(22.12vw + 23px), (min-width: 780px) calc(27.5vw - 21px), (min-width: 460px) 375px, calc(76.43vw + 39px)\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/4d/8da94b4c5c654e2c977b1fd0bdbe66/w400/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/4d8da94b4c5c654e2c977b1fd0bdbe66.webp 400w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/4d/8da94b4c5c654e2c977b1fd0bdbe66/w500/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/4d8da94b4c5c654e2c977b1fd0bdbe66.we