nation/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Make a Donation\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Make a Donation                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"nav-item has-sub-nav\">\n    <a  href=\"javascript:void(0);\"  aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title\" title=\"Hire Us / Work With Us\">\n        Hire Us / Work With Us    </a>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav\">\n          <div class=\"container desktop-only-break-1024 sub-nav-inner\">\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-top container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n\n              <div class=\"sub-nav-top-content\">\n                <button class=\"button button-text button-text-back button-back\">Back</button>\n\n                                <div class=\"font-sub-nav-title sub-nav-title  font-title  font-uppercase font-blue\"><span>Hire Us / Work With Us</span>\r\n</div>\n                \n\n                \n                                <div class=\"sub-nav-text font-bold font-xsmall font-blue\">Comprehensive venue information and contact details for those wanting to bring their production to Riverside Studios, to host a private event or to work here. </div>\n                \n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-bottom container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n                            \n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/private-events-and-office-hire/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Private Events and Office Hire\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Private Events and Office Hire                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/bring-a-show-or-workshop/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Bring a Show or Workshop\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Bring a Show or Workshop                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/community-partnership-enquiries/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Community & Partnership Enquiries\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Community & Partnership Enquiries                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"nav-item has-sub-nav\">\n    <a  href=\"javascript:void(0);\"  aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title\" title=\"Bitesize Festival\">\n        Bitesize Festival    </a>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav\">\n          <div class=\"container desktop-only-break-1024 sub-nav-inner\">\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-top container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n\n              <div class=\"sub-nav-top-content\">\n                <button class=\"button button-text button-text-back button-back\">Back</button>\n\n                \n\n                \n                \n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-bottom container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n                            \n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/bitesize-festival/bitesize-festival-2026/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Bitesize Festival 2026\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Bitesize Festival 2026                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/bitesize-festival/bitesize-pass/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Bitesize 50 Pass\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Bitesize 50 Pass                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/bitesize-festival/bitesize-short-film-festival-2026/\" class=\"