\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Tue 22 Sep 2026 19:30</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"QWxla2ZqdXJjeU5sempzbTFWWng3QT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p>Award-winner Sandra Oh (Killing Eve) plays the title role in this razor-sharp reimagining of Molière’s classic dark comedy. &nbsp;</p><p>Telling the truth isn’t always that simple. Alice, a brilliant novelist, despises the carefully constructed lies of modern society. But the more she challenges those around her, the fiercer the backlash becomes. Soon, she must confront the price of speaking her truth in a world that would rather silence her. &nbsp;</p><p>Filmed live on stage at the <strong>National Theatre</strong>, Indhu Rubasingham directs Martin Crimp’s (Cyrano de Bergerac) highly anticipated play.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Age Rating:</strong></td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Language:</strong></td><td>English</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Content Warnings:</strong></td><td>TBC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Director:</strong></td><td>Indhu Rubasingham</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cast:</strong></td><td>Sandra Oh</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Company:</strong></td><td>National Theatre Live</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interval:</strong></td><td>TBC</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Trailers:</strong></td><td>20 mins</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Year of Release:</strong></td><td>2026</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">150 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n        \n\n<section class=\"block block-events-list\">\n\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"block-header has-button\">\n            <div class=\"block-header-left\">\n            <h3 class=\"block-title font-medium font-title font-uppercase font-blue\"><span>Upcoming Cinema</span>\r\n</h3>\n                                </div>\n                      \n          </div>\n            <div class=\"grid\">\n          \n\n<div class=\"grid-item event\">\n  <div class=\"slot event\">\n    \n          <div class=\"slot-image\">\n        <a href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/hr-the-invite/\">\n        <div class=\"image-container\">\n                            <picture>\n                  <source sizes=\"(min-width: 1780px) calc(-4.1vw + 484px), (min-width: 1240px) calc(22.12vw + 23px), (min-width: 780px) calc(27.5vw - 21px), (min-width: 460px) 375px, calc(76.43vw + 39px)